{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":15,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":397,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1892542,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282681,"Name":"Shaylala","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"StartDate":1428627152,"LastPoster":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1892830,"PostDate":1428857751,"PostContent":"\u00a0 this seems really high for Now Jade. I'm surprised. Definitely shop around and maybe play arou...","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359763104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.192.130.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79042,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62de75cebef413854a8df743108651f1","RawContent":"we are really trying to make it between $1000-1200 for our guests. it&#039;s limiting some of the nicer resorts but we&#039;ve found 2 that are a possibility. and we&#039;re going semi off season to lower costs too. \n\n\nsome of his family just simply wouldn&#039;t spend even half of that on a vacation normally, while my family would normally spend twice that. this is definitely the most stressful part about the whole thing!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892685,"PostDate":1428695901,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                we are really trying to make it between $1000-1200 for our guests. it's limiting some of the nicer resorts but we've found 2 that are a possibility. and we're going semi off season to lower costs too. <br><br>\nsome of his family just simply wouldn't spend even half of that on a vacation normally, while my family would normally spend twice that. this is definitely the most stressful part about the whole thing!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaspbri0317@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.58.144.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1296688027,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jaspbri0317","Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79042,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87b2404fbb5cea69c23e358f8806acea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;this is totally the hard part! We wanted to keep it at $1500 for guests but ended up at $1700. A few people have said they can&#039;t afford to go, but you can&#039;t please everyone, so that&#039;s ok with us. Even if you have a wedding at home some people might not be able to make it. It&#039; just the way things go.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;d say find a travel agent and let her do most of the research. We had a list of things we wanted, that and our budget kind of limited our resorts and then we made a decision from there, but then we were flexible on the date. The travel agent actually came up with two resorts and we picked one. You will seriously go insane trying to tackle this whole research on your own.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Like some of the other girls have mentioned, Jamaica can be a bit more on the pricy side but it doesn&#039;t mean you can&#039;t find anything. It&#039;s just a matter of finding out whether what you get for your budget is what you want and if not what is going to give (either you have to raise the budget, or settle for a hotel that might not have everything you want, or switch to a different destination).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892697,"PostDate":1428701553,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>this is totally the hard part! We wanted to keep it at $1500 for guests but ended up at $1700. A few people have said they can't afford to go, but you can't please everyone, so that's ok with us. Even if you have a wedding at home some people might not be able to make it. It' just the way things go.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'd say find a travel agent and let her do most of the research. We had a list of things we wanted, that and our budget kind of limited our resorts and then we made a decision from there, but then we were flexible on the date. The travel agent actually came up with two resorts and we picked one. You will seriously go insane trying to tackle this whole research on your own.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Like some of the other girls have mentioned, Jamaica can be a bit more on the pricy side but it doesn't mean you can't find anything. It's just a matter of finding out whether what you get for your budget is what you want and if not what is going to give (either you have to raise the budget, or settle for a hotel that might not have everything you want, or switch to a different destination).\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359763104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.151.204.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79042,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"2c79ccc4973e60f1ccb4d693b0ab71b1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It really depends where you are flying from and where you are going and when. Mexico is cheaper than Dominican. Our TA found us the best rates in April. We got $1550 for Now Jade (5 star Riviera Maya) in April 2016 from Edmonton and Calgary. Our Toronto prices are around 1200. If you are still looking you can give my TA a try, she was able to have quotes for us within about 15-30 minutes. mbaugh@[member=\"baconkotravels\"].com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892778,"PostDate":1428769196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It really depends where you are flying from and where you are going and when. Mexico is cheaper than Dominican. Our TA found us the best rates in April. We got $1550 for Now Jade (5 star Riviera Maya) in April 2016 from Edmonton and Calgary. Our Toronto prices are around 1200. If you are still looking you can give my TA a try, she was able to have quotes for us within about 15-30 minutes. mbaugh@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"245705\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/245705-baconkotravels\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">baconkotravels<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brookridgecondos@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.151.204.191","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428638375,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"babygirl99","Id":282693,"Name":"babygirl99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.73.72.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79042,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"772f2e72962e023d89e8cbb4661e2221","RawContent":"[quote name=\"babygirl99\" post=\"1892778\" timestamp=\"1428769196\"]\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;It really depends where you are flying from and where you are going and when. Mexico is cheaper than Dominican. Our TA found us the best rates in April. We got $1550 for Now Jade (5 star Riviera Maya) in April 2016 from Edmonton and Calgary. Our Toronto prices are around 1200. If you are still looking you can give my TA a try, she was able to have quotes for us within about 15-30 minutes. mbaugh@[member=\"baconkotravels\"].com&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;[\/quote]\n\nBabygirl99 thank you!\n[quote name=\"babygirl99\" post=\"1892778\" timestamp=\"1428769196\"]\n&amp;amp;lt;p&amp;amp;gt;It really depends where you are flying from and where you are going and when. Mexico is cheaper than Dominican. Our TA found us the best rates in April. We got $1550 for Now Jade (5 star Riviera Maya) in April 2016 from Edmonton and Calgary. Our Toronto prices are around 1200. If you are still looking you can give my TA a try, she was able to have quotes for us within about 15-30 minutes. mbaugh@[member=\"baconkotravels\"].com&amp;amp;lt;\/p&amp;amp;gt;[\/quote]\n\nbabygirl99 I actually just got a quote for Now Jade for first week of May 2016 and it came back at $2100 with taxes!!! Is your $1550 including taxes??  If so that is amazing!!!\nIs your TA out of Calgary?\nThank you so much!! \ud83d\ude04","Attachments":[],"Id":1892783,"PostDate":1428770626,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>babygirl99, on Yesterday, 08:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><p>It really depends where you are flying from and where you are going and when. Mexico is cheaper than Dominican. Our TA found us the best rates in April. We got $1550 for Now Jade (5 star Riviera Maya) in April 2016 from Edmonton and Calgary. Our Toronto prices are around 1200. If you are still looking you can give my TA a try, she was able to have quotes for us within about 15-30 minutes. mbaugh@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"245705\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/245705-baconkotravels\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">baconkotravels<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br><br>\nBabygirl99 thank you!<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>babygirl99, on Yesterday, 08:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><p>It really depends where you are flying from and where you are going and when. Mexico is cheaper than Dominican. Our TA found us the best rates in April. We got $1550 for Now Jade (5 star Riviera Maya) in April 2016 from Edmonton and Calgary. Our Toronto prices are around 1200. If you are still looking you can give my TA a try, she was able to have quotes for us within about 15-30 minutes. mbaugh@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"245705\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/245705-baconkotravels\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">baconkotravels<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br><br>\nbabygirl99 I actually just got a quote for Now Jade for first week of May 2016 and it came back at $2100 with taxes!!! Is your $1550 including taxes??  If so that is amazing!!!<br>\nIs your TA out of Calgary?<br>\nThank you so much!! \ud83d\ude04\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shayla.mcmahon@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"70.73.72.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428547145,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Shaylala","Id":282681,"Name":"Shaylala","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79042,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb5afe9ae694c9c36cf39a590d0040ad","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Shaylala\" post=\"1892783\" timestamp=\"1428770626\"]\n\n\nbabygirl99 I actually just got a quote for Now Jade for first week of May 2016 and it came back at $2100 with taxes!!! Is your $1550 including taxes?? If so that is amazing!!!\nIs your TA out of Calgary?\nThank you so much!![\/quote]\nthis seems really high for Now Jade. I&#039;m surprised. Definitely shop around and maybe play around with different dates if that&#039;s the hotel you want :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1892830,"PostDate":1428857751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Shaylala, on Yesterday, 08:43 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><br><br>\nbabygirl99 I actually just got a quote for Now Jade for first week of May 2016 and it came back at $2100 with taxes!!! Is your $1550 including taxes?? If so that is amazing!!!<br>\nIs your TA out of Calgary?<br>\nThank you so much!! <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>this seems really high for Now Jade. I'm surprised. Definitely shop around and maybe play around with different dates if that's the hotel you want <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1