p;nbsp;we are April 9. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats to everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891082,"PostDate":1427507722,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! \u00a0Curious to know if there are any 2016 Now Larimar couples out there ... \u00a0we are April 9. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats to everyone!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426945785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1428885830","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.99.65.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6b882f311eafc016f4a55887b84f02e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Us! We are traveling the Feb. 13-20th with our wedding on the 18th!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892508,"PostDate":1428607715,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Us! We are traveling the Feb. 13-20th with our wedding on the 18th!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alison.hardy1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.99.65.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422374723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281894.jpg?_r=1422907392","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hardyali","Id":281894,"Name":"hardyali","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.65.74.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32cf9aaaf3b3c4e6196efa23d147f9d7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"hardyali\" post=\"1892508\" timestamp=\"1428607715\"]\nUs! We are traveling the Feb. 13-20th with our wedding on the 18th![\/quote]Congrats!  I saw your post in the other thread about venting ... I totally get it. It took about 10 days to receive the information from the wedding planner after we paid our deposit. I&#039;ve since asked a few questions in response and have been waiting almost another week. \nI&#039;m so glad I started planning early or this would be making my eye twitch!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892596,"PostDate":1428665239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>hardyali, on 09 April 2015 - 11:28 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Us! We are traveling the Feb. 13-20th with our wedding on the 18th!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nCongrats!  I saw your post in the other thread about venting ... I totally get it. It took about 10 days to receive the information from the wedding planner after we paid our deposit. I've since asked a few questions in response and have been waiting almost another week. <br>\nI'm so glad I started planning early or this would be making my eye twitch!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426945785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1428885830","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.99.65.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acd0f9c879bb7962db196fdb64d896b4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks you too!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know, I feel so much better about planning early. I finally got the spreadsheet, and now I keep forgetting to use it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We got our boarding pass invitations, so I am making my fianc\u00e9 sit down and send them this weekend!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;good luck to you!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892668,"PostDate":1428685734,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks you too!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know, I feel so much better about planning early. I finally got the spreadsheet, and now I keep forgetting to use it.<\/p>\n<p>We got our boarding pass invitations, so I am making my fianc\u00e9 sit down and send them this weekend!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>good luck to you!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alison.hardy1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.99.65.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422374723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281894.jpg?_r=1422907392","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hardyali","Id":281894,"Name":"hardyali","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78994","Title":"Now Larimar - 2016","LastPostDate":1428685734},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":3,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
