Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.71.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abd9e5b3bff9ae1160c77330edc31b31","RawContent":"Out oot bags will contain:\n\n-A personalized mug for each guest\n\n-2 candles decorated with burlap, ribbon and starfish\n\n- a deck of personalized playing cards\n\n-a letter from us thanking them for coming\n\n- a do not disturb door hanger (personalized for the wedding)\n\n-ugly fabric for people to tie on their luggage (so others with the wedding can help pull luggage off the carousel) \n\n-dryer sheets (I&#039;ve never been to this resort before but I&#039;ve had musty rooms at other resorts.. I put a dryer sheet in the a\/c unit to freshen the air up)\n\n-an itinerary \n\n-map of the resort (got a PDF of one from Carolina.. Not the best but it gives people an idea of what the resort is like) \n\n\nI am going to be at the airport first so that I can give everyone their bags before they check their luggage.. That way they can put the fabric on their checked bags and I don&#039;t have to carry all the bags all the way down there... They can carry their own lol.  \n\n\nThe checklist is the same as the original excel one she sent us.. Plus you need to send her all the names of the people coming to the wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":1878934,"PostDate":1416680101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Out oot bags will contain:<br>\n-A personalized mug for each guest<br>\n-2 candles decorated with burlap, ribbon and starfish<br>\n- a deck of personalized playing cards<br>\n-a letter from us thanking them for coming<br>\n- a do not disturb door hanger (personalized for the wedding)<br>\n-ugly fabric for people to tie on their luggage (so others with the wedding can help pull luggage off the carousel) <br>\n-dryer sheets (I've never been to this resort before but I've had musty rooms at other resorts.. I put a dryer sheet in the a\/c unit to freshen the air up)<br>\n-an itinerary <br>\n-map of the resort (got a PDF of one from Carolina.. Not the best but it gives people an idea of what the resort is like) <br><br>\nI am going to be at the airport first so that I can give everyone their bags before they check their luggage.. That way they can put the fabric on their checked bags and I don't have to carry all the bags all the way down there... They can carry their own lol.  <br><br>\nThe checklist is the same as the original excel one she sent us.. Plus you need to send her all the names of the people coming to the wedding.  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa_shallow@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.100.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411084807,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279896.jpg?_r=1422196653","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mels84","Id":279896,"Name":"Mels84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.231.76.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7769a46635abb72baa4f41bba15a6696","RawContent":"@[member=\"Mels84\"] I have a great copy of the map I found here &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.palladiumaddict.net\/file_download\/418\/1557491_565221980237137_336171618_n_zps56b3e3b8.jpg\"&gt;http:\/\/www.palladiumaddict.net\/file_download\/418\/1557491_565221980237137_336171618_n_zps56b3e3b8.jpg&lt;\/a&gt; \n\n\nI don&#039;t know if you already have it printed yet or not\n\n\nI just booked my wedding yesterday for Nov 2015....we were planning for April but had to postpone...can&#039;t wait to get back on here and start planning !!!!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1878938,"PostDate":1416688713,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279896-mels84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mels84<\/span><\/a> I have a great copy of the map I found here <a href='http:\/\/www.palladiumaddict.net\/file_download\/418\/1557491_565221980237137_336171618_n_zps56b3e3b8.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.palladium...zps56b3e3b8.jpg<\/a> <br><br>\nI don't know if you already have it printed yet or not<br><br>\nI just booked my wedding yesterday for Nov 2015....we were planning for April but had to postpone...can't wait to get back on here and start planning !!!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1365792059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"135.23.201.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69abf625694c9c06098f11873666c9ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh my gosh... I just found these garters and am a little embarassed at how excited I am...&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/188624658\/fall-sale-white-lace-handmade-wedding%C2%A0&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/188624658\/fall-sale-white-lace-handmade-wedding&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878939,"PostDate":1416689006,"PostContent":null,"Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391395223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.95.129.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbe606fee7e2a0ea4361cd48191a1ba7","RawContent":"@[member=\"Meandhim\"]. Thanks for the link!  Congrats on booking!  So exciting!! \n\n\n@[member=\"Kerrierf\"]. Lol!  I love etsy!  You can find so many cool things.. I ordered all the bridesmaid\/groomsman\/parent gifts from there.. Plus I found really cool flowers for my hair and my garters too!  Oh and my cake topper too!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1878940,"PostDate":1416690923,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268499\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/268499-meandhim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Meandhim<\/span><\/a>. Thanks for the link!  Congrats on booking!  So exciting!! <br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276456\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276456-kerrierf\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kerrierf<\/span><\/a>. Lol!  I love etsy!  You can find so many cool things.. I ordered all the bridesmaid\/groomsman\/parent gifts from there.. Plus I found really cool flowers for my hair and my garters too!  Oh and my cake topper too!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa_shallow@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.100.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411084807,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279896.jpg?_r=1422196653","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mels84","Id":279896,"Name":"Mels84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.231.76.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cf23b58e4ff6952e935f969312ce1fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@ Mel84 You wedding is so CLOSE!! How exciting!! I think I&#039;m going to order my earrings from Etsy...I have really just started so I&#039;m sure I&#039;ll find so much more to buy! Look out Boxing Day Sales!!!! woohooo&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Kerrierf\"] Love the Garter!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"shevette925\"] your date is just before mine! I&#039;ll be interested to see how your planning is going??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are all of you guys doing a legal wedding? we are planning to do a renewal...and just get married a few weeks before we go...this will save a bit of money...but also my Nan cannot get travel insurance to travel out of Canada anymore and I want her to be involved...she will be my witness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My problem is that this package is not well described like the Karen Bussen Packages...it says I have decorations but it doesn&#039;t say what...and does anyone know what the decorations are like for the reception? If anyone has information from Carolina about extras: DJ, Makeup, Decor Flowers? Etc. And are any of you guys thinking of having a private reception and using DJ mania?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m so excited I&#039;m thinking of 100 things at once!! EEEEEE!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878953,"PostDate":1416700227,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@ Mel84 You wedding is so CLOSE!! How exciting!! I think I'm going to order my earrings from Etsy...I have really just started so I'm sure I'll find so much more to buy! Look out Boxing Day Sales!!!! woohooo<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276456\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276456-kerrierf\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kerrierf<\/span><\/a> Love the Garter!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279050\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279050-shevette925\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">shevette925<\/span><\/a> your date is just before mine! I'll be interested to see how your planning is going??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are all of you guys doing a legal wedding? we are planning to do a renewal...and just get married a few weeks before we go...this will save a bit of money...but also my Nan cannot get travel insurance to travel out of Canada anymore and I want her to be involved...she will be my witness.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My problem is that this package is not well described like the Karen Bussen Packages...it says I have decorations but it doesn't say what...and does anyone know what the decorations are like for the reception? If anyone has information from Carolina about extras: DJ, Makeup, Decor Flowers? Etc. And are any of you guys thinking of having a private reception and using DJ mania?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm so excited I'm thinking of 100 things at once!! EEEEEE!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1365792059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.48.71.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"615f47c6ab9dddf014696f1640a6afea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey ladies,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So sorry I have been MIA for so long. Things have been very busy &amp;nbsp;but we have been very productive. I found a dress and we have about 60 confirmed guest at this point which is amazing. All of my friends think I am crazy because we have been doing things so early lol. &amp;nbsp;We are also doing a symbolic ceremony like @[member=\"Meandhim\"].&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where I am stuck right now is the photographer. What are you guys doing? &amp;nbsp;it is 500 dollars to have an outside vendor to come to the hotel which is crazy! but it is one of the few things that we are okay with paying a bit more for. Is there a website for the hotel photographer?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mels84\"], the big day is coming up soon. Can&#039;t wait to hear how it goes for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878957,"PostDate":1416717711,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So sorry I have been MIA for so long. Things have been very busy \u00a0but we have been very productive. I found a dress and we have about 60 confirmed guest at this point which is amazing. All of my friends think I am crazy because we have been doing things so early lol. \u00a0We are also doing a symbolic ceremony like @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268499\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/268499-meandhim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Meandhim<\/span><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where I am stuck right now is the photographer. What are you guys doing? \u00a0it is 500 dollars to have an outside vendor to come to the hotel which is crazy! but it is one of the few things that we are okay with paying a bit more for. Is there a website for the hotel photographer?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279896-mels84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mels84<\/span><\/a>, the big day is coming up soon. Can't wait to hear how it goes for you.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunte.henry@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.48.71.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405604630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"shevette925","Id":279050,"Name":"shevette925","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"135.23.201.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c954d331cf974cac29fcf613c7994be1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So exciting to see how much progress everyone is making! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"shevette925\"] I&#039;m with you about getting things done ahead of time! It&#039;s key to being able to relax and actually enjoy the process instead of stressing over it all.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our photographer is one of our guests. &amp;nbsp;My cousin is a professional photographer and her and her husband do amazing work. &amp;nbsp;We did our engagement shoot with them and had so much fun that we really wanted them to do our wedding too. &amp;nbsp;We&#039;re paying for their trip, but it&#039;s actually cheaper, or at least comparable, to getting an outside photographer there (I wasn&#039;t too fond of their suggested vendor:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.photoshopcaribe.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.photoshopcaribe.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;). &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Meandhim\"] we&#039;re doing a legal ceremony. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s more of a hassle (with translating the documents and everything) but I didn&#039;t want to do a legal ceremony at home and another ceremony elsewhere.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What package are you doing? I didn&#039;t know there were other ones. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ll paste the info I have for \"extras\" - but it&#039;s a pain to navigate (I&#039;m with ya!).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Price list for extra services 2015&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wedding day&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Musical trio: US$ 160. (45 min.)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Horse &amp;amp; carriage US$ 160&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Bride`s and Groom wedding clothes steamed (with 1 day notice)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Extra fee for the wedding officiant and all the administrative costs for Civil or Catholic weddings :US$ 600&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Red carpet: US$ 160&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 White Carpet: US$ 120&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amenities&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Bathrobes: US$ 45 (Price per unit)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Sunset Wine and Cheese for two: US$ 84&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Honeymoon Sunset: US$ 35&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Honeymoon Sunrise: US$ 25&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Just Married Flip Flops: US$ 20 (Price per pair)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Bridesmaids&#039; Tea Party: US$ 120 (services for maximum 12 people)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Groom&#039;s Lounge: US$ 240 (services for maximum 12 people)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Colorful Paper Fans: US$ 5 (Price per unit)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Pretty Paper Parasols: 10 (Price per unit)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Simple Stunning Sexy Kit: US$ 60&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Strawberries covered with chocolate US$ 27 ( 12 pieces)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 We prepare your Jacuzzi with flowers, candles and the type of aroma you prefer. Imagine you and your&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;beloved watching the sunset... An unforgetable moment. US$ 48&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Day\/Night pass: US$ 65 per person&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Reception&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Based on availability.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Rent of the restaurant - exclusivity\/based on availability, will be reconfirm upon arrival, places and prices&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;subject to change. : US$ 1.060 (from 6:30pm until 11:30 pm)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Open bar: US$ 16 per person during 3 hours,&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 4 hours MC, Professional DJ, DJ Booth, Sound System, Wireless Microphone, Robotic Lights, and White&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Balloons: US$ 900&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Live Band: US$ 1000 during 3 Hours&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Dinner on the beach&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Apply for groups with more than 25 guests, based on weather conditions and availability&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Price per person: between US$ 40 and US$ 60 per person, (about the menu, please contact your wedding&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;coordinator for more information)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 4 hours MC, Professional DJ, DJ Booth, Sound System, Wireless Microphone, Robotic Lights, and White&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Balloons: US$ 900&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Live Band: US$ 1000 during 3 Hours&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Open bar: US$ 16 per person during 3 hours.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Private Beach Bash&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Included for up to 25 people, for two hours: US$ 1.400&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Stylish Lounge Seating area&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Glowing Paper Lanterns&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Private Bar with Bartender&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Sound system (speakers and microphone)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 2 Pairs of \u201cJust-Married\u201d Flip Flops for the Bride and Groom&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 After-Party Snacks&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 For more than 25 people, please consult wedding coordinator for price. Based on weather conditions&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 ** Based on availability&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\u2022 Upgrade for a Professional DJ, DJ Booth, Sound System, Wireless Microphone, Robotic Lights, and White&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Balloons: US$ 900&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridesmaids Bouquets&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;1. Lily Posy: US$ 30 each&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;2. Mixed Posy: US$ 40 each&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;3. Hydrangea Posy: US$ 50 each&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;4. Tropical Posy: US$ 55 each&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;5. Dendrobium Posy: US$ 60 each&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flower Creations&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;1. Boutonniere with Pink Gerber: US$ 12&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;2. Boutonniere with Red Gerber: US$ 12&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;3. Boutonniere with White Gerber: US$ 12&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;4. Boutonniere with Green Cymbidium: US$ 15&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;5. Flower Girl Crown: US$ 55&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;6. Flower Girl Basket: US$ 45&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;7. Wrist Corsage with white roses: US$ 45&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;8. Rose petals bag: US$ 20 per bag&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;9. Rose petals carpet: US$ 300&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flowers for the Hair *Price per flower,*&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;1. White Gerber: US$ 10&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;2. Fucsia Gerber : US$ 10&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;3. Red Gerber: US$ 10&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;4. White Dendrobium: US$ 15&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;5. Yellow Cymbidium: US$ 15&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;6. Green Cymbidium: US$ 15&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;7. White Cymbidium: US$ 15&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;8. Pink Cymbidium: US$ 15&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;9. White Rose: US$ 10&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;10. Red Rose: US$ 10&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;11. Pink Rose: US$ 10&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;12. Orange Rose: US$ 10&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;13. Orange Lilie: US$ 12&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;14. White Lilie: US$ 12&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;15. Pink Lilie: US$ 12&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridal Bouquets * For upgrade *&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;1. Princess Bride: US$ 280&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;2. Island Bride: US$ 230&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;3. Bride Next Door: US$ 100&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;4. The Sophisticate: US$ 130&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;5. Bohemian Bride: US$ 160&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878969,"PostDate":1416764914,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So exciting to see how much progress everyone is making! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279050\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279050-shevette925\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">shevette925<\/span><\/a> I'm with you about getting things done ahead of time! It's key to being able to relax and actually enjoy the process instead of stressing over it all.<\/p>\n<p>Our photographer is one of our guests. \u00a0My cousin is a professional photographer and her and her husband do amazing work. \u00a0We did our engagement shoot with them and had so much fun that we really wanted them to do our wedding too. \u00a0We're paying for their trip, but it's actually cheaper, or at least comparable, to getting an outside photographer there (I wasn't too fond of their suggested vendor:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.photoshopcaribe.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.photoshopcaribe.com\/<\/a>). <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268499\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/268499-meandhim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Meandhim<\/span><\/a> we're doing a legal ceremony. \u00a0It's more of a hassle (with translating the documents and everything) but I didn't want to do a legal ceremony at home and another ceremony elsewhere.<\/p>\n<p>What package are you doing? I didn't know there were other ones. \u00a0I'll paste the info I have for \"extras\" - but it's a pain to navigate (I'm with ya!).<\/p><br \/><div><strong>Price list for extra services 2015<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Wedding day<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Musical trio: US$ 160. (45 min.)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Horse & carriage US$ 160<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Bride`s and Groom wedding clothes steamed (with 1 day notice)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Extra fee for the wedding officiant and all the administrative costs for Civil or Catholic weddings :US$ 600<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Red carpet: US$ 160<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 White Carpet: US$ 120<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Amenities<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Bathrobes: US$ 45 (Price per unit)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Sunset Wine and Cheese for two: US$ 84<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Honeymoon Sunset: US$ 35<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Honeymoon Sunrise: US$ 25<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Just Married Flip Flops: US$ 20 (Price per pair)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Bridesmaids' Tea Party: US$ 120 (services for maximum 12 people)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Groom's Lounge: US$ 240 (services for maximum 12 people)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Colorful Paper Fans: US$ 5 (Price per unit)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Pretty Paper Parasols: 10 (Price per unit)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Simple Stunning Sexy Kit: US$ 60<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Strawberries covered with chocolate US$ 27 ( 12 pieces)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 We prepare your Jacuzzi with flowers, candles and the type of aroma you prefer. Imagine you and your<\/div>\n<div>beloved watching the sunset... An unforgetable moment. US$ 48<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Day\/Night pass: US$ 65 per person<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Private Reception<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>Based on availability.<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Rent of the restaurant - exclusivity\/based on availability, will be reconfirm upon arrival, places and prices<\/div>\n<div>subject to change. : US$ 1.060 (from 6:30pm until 11:30 pm)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Open bar: US$ 16 per person during 3 hours,<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 4 hours MC, Professional DJ, DJ Booth, Sound System, Wireless Microphone, Robotic Lights, and White<\/div>\n<div>Balloons: US$ 900<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Live Band: US$ 1000 during 3 Hours<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Private Dinner on the beach<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>Apply for groups with more than 25 guests, based on weather conditions and availability<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Price per person: between US$ 40 and US$ 60 per person, (about the menu, please contact your wedding<\/div>\n<div>coordinator for more information)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 4 hours MC, Professional DJ, DJ Booth, Sound System, Wireless Microphone, Robotic Lights, and White<\/div>\n<div>Balloons: US$ 900<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Live Band: US$ 1000 during 3 Hours<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Open bar: US$ 16 per person during 3 hours.<\/div>\n<div>Private Beach Bash<\/div>\n<div>Included for up to 25 people, for two hours: US$ 1.400<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Stylish Lounge Seating area<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Glowing Paper Lanterns<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Private Bar with Bartender<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Sound system (speakers and microphone)<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 2 Pairs of \u201cJust-Married\u201d Flip Flops for the Bride and Groom<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 After-Party Snacks<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 For more than 25 people, please consult wedding coordinator for price. Based on weather conditions<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 ** Based on availability<\/div>\n<div>\u2022 Upgrade for a Professional DJ, DJ Booth, Sound System, Wireless Microphone, Robotic Lights, and White<\/div>\n<div>Balloons: US$ 900<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Bridesmaids Bouquets<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>1. Lily Posy: US$ 30 each<\/div>\n<div>2. Mixed Posy: US$ 40 each<\/div>\n<div>3. Hydrangea Posy: US$ 50 each<\/div>\n<div>4. Tropical Posy: US$ 55 each<\/div>\n<div>5. Dendrobium Posy: US$ 60 each<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Flower Creations<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\n<div>1. Boutonniere with Pink Gerber: US$ 12<\/div>\n<div>2. Boutonniere with Red Gerber: US$ 12<\/div>\n<div>3. Boutonniere with White Gerber: US$ 12<\/div>\n<div>4. Boutonniere with Green Cymbidium: US$ 15<\/div>\n<div>5. Flower Girl Crown: US$ 55<\/div>\n<div>6. Flower Girl Basket: US$ 45<\/div>\n<div>7. Wrist Corsage with white roses: US$ 45<\/div>\n<div>8. Rose petals bag: US$ 20 per bag<\/div>\n<div>9. Rose petals carpet: US$ 300<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Flowers for the Hair *Price per flower,*<\/strong><\/p>\n<div>1. White Gerber: US$ 10<\/div>\n<div>2. Fucsia Gerber : US$ 10<\/div>\n<div>3. Red Gerber: US$ 10<\/div>\n<div>4. White Dendrobium: US$ 15<\/div>\n<div>5. Yellow Cymbidium: US$ 15<\/div>\n<div>6. Green Cymbidium: US$ 15<\/div>\n<div>7. White Cymbidium: US$ 15<\/div>\n<div>8. Pink Cymbidium: US$ 15<\/div>\n<div>9. White Rose: US$ 10<\/div>\n<div>10. Red Rose: US$ 10<\/div>\n<div>11. Pink Rose: US$ 10<\/div>\n<div>12. Orange Rose: US$ 10<\/div>\n<div>13. Orange Lilie: US$ 12<\/div>\n<div>14. White Lilie: US$ 12<\/div>\n<div>15. Pink Lilie: US$ 12<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Bridal Bouquets * For upgrade *<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\n<div>1. Princess Bride: US$ 280<\/div>\n<div>2. Island Bride: US$ 230<\/div>\n<div>3. Bride Next Door: US$ 100<\/div>\n<div>4. The Sophisticate: US$ 130<\/div>\n<div>5. Bohemian Bride: US$ 160<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391395223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.48.71.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4cedc339009298ed29c53d01817cd4b8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Kerrierf\"] Thanks so much for that link. Yeah, I agree, I am not very impressed by that vendor so we may have to just pay the extra money to get the pictures that we want. Unfortunately we don&#039;t have any guest who are photographers.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878980,"PostDate":1416777264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276456\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276456-kerrierf\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kerrierf<\/span><\/a> Thanks so much for that link. Yeah, I agree, I am not very impressed by that vendor so we may have to just pay the extra money to get the pictures that we want. Unfortunately we don't have any guest who are photographers.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunte.henry@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.48.71.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405604630,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"shevette925","Id":279050,"Name":"shevette925","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00978364c9b70df5442c55ba1e92cbcc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Meandhim\" post=\"1878938\" timestamp=\"1416688713\"]\n@[member=\"Mels84\"] I have a great copy of the map I found here [url=\"http:\/\/www.palladiumaddict.net\/file_download\/418\/1557491_565221980237137_336171618_n_zps56b3e3b8.jpg\"]http:\/\/www.palladiumaddict.net\/file_download\/418\/1557491_565221980237137_336171618_n_zps56b3e3b8.jpg[\/url]\n\nI don&#039;t know if you already have it printed yet or not\n\nI just booked my wedding yesterday for Nov 2015....we were planning for April but had to postpone...can&#039;t wait to get back on here and start planning !!!!\n\n\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nNice to see you back and happy that you finally have been able to put plans together! How exciting! You&#039;ve picked a nice time of the year too! It looks like we&#039;re going to be able to go ahead with our renewal next October so I guess I&#039;ll have some planning to start after the holidays.\n\nGlad everything worked out for you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1878981,"PostDate":1416777565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Meandhim, on 22 November 2014 - 12:38 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279896-mels84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mels84<\/span><\/a> I have a great copy of the map I found here <a href='http:\/\/www.palladiumaddict.net\/file_download\/418\/1557491_565221980237137_336171618_n_zps56b3e3b8.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.palladium...zps56b3e3b8.jpg<\/a><br><br>\nI don't know if you already have it printed yet or not<br><br>\nI just booked my wedding yesterday for Nov 2015....we were planning for April but had to postpone...can't wait to get back on here and start planning !!!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Nice to see you back and happy that you finally have been able to put plans together! How exciting! You've picked a nice time of the year too! It looks like we're going to be able to go ahead with our renewal next October so I guess I'll have some planning to start after the holidays.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Glad everything worked out for you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.159.28.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcc448dc2e9d88b1ae106f441e1a3259","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We got married in Dominican last November and have photographed two other weddings since. The best advice we can give, is to not over think the small stuff, but be as organized as possible before the date gets too close. Most of the time, what you send them before you arrive is never really looked at. They are pro at planning your wedding the day before the main event. Crazy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The hardest part is doing the legal documents (especially if you are born outside of Canada\/US\/UK). Get that done asap, in case of any unforseen issues pop up.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For the OOT bags...oh that was the fun part :) I found that the first aid kits were very much appreciated. I had little canvas bags made up &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/ClementineWeddings?ref=l2-shopheader-name%C2%A0and&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/ClementineWeddings?ref=l2-shopheader-name&amp;nbsp;and&lt;\/a&gt;put in some Tyenol, tums, bandaids and alcohol wipes. Fans, were also very much needed in the heat (I wanted to get some parasols too as they are great for shade and photos, but didn&#039;t have enough room to pack them) We also did the reusable insolated mugs for everyone so their drinks stayed nice and cold. The other hit was little packages of Tide handwash laundry soap from Shoppers. &amp;nbsp;We had beach bags made up from &lt;a&gt;etsy&amp;nbsp;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/WhiteAppleThreads&lt;\/a&gt; that were absolutely amazing for the price. &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As for photographers, this is where I am biased. Dominican photographers have a very different style, so as long as you are happy with it, then you are good to go. If you prefer more documentary photos capturing the full day, bring a photographer from home so that you can build a relationship before leaving. It will also be more reassuring that if anything goes wrong after, you have a contact to get in touch with. Feel free to check out our work at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/oinkandcoo&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/oinkandcoo&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, do not rely on hair and makeup at the resort. Again, very different style to what is seen as natural and beachy...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope this helps :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lauren&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879011,"PostDate":1416791443,"PostContent":null,"Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ask@oinkandcoo.ca","IpAddress":"69.159.28.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416789649,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281237.jpg?_r=1417644452","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"OinkandCoo","Id":281237,"Name":"OinkandCoo","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":125,"TotalPages":13,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":120},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":3,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
