{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":79466,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"IzzyDeee,\n\nBinzster has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wedding Montego bay Jamaica \u263a\ufe0f\".\n\nBinzster said:\n======================================================================\nI'll be looking for ya!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \nActually we did end up going with the Caprice package, want to enjoy everything! I've seen some brooch bouquet, that will be soo pretty. It only cost me about $70 at michaels to buy all the supplies. They would cost way more than that if you were to buy the fresh ones down there.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/> Thats soo funny i was thinking the same thing...about using the bouquets as decor!! Great minds think alike. \n \nWe ended going with the WeddingParty App. Our photographer even ended up joining it, to get a sneak peek at us. Are you going to get one? \n \nThat sux that u were in a car accident... So nice of you to think of setting up the excursions for your guests!\n \nI think Christina is newerbut has still been around for a few years. She's great! I have no problems with her at all. She very direct and to the point, but also has patience when i ask the same question over and over....lol \n \nCan't believe I leave in less than two weeks! Beyond excited!!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\n \nSo what does your dress look like? and did i ask what colour or colours you went with?? \n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9006&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":278902,"Name":"Binzster","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278902.jpg?_r=1427767958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":273,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428874270,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9006},{"Id":79233,"Title":"liked a post you made in Newbie 2016 Bride Jamaica!","Message":"Hello!\n\nbabygirl99 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAnytime! I've been to Jamaica twice before and absolutely love it!! Can't believe we leave in 35 days!! [emoji4] @ Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78332-newbie-2016-bride-jamaica\/?view=findpost&p=1891004\n","Sender":{"Id":282693,"Name":"babygirl99","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428754849,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79108,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nBecomingaRiggio just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWent for my fitting today one more to go!!    Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891034\n","Sender":{"Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428708552,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79004,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nSoon2beMrsJ just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWent for my fitting today one more to go!!    Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891034\n","Sender":{"Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428684523,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78537,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nIt's coming so soon!! [emoji5]\ufe0f[emoji1]  Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892459\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428589289,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78447,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nIt's coming so soon!! [emoji5]\ufe0f[emoji1]  Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892459\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428569249,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78388,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"TinkerSofi\" data-cid=\"1892359\" data-time=\"1428517928\">it's a good idea to ask people a song that they would like, especially those that are older maybe. Although when I went to my friend's wedding she had all new music and the groom's dad did not...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892405\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428534971,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78206,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWhy don't you ask a couple of your guests to write down 3-5 songs they would like to hear? @  @ Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892336\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428503326,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78176,"Title":"liked a post you made in How Involved Is Your Fianc\u00e9...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nMy FI just says \"yes\" or \"no\" to different ideas [emoji13] On my brooch bouquet he had a little thought about putting the flowers in the back which I ended up using; but other than that he just says he likes what I decide!! LOL Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79033-how-involved-is-your-fianc\u00e9-in-the-planning\/?view=findpost&p=1892335\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428500873,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78175,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWhy don't you ask a couple of your guests to write down 3-5 songs they would like to hear? @  @ Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892336\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428500759,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78091,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nSabes44 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWent for my fitting today one more to go!!    Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891034\n","Sender":{"Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428491155,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78065,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Lisa35 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78921-any-ontario-brides-to-be-of-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892290\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nThank you! @\"Lisa35\" and definitely contact him he has been awesome so far and the wedding hasn't even happened yet!! [emoji4]\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n-----------------------------\n\n \n@\"IzzyDeee\", I messaged him on facebook and he told me his fee is $760USD for 4 hours and it doesn't not include the vendor fee. Is that what your paying?\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428487962,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77778,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nsmileitseb just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWent for my fitting today one more to go!!    Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891034\n","Sender":{"Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428413932,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77777,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nsmileitseb just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThought I'd share a picture of my engagement ring with my wedding band that we picked out last week!! [emoji4] Get the real one in another week!  Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1890964\n","Sender":{"Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428413920,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77746,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding Gift For Groom Idea...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm going to be doing a boudoir photo shoot [emoji4] @  Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79030-wedding-gift-for-groom-ideas-share-your-ideas\/?view=findpost&p=1892153\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428409290,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77672,"Title":"liked a post you made in How long did you date befor...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWe dated about 2 years and a bit before we got engaged! We have now had a year and a bit of being engaged since we are doing a destination wedding! [emoji4]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/12665-how-long-did-you-date-before-enagaged\/?view=findpost&p=1891991\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428370569,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77664,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nPicked out our music lists finally!!This is the music I have come up with for the ceremony and parts of the reception :)Wedding Ceremony:Prelude Music (for when guests are getting seated and arranged)~ One Love- Bob Marley, Kiss me or not- Thompson Square, Love me like you do- Ellie Gould...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891901\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428368905,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77657,"Title":"liked a post you made in Kcole123 Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWe agreed to spend 100$ a person for our bridal party's [emoji4] so the watches were a great find at The Bay!! So far I've bought my girls their own beach bags with bathing suit covers aloe Vera gel and floppy hats for beach pictures, as well as 50$ to each girls dress [emoji4] just gotta find so...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78626-kcole123-planning-thread-april-17-2015-melia-caribe-tropical\/?view=findpost&p=1891865\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428368131,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77624,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"perianjay\" data-cid=\"1892063\" data-time=\"1428361892\">@  haha! The other day my parents heard this song.. I don't even know what it is, but it's a much older song. They were like \"oh you should add this to the playlist\" i'm like.. ummmm.. please r...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892076\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428359006,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77570,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892063\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" haha! The other day my parents heard this song.. I don't even know what it is, but it's a much older song. They were like \"oh you should add this to the playlist\" i'm like.. ummmm.. please remember this is all ages and if you're going to pick an older song, that's fine, but at least make it a known one! lol\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428347492,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77569,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThat's exactly what my thoughts were [emoji38] @  Most of us going will be under 30 (I'm 21 and my FI is 25, so a bit of a younger crowd [emoji5]\ufe0f) and there aren't that many older people going, and I don't want to listen to that older stuff all night either [emoji38]Sent from my iPhone using...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892048\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428347435,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77438,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"perianjay\" data-cid=\"1892000\" data-time=\"1428346109\">Nice touch with the watches! Love the variety of music. It's nice that you have picked non traditional music..It's too often that I see the same songs over and over! A nice change <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/block...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1892004\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428332327,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77432,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nPicked out our music lists finally!!This is the music I have come up with for the ceremony and parts of the reception :)Wedding Ceremony:Prelude Music (for when guests are getting seated and arranged)~ One Love- Bob Marley, Kiss me or not- Thompson Square, Love me like you do- Ellie Gould...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891901\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428331750,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77394,"Title":"liked a post you made in May 2015 Brides!","Message":"Hello!\n\nMegg just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nSounds good to me [emoji4] @  ! Feel free to come up to me if you see me [emoji1]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79020-may-2015-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1891955\n","Sender":{"Id":275259,"Name":"Megg","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275259.jpg?_r=1421618186","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428319168,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77361,"Title":"liked a post you made in May 2015 Brides!","Message":"Hello!\n\nMegg just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nMy wedding is at 4pm the 6th so if your there in time check it out [emoji4] @  going to be a fantastic time! [emoji1][emoji267][emoji267][emoji267][emoji267]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79020-may-2015-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1891941\n","Sender":{"Id":275259,"Name":"Megg","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275259.jpg?_r=1421618186","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428305973,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77356,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nPicked out our music lists finally!!This is the music I have come up with for the ceremony and parts of the reception :)Wedding Ceremony:Prelude Music (for when guests are getting seated and arranged)~ One Love- Bob Marley, Kiss me or not- Thompson Square, Love me like you do- Ellie Gould...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891901\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428290909,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77348,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that ashhtayy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78921-any-ontario-brides-to-be-of-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1891946\n\n----------------------------------\n2016, not 2015 so not too soon <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n\nSTDs should arrive this week and will go out next week. \n\nWent dress shopping for the first time this past Thursday. Was able to confirm it is fit and flare I want but definitely didn't find \"the one\". My mum surprised me when we got there with my \"Mrs. Romeo\" hanger.\n\nI ordered our vow books today too. \n\nAlmost finished my bridesmaid proposal boxes - mini champagne, makeup bag with mini toiletries, note pad, hand made cards, luggage tags and passport holder. Waiting for etsy to ship the luggage tag and passport holder. \n\nAnd that's all I've done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Can't wait to start the fun stuff once people start booking. \n\nYou're SO close. I'm jealous!!!!\n@\"IzzyDeee\" ^\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.png?_r=1423373502","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":138,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428278743,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77345,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that ashhtayy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78921-any-ontario-brides-to-be-of-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1891942\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" June 2016 bride from Whitby, Ontario <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.png?_r=1423373502","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":138,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428276451,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77336,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Megg mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79020-may-2015-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1891935\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" we arrive on the 6th! Maybe we will! We will be found mainly at the pool bar lol. Enjoy your honeymoon. Hope your wedding is perfect! We are going to sandals a few days after wedding.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":275259,"Name":"Megg","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275259.jpg?_r=1421618186","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428271542,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77332,"Title":"liked a post you made in Kcole123 Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWe agreed to spend 100$ a person for our bridal party's [emoji4] so the watches were a great find at The Bay!! So far I've bought my girls their own beach bags with bathing suit covers aloe Vera gel and floppy hats for beach pictures, as well as 50$ to each girls dress [emoji4] just gotta find so...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78626-kcole123-planning-thread-april-17-2015-melia-caribe-tropical\/?view=findpost&p=1891865\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428271312,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"241","TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":240},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":29,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
