{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":76864,"Title":"liked a post you made in We Leave For Jamaica In 30...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"perianjay\" data-cid=\"1891687\" data-time=\"1427989482\">I know! I bet it feels so exciting and maybe a bit overwhelming? I have a feeling i'm going to be stressed as it get's much closer, but that's just my OCD and wanting everything to work out. I...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79013-we-leave-for-jamaica-in-30-days\/?view=findpost&p=1891688\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427981060,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76853,"Title":"liked a post you made in We Leave For Jamaica In 30...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI've been planning for so long it's hard to believe it's almost here!! [emoji1] @  Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79013-we-leave-for-jamaica-in-30-days\/?view=findpost&p=1891686\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427975006,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76849,"Title":"liked a post you made in We Leave For Jamaica In 30...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAHHH!! [emoji38] it's coming up so quick!! I think I have everything sorta planned out......but in the rush of this next few weeks I also don't want to forget anything![emoji15][emoji16]What are you ladies planning on doing your last 30 days; or did do? Just wanting to make sure I'm on the righ...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79013-we-leave-for-jamaica-in-30-days\/?view=findpost&p=1891627\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427974437,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76848,"Title":"liked a post you made in Linen Wedding Attire For Men","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThey look really nice on! @  [emoji4] and they also have a grey as well, but since beige looks awesome we went with that [emoji5]\ufe0f! (Especially with the gold, purple, and ivory look we have going for our wedding)Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79010-linen-wedding-attire-for-men\/?view=findpost&p=1891640\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427974335,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76839,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that beckys98 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78500-not-doing-oot-bags\/?view=findpost&p=1891676\n\n----------------------------------\nWe have 70 people as well and we are doing bags (even though I originally said we weren't!) but nothing that is difficult to pack! We're just putting everything in a regular gift bag with a tag and then we have custom collapsible koozies like @\"IzzyDeee\" has above, a hangover kit in a muslin bag stamped \"In Sickness & in Health\", welcome note\/itinerary, and some local food items. We'll go buy snacks and Red Stripes (to put in the koozies) when we arrive.\n \nMy fiance may get mugs for his would-be groomsmen (we don't have a bridal party) but that was just not feasible for a group this size! Hopefully people use the koozies.\n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nWe have like 70 people coming and I want to do OOT bags but FI thinks it'll be a waste of money. I like the Bubba idea and maraca but there's no way I can lug 70 mugs down there!\n-----------------------------\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427969728,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76799,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThis is what I think we will have said for our ceremony:Ceremony\/vows Izabella & Jordan May 6th,2015 Opening We are here today to participate in a most joyous occasion; to celebrate one of the greatest moments in life, by acknowledging the wedding of Izabella and Jordan. This beauti...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891648\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427932346,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76793,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nSure [emoji5]\ufe0f I'll post a couple pics here!   (In the pics it is on its side so normally the hanging beads hang straight down LOL) Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1891503\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427931928,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76778,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThis is what I think we will have said for our ceremony:Ceremony\/vows Izabella & Jordan May 6th,2015 Opening We are here today to participate in a most joyous occasion; to celebrate one of the greatest moments in life, by acknowledging the wedding of Izabella and Jordan. This beauti...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891648\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427928696,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76759,"Title":"liked a post you made in We Leave For Jamaica In 30...","Message":"Hello!\n\nhellosassypants just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nAHHH!! [emoji38] it's coming up so quick!! I think I have everything sorta planned out......but in the rush of this next few weeks I also don't want to forget anything![emoji15][emoji16]What are you ladies planning on doing your last 30 days; or did do? Just wanting to make sure I'm on the righ...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79013-we-leave-for-jamaica-in-30-days\/?view=findpost&p=1891627\n","Sender":{"Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427926918,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76750,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nWow! That's a big cake. Looks great :)The gazebo is really pretty!!\n-----------------------------\n\nI know eh??! A ton bigger than what we ever expected! @  [emoji1][emoji13] I can't wait to get our own pict...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891588\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427926669,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76748,"Title":"liked a post you made in Linen Wedding Attire For Men","Message":"Hello!\n\njsparrow10 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nIf you are a Canadian bride Le chateaux has linen and linen blend suits you can try on there! That's where my FI and uncle got both their outfits! Linen blend suit for my FI:  Full linen suit for my uncle who is walking me down the aisle:  Then the groomsmen are wearing outfits from old n...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79010-linen-wedding-attire-for-men\/?view=findpost&p=1891562\n","Sender":{"Id":278025,"Name":"jsparrow10","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427926559,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76681,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nUgh I know!! I'm probably going to be a bumbling mess! At least we are allowed to cry [emoji23][emoji38] @ Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891595\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427902331,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76678,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nWow! That's a big cake. Looks great :)The gazebo is really pretty!!\n-----------------------------\n\nI know eh??! A ton bigger than what we ever expected! @  [emoji1][emoji13] I can't wait to get our own pict...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891588\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427902149,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76672,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI honestly don't sleep much because I'm just so excited!![emoji1][emoji15] every time I'm close to sleep I think of my dress or seeing Jordan's face the first time he sees me! Gets my heart pounding! Almost as exhilarating as running my horse around the barrel pattern! @  Sent from my iPhone u...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891592\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427901991,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76665,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nWow! That's a big cake. Looks great :)The gazebo is really pretty!!\n-----------------------------\n\nI know eh??! A ton bigger than what we ever expected! @  [emoji1][emoji13] I can't wait to get our own pict...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891588\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427900495,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76657,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"IzzyDeee,\n\nBinzster has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wedding Montego bay Jamaica \u263a\ufe0f\".\n\nBinzster said:\n======================================================================\nFeel free to ask away if you see me! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\n \nThats amazing that u have soo many people going, we have about 30 ppl. For the flowers... I'm just going with the free bouquet for me and the free boutonniere for the fiance. I made my own bouquet's for my bridesmaids and gave them to them to bring down on their own. We also get the flowers for the ceremony for free- I choose the two pedestal's w\/ flower. Im not too worried about the dinner (dont really feel like we need flowers there) and then the party on the beach will be all lit up by white pepper lights and up lighting. \n \nFor the beach party - there is only a $700 set up fee and an open bar charge of $15 pp. You can have a private dinner there as well but it is quite costly. \n \nThat soo great about ur photographer friend!! no worries about missing any moments <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We got one of those wedding Apps for people to upload all of their pictures onto from the week so we can see everyones photos. I cant wait to see them all! and your trash the dress sounds like so much fun! If i can when we get back i would love to do another trash the dress on ATV's in the mud...lol but we'll see...I dont think my mom would like that too much. haha \n \nI also have a welcome dinner set up in the main buffet - free of charge - so the 2 families can get to know eachother. This will be the day after everyone gets there. Are u doing any other events like this? I am also looking into setting up a group excursion for whoever wishes to go, thinking Rick's cafe sunset criuse.... or the caves in Negril. \n \nMy WC is Christina. She is great! how do u find Nekeisha? ive heard mixed things about her... \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9006&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":278902,"Name":"Binzster","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278902.jpg?_r=1427767958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":273,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427899200,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9006},{"Id":76627,"Title":"liked a post you made in Linen Wedding Attire For Men","Message":"Hello!\n\nFutureMrsGlover just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nIf you are a Canadian bride Le chateaux has linen and linen blend suits you can try on there! That's where my FI and uncle got both their outfits! Linen blend suit for my FI:  Full linen suit for my uncle who is walking me down the aisle:  Then the groomsmen are wearing outfits from old n...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79010-linen-wedding-attire-for-men\/?view=findpost&p=1891562\n","Sender":{"Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427893746,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76621,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that moonpalacebride2be mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1891557\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" I actually told them in the beginning that my finance's dad might be shooting our photos (he has a photography business), and I was told that they would still charge us $400 regardless, even though he is staying for 5 nights!  Absolutely ridiculous. They tried to play it off like it is a \"deal\" since otherwise it would be $800.  Yeah, right!  Are you staying at a palace resort (Sorry, I am not familiar with resorts in Jamaica lol)?\n \n@\"Wafflesmom\" thank you for the heads up on stylingtrio- I plan on giving them another week but I have emailed them twice already.  I just wish they wouldn't claim that there is a 24 hour turn-around time if they need more time to respond lol.  THANK YOU for letting me know MVP is also approved!  I will check with my coordinator as well.  I hate how she doesn't give me all of the info- at first she told me that JSAV is the only DJ as well until I inquired about PSAV specifically <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  My coordinator has been great at response times at least, which after reading these threads I did not expect.\n \nI'm so jealous of all of you Canadians that get package deals and free flights!  I will be purchasing flights separately, and we need to buy flights for 2 groomsmen, 2 bridesmaids, and ourselves.  Flights will likely be our biggest expense  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/mellow.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':mellow:' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282426,"Name":"moonpalacebride2be","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282426.jpg?_r=1428942071","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427891047,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76535,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\npddcmc just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@  Wow! That's impressive! Is it heavy?\n-----------------------------\n\nThank you! All the pieces are from people close to me; like my great grandma and great aunt who passed away, and some pieces are from my gr...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1891519\n","Sender":{"Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1418322086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427837441,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76531,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that pddcmc mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1891517\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" Wow! That's impressive! Is it heavy?\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1418322086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427837068,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76530,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\npddcmc just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nSure [emoji5]\ufe0f I'll post a couple pics here!   (In the pics it is on its side so normally the hanging beads hang straight down LOL) Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1891503\n","Sender":{"Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1418322086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427837048,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76514,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that pddcmc mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1891502\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" ooohhhhh! I want to see your brooch bouquet! \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1418322086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427833344,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76508,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that pddcmc mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1891493\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" Thank you! I'll try it  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1418322086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427832389,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76484,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"TinkerSofi\" data-cid=\"1891466\" data-time=\"1427836582\">I love the girls' bouquets <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. I like the first picture of the gazebo and the one with the purple flowers along the aisle! I'm more on the minimal side of decor for the ceremony because the...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891472\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427828199,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76434,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nkrystalball just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWent for my second last fitting [emoji7]    One more in a week or so!! Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891035\n","Sender":{"Id":281820,"Name":"krystalball","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281820.jpg?_r=1428942071","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427817095,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76411,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nMy WC emailed me back today about the decor and a picture of what the cake is like!!  This is the decor that comes with our Royal wedding package: I'm thinking I may add these: (See about getting more of a purple and ivory look though) As well as: I really like the idea of aisle ru...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891432\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427811185,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76311,"Title":"liked a post you made in One Bridesmaid Driving Me N...","Message":"Hello!\n\nnadiakat17 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"JenniferH114\" data-cid=\"1891291\" data-time=\"1427739504\">@IzzyDeee (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282430-izzydeee\/) - So, this probably isn't what you want to hear, but I don't think the situation is as se...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78992-one-bridesmaid-driving-me-nuts-rant\/?view=findpost&p=1891300\n","Sender":{"Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427757996,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76290,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"IzzyDeee,\n\nBinzster has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wedding Montego bay Jamaica \u263a\ufe0f\".\n\nBinzster said:\n======================================================================\nSweet, maybe we'll see you there <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \n \nHow are your other plans going? \n \nWe are having the ceremony on the west beach - away from everyone - and then doing the semi-private dinner. We reserved the beach for the party after dinner. I booked Brian Nejedly for the photographer and doin the trash the dress the day after. He's going to take us to a few local spots around MoBay for that, and he sent me some pics of the locations. They look beautiful!! Who did you end up going with? \n \nJust wanna be on the beach NOW lol\n \nLindsay \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9006&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":278902,"Name":"Binzster","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278902.jpg?_r=1427767958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":273,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427752911,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9006},{"Id":76283,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"IzzyDeee,\n\nBinzster has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wedding Montego bay Jamaica \u263a\ufe0f\".\n\nBinzster said:\n======================================================================\nHey, \n \nSorry I didn't message you back earlier...I've been crazy busy! \n \nKevan's email is, if you still need it, kstewart@reggaetech.com - I've heard he is one the best in Jamaica. \n \nWe are at the RIU from Apr. 25th - May 5th and getting married on Apr. 29th. I see your date is the 6th...When do you arrive?\n \n \nLindsay \n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9006&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":278902,"Name":"Binzster","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278902.jpg?_r=1427767958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":273,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427751573,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9006},{"Id":76256,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI can hardly wait to walk down that aisle!! I think my FI and I are going to do a \"first look\" photo session just before the actual ceremony to get some more intimate pictures! @ Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891338\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427743519,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"249","TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":240},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":37,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
