{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":76256,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI can hardly wait to walk down that aisle!! I think my FI and I are going to do a \"first look\" photo session just before the actual ceremony to get some more intimate pictures! @ Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891338\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427743519,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76227,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@  your dress looks amazing!!!!  It's so nice that you had your make trial and dress fitting at the same time.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\nThank you!I actually did my makeup and extensions myself...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891281\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427737393,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76222,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"TinkerSofi\" data-cid=\"1891267\" data-time=\"1427729429\">so close!!! Sometimes I think my date will never come haha and I don't know what I'm going to do with myself when it does <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. It just feels like I'm playing pretend right now but it's not real...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891268\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427736275,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76221,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLeaving for Jamaica in 32 days!! [emoji1][emoji267][emoji16][emoji5]\ufe0fSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891264\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427736246,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76212,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nMrandMrsBonitto2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWent for my fitting today one more to go!!    Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891034\n","Sender":{"Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427732633,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76184,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThe planning is always fun! Then the special event comes and seems like it just flys by and then it's over! Wish I could prolong the moment, but at least my photographer will do her best to capture the moment and preserve it forever [emoji5]\ufe0f @ Sent from my iPhone using TapatalkOur wedding fa...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891293\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427728427,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76179,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThe planning is always fun! Then the special event comes and seems like it just flys by and then it's over! Wish I could prolong the moment, but at least my photographer will do her best to capture the moment and preserve it forever [emoji5]\ufe0f @ Sent from my iPhone using TapatalkOur wedding fa...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891293\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427727448,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76176,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLeaving for Jamaica in 32 days!! [emoji1][emoji267][emoji16][emoji5]\ufe0fSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891264\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427727400,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76175,"Title":"liked a post you made in One Bridesmaid Driving Me N...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"JenniferH114\" data-cid=\"1891291\" data-time=\"1427739504\">@IzzyDeee (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282430-izzydeee\/) - So, this probably isn't what you want to hear, but I don't think the situation is as se...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78992-one-bridesmaid-driving-me-nuts-rant\/?view=findpost&p=1891300\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427727042,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76166,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThe planning is always fun! Then the special event comes and seems like it just flys by and then it's over! Wish I could prolong the moment, but at least my photographer will do her best to capture the moment and preserve it forever [emoji5]\ufe0f @ Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891293\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427725646,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76152,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@  your dress looks amazing!!!!  It's so nice that you had your make trial and dress fitting at the same time.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\nThank you!I actually did my makeup and extensions myself...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891281\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427720452,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76143,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that veryvalentine mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891277\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" your dress looks amazing!!!!  It's so nice that you had your make trial and dress fitting at the same time.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427719959,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76139,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWent for my fitting today one more to go!!    Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891034\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427719881,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76132,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nBridesmaids shoes:When looking for bridesmaids shoes I wanted to give the girls two options! I went to Payless and the first shoes I grabbed were perfect [emoji108][emoji2]! Since my dress is ivory I wanted the girls to wear ivory shoes since that color would also go great with their dresses. T...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889969\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427715960,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76128,"Title":"liked a post you made in One Bridesmaid Driving Me N...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"veryvalentine\" data-cid=\"1891266\" data-time=\"1427729371\">It's not harsh AT ALL...it's actually all you can do.  You put in so much time planning and so much money to execute your planning that you really can't give too much importance to someone...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78992-one-bridesmaid-driving-me-nuts-rant\/?view=findpost&p=1891269\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427715472,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76124,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"TinkerSofi\" data-cid=\"1891267\" data-time=\"1427729429\">so close!!! Sometimes I think my date will never come haha and I don't know what I'm going to do with myself when it does <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. It just feels like I'm playing pretend right now but it's not real...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891268\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427715303,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76120,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLeaving for Jamaica in 32 days!! [emoji1][emoji267][emoji16][emoji5]\ufe0fSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891264\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427714892,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76109,"Title":"liked a post you made in One Bridesmaid Driving Me N...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsmileitseb just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm sorry to post a rant but I am really upset! Is it just me or is it rude for a bridesmaid who every time something is planned; ie. Bachelorette, bridal shower, pre wedding manicure and shopping dates ext, skips out at the last minute with some lame excuse about how she can't make it based on...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78992-one-bridesmaid-driving-me-nuts-rant\/?view=findpost&p=1891050\n","Sender":{"Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427712819,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76059,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@  haha!! That's the way to do it. I'm going to play it cool until the speeches are done and any talking is finished.. then that's it! haha\n-----------------------------\n\nPretty much!! After our reception is...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891216\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427667751,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76055,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@  haha!! That's the way to do it. I'm going to play it cool until the speeches are done and any talking is finished.. then that's it! haha\n-----------------------------\n\nPretty much!! After our reception is...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891216\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427667262,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76047,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nCute shoes! I'm wearing strappy sandal heels for the reception, but let's be honest.. i'll probably get so drunk that I end up shoeless dancing haha..we've all been there\n-----------------------------\n\nThank...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891212\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427665330,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76036,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI call it my super power [emoji23] @  I put the gel inserts at the balls of my feet so when they sweat a bit they won't slide forward on me! I'm 5'7 so I don't really need it but I'm almost better walking in heels than I am normal shoes!! I think it's because I've been riding horses since I can...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891205\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427649158,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76034,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nFound my reception shoes yesterday!!     My purple shoes are for pictures and the ceremony!! I needed heels that strapped over my foot so they are more secure for dancing for the reception[emoji4]! My FI and I are excellent dancers, (he used to actually be in a dance crew back in the day [emo...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891175\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427648850,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76029,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"TinkerSofi\" data-cid=\"1891184\" data-time=\"1427647828\">I agree! I totally need shoes that grab my foot really well in order to dance <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. Otherwise I find that they hurt more. I love those. I saw them the other day when shopping and they're gorge...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891196\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427648193,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76017,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nFutureMrsGlover just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWent for my fitting today one more to go!!    Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891034\n","Sender":{"Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427640478,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76010,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nFound my reception shoes yesterday!!     My purple shoes are for pictures and the ceremony!! I needed heels that strapped over my foot so they are more secure for dancing for the reception[emoji4]! My FI and I are excellent dancers, (he used to actually be in a dance crew back in the day [emo...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891175\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427633229,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76002,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nYou look so beautiful in your wedding dress!\n-----------------------------\n\nI really feel like cersie off game of thrones in it [emoji38] Thank you @  [emoji5]\ufe0f I feel really beautiful in it !!Sent from...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891151\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427631036,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75998,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nFound my reception shoes yesterday!!     My purple shoes are for pictures and the ceremony!! I needed heels that strapped over my foot so they are more secure for dancing for the reception[emoji4]! My FI and I are excellent dancers, (he used to actually be in a dance crew back in the day [emo...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891175\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427630306,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75972,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that GingerBride mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78992-one-bridesmaid-driving-me-nuts-rant\/?view=findpost&p=1891163\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" that is sad.  Not sure what to do in this situation.  I would hate to see your friendship dissolve after the wedding.  I see two options here... just talk with her, ask her what's up?  Perhaps she should just be a guest at your wedding and not a bride's maid.  It would be uncomfortable for you and her when you are doing your thank you speech and you mention all the people that have helped you out and she is the one bride's maid that you leave out.  \n \nOr just let it go, don't even think about it and don't ask her repeatedly to join.  Some people like that drama and attention \"Oh please come, it wouldn't be the same with out you!!!\"  I have a friend like that.  When it came down to the final day to pay for the trip she said she doesn't know if she could afford it etc etc.  All I said was it's ok if you can't make it.  But in the end because I didn't put up a fuss she booked without issue.  Her Birthday is coming up and I said oh we will need to celebrate - maybe a spa day or something and she basically said I don't think I will be able to do any big celebrations until after your wedding in Mexico, I'm broke now.  I just replied with ok, we will have a great time in Mexico then!  Some people love drama and will always try to make things about them.\n \n \nI hope that you can resolve it without a lost friendship.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427613542,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75939,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nIt looks a lot like the professional make up!! good job! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> I don't think I'd be able to recreate what they do haha\n-----------------------------\n\nSurprisingly only took me 15-20 min!! The extensions took l...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1890941\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427580156,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"250","TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":120,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":240},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":38,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
