{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":75913,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that GingerBride mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78992-one-bridesmaid-driving-me-nuts-rant\/?view=findpost&p=1891137\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" Yeah, that's pretty disappointing...however, do you think it's just that she can't afford to go to the showers and other parties?  Maybe just talk with her.  Let her know that if she can't afford a gift (due to the expense of the actual destination wedding) that it's not the gift that matters to you it's her and her friendship that means the most to you.\n \nIf it's not that, then I would be upset too.  \n \nHope you are able to make things work with her <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427571118,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75904,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nFound the outfit my uncle is going to be wearing at the wedding to walk me down the aisle!   Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891125\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427567070,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75889,"Title":"liked a post you made in Show us your wedding dress!","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThank you @  [emoji4]The dress feels amazing on. Very easy to sit down in and actually very light since it fits like a glove on the top half! I absolutely love it [emoji7]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1891106\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427559238,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75888,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOur WC received our paperwork for the wedding, and says everything is good to go! I was a little stressed since I am adopted and therefore my new birth certificate doesn't have a father listed; since I changed my name and the courts changed all my history to being with my mom now(who is a single...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891111\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427559120,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75876,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOur WC received our paperwork for the wedding, and says everything is good to go! I was a little stressed since I am adopted and therefore my new birth certificate doesn't have a father listed; since I changed my name and the courts changed all my history to being with my mom now(who is a single...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891111\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427541876,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75868,"Title":"liked a post you made in One Bridesmaid Driving Me N...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWas taught that one the first time I went to Jamaica [emoji6] haha @ Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/to