-cid=\"1890858\" data-time=\"1427388345\">Wasn't planning to buy a dress more than a year before my wedding date, but there was a sample sale and the dress of my dreams was $350 off! Now I just need to resist the temptation to try it...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1890899\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427489888,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75744,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWent for my second last fitting [emoji7]    One more in a week or so!! Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1891035\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427484676,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75743,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nBeautiful!! You look fantastic and I love your dress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.