ust liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHere is my dress: Going for a last fitting this Friday!! [emoji4] Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1890704\n","Sender":{"Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427315113,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75243,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThis is another amazing handmade gift we received at my first bridal shower: It's truly amazing!! We also received a gun safe from my MOH with lyrics from our wedding song; \"Lady in my life\"~ M.J [emoji7][emoji7] Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1890752\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427312747,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75178,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThis is another amazing handmade gift we received at my first bridal s