{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":74152,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"IzzyDeee,\n\nDK11 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Hello and congrats! \u263a\ufe0f\".\n\nDK11 said:\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nThank you \u263a\ufe0f! I really appreciate it!!\n\nI am in contact with Nekeisha white who is our WC but she is so swamped I am sure! It's hard to get all the answers I want and I feel like I am bugging her with all my emails \ud83d\ude1d LOL! It's just getting closer to the big day so I'm getting more nervous!! I've posted pictures of what we have so far in my albums if you would like to see and make any suggestions?!\n\nI have the plaza gazebo booked for 4pm and a private dinner at the steakhouse booked as well. My hair and my bridesmaids hair are also booked; I have emailed kevan to see if he can DJ, so hoping to hear back!\n-----------------------------\n\nWe're really similar, I'm having a 4pm plaza gazebo wedding and private reception with DJ Kevan  also <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We are leaving so soon, I'm so excited and so nervous! From posts I have read on here, everything tends to be perfect on the actual day so I wouldn't worry too much (although that is much easier said than done haha) \n \nAll the best!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9009&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":279633,"Name":"DK11","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426910619,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9009},{"Id":74148,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nwow! that looks like a lot of work but great job! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\nIt's actually not as bad as I thought it would be!! [emoji2] Starting it is the hardest part I think LOL @ Sent from my...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1890258\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426899090,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":74131,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veil Vs No Veil For Beach W...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm wearing a weighted veil that will be tucked under my hair [emoji5]\ufe0f That way it can't blow around and is also lower on the back of my head [emoji2].  That's the hairstyle. That's how I'm having my weighted veil [emoji4]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76383-veil-vs-no-veil-for-beach-wedding\/?view=findpost&p=1890169\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426895956,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":74130,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veil Vs No Veil For Beach W...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nMine will cause I tried it outside on a windy day haha @  and it's really weighted lolSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76383-veil-vs-no-veil-for-beach-wedding\/?view=findpost&p=1890208\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426895952,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":74126,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nIn progress:\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1890194\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426895615,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":74101,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veil Vs No Veil For Beach W...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nMine will cause I tried it outside on a windy day haha @  and it's really weighted lolSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76383-veil-vs-no-veil-for-beach-wedding\/?view=findpost&p=1890208\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426890091,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":74061,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Megg mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78865-riu-montego-bay-looking-for-advice-past-bridesany-info\/?view=findpost&p=1890223\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"NikkiMarie05\" is the resort charging you a vendor fee to bring in an outside makeup artist? Who are you using and if you don't mind do you have info on the pricing? Our wedding is May 9th! @\"IzzyDeee\" we arrive on the 6th! Good luck with everything. She is very hard to get info from. She will answer maybe one of three questions I ask.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":275259,"Name":"Megg","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275259.jpg?_r=1421618186","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426878039,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73995,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1890205\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426866324,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73952,"Title":"liked a post you made in Jamaican Dj- Kevan Stewart...","Message":"Hello!\n\nbeckys98 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"beckys98\" data-cid=\"1890059\" data-time=\"1426789675\">I used events@ .com. I initially sent an inquiry through his website and never got a response. My wedding coordinator gave me this email address. It was 12 days before he replied.But, after hi...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78947-jamaican-dj-kevan-stewart-help\/?view=findpost&p=1890115\n","Sender":{"Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1426862084,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73698,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nbeckys98 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nNo such thing!  My date is so far away and it's all I think about.\n-----------------------------\n\nThat's awesome though!! It goes by really quick... Believe me LOL! We started planning ours a year and a h...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889918\n","Sender":{"Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1426776003,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73631,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nLove the Gazebo setting!\n-----------------------------\n\nThank you @  [emoji5]\ufe0f as soon as we saw it we knew it was the perfect location! Then we read the reviews and it was settled LOL Sent from my iPhone...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1890005\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426766585,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73590,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nHow did you arrange your make up at MAC? Did you walk in or did you book an appointment? How much does it cost?\n-----------------------------\n\nI booked it through an appointment! So you get the consultation...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889979\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426762496,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73588,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Meandhim\" data-cid=\"1889995\" data-time=\"1426774805\">Mine are short and non-existent even with mascara they also straight and will not curl... I think I will get a small set not a big full on set.... I think I look strange in lipstick so that woul...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889996\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426762123,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73587,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Meandhim mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889999\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" @\"perianjay\"\n \n \nSurprise Kate Spade wedding sale! over at midnight tonight...just saw this post on pinterest\n \nhttp:\/\/surprise.katespade.com\/on\/demandware.store\/Sites-KateSale-Site\/en_US\/Search-Show?cgid=ks-view-all\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426762109,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73576,"Title":"liked a post you made in Any Ontario Brides To Be Of...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nCanada is an awesome place to live! [emoji260]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78921-any-ontario-brides-to-be-of-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1889989\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426759365,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73571,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Meandhim\" data-cid=\"1889981\" data-time=\"1426772836\">Nice shoes!!!!I would break my neck! Lol that's why I went with the wedges! Plus they were such a good deal at Payless! I'm not probably not going to wear them again so I didn't want to spend sl...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889988\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426759041,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73569,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Meandhim\" data-cid=\"1889981\" data-time=\"1426772836\">Nice shoes!!!!I would break my neck! Lol that's why I went with the wedges! Plus they were such a good deal at Payless! I'm not probably not going to wear them again so I didn't want to spend sl...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889988\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426759012,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73551,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889984\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" haha.. I get it..Tall girl problems. I'm wearing flats for the wedding.. i'm almost 5'9 and my FI is 5'9. In 90% of our pictures together I usually hunch so that I look shorter than him lol.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426758717,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73550,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nI love the wedges for your bridesmaids! Plus, a wedge is always a nice comprimise and not very uncomfortable <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\nThe girls loved them when they tried them on too! Which is a hug...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889982\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426758656,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73540,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLOL I'll probably start obsessing over it more closer to the date [emoji4] @ Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889934\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426758062,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73534,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Meandhim\" data-cid=\"1889970\" data-time=\"1426771542\">The wedges are what I'm using for my wedding shoesThey are absolutely perfect! I was thinking of wearing them also if I didn't find other shoes [emoji4]. Since I'm getting married on the plaza...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889971\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426757449,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73531,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nBridesmaids shoes:When looking for bridesmaids shoes I wanted to give the girls two options! I went to Payless and the first shoes I grabbed were perfect [emoji108][emoji2]! Since my dress is ivory I wanted the girls to wear ivory shoes since that color would also go great with their dresses. T...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889969\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426757117,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73476,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"kcole123\" data-cid=\"1889939\" data-time=\"1426734342\">hahaha well thanks Kim.I honestly look at wedding pictures of people I have no idea who they are...If I see a wedding picture in a profile pic, I have to go look to see if there is a wedding al...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889941\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426742967,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73431,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHaha well hopefully not, hopefully they are happy for you and get excited seeing your count down!! [emoji4] It is one of the most exciting times in a couples relationship; besides child rearing and becoming property owners! @ I just got it since I almost needed to with how my excitement is!! Al...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889926\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426719821,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73430,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nNo such thing!  My date is so far away and it's all I think about.\n-----------------------------\n\nThat's awesome though!! It goes by really quick... Believe me LOL! We started planning ours a year and a h...\n========