{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":72890,"Title":"liked a post you made in Funny Story!","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThank you @  ! [emoji5]\ufe0fWe've had a few pre destination wedding parties!! It really helped to get all the people who are coming to the wedding together to meet if they haven't and to have a good time!Here's another cake we had to cut! [emoji12] Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78925-funny-story\/?view=findpost&p=1889629\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426584635,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72886,"Title":"liked a post you made in I Am An Adopted Bride; Need...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHello!I am getting married at the Riu Montego Bay May 6th,2015 [emoji4]As I stated in the title I was adopted at the age of 9 by a single mother. My uncle has been my father figure and has helped me through a lot in my life! A lot of the traditional saints talk about father daughter situation...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78923-i-am-an-adopted-bride-need-a-song-to-dance-with-my-uncle\/?view=findpost&p=1889562\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426583685,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72885,"Title":"liked a post you made in Any Ontario Brides To Be Of...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLOL!! @  [emoji13] I have 50 days left till the wedding! [emoji16][emoji15][emoji38]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78921-any-ontario-brides-to-be-of-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1889602\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426583554,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72851,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78921-any-ontario-brides-to-be-of-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1889603\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"IzzyDeee\" it's sooooo soon!!!! Exciting!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1426553690,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72850,"Title":"liked a post you made in Any Ontario Brides To Be Of...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLOL!! @  [emoji13] I have 50 days left till the wedding! [emoji16][emoji15][emoji38]Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78921-any-ontario-brides-to-be-of-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1889602\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1426553638,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72836,"Title":"liked a post you made in Izzydeee's Wedding Stag...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI couldn't have planned it any better myself! My man sure knows what I'm into that's all I have to say LOL!! I have a lot more photos in my gallery! [emoji5]\ufe0f feel free to take a look and let me know your thoughts! Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78924-izzydeees-wedding-stages-thread-riu-montego-bay-jamaica-050615\/?view=findpost&p=1889590\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426550770,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72833,"Title":"liked a post you made in Funny Story!","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nMy last name is David (pronounced Dah-vid it's French lol), and my FI last name is Davidson!![emoji23] No we are not related lmao! I am Swedish-Canadian and he is Italian-Canadian! I tell him all the time I'm just going to hyphenate the -son [emoji23][emoji13]!! Whenever we sign up for somet...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78925-funny-story\/?view=findpost&p=1889592\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426550631,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72563,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"IzzyDeee,\n\nDK11 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Hello and congrats! \u263a\ufe0f\".\n\nDK11 said:\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nHello! Was wondering if you would be able to give me some pointers after your wedding and what to expect!?\n\n\nI am super excited and nervous, as I bet you are too !!\n\n\nThank you!\n-----------------------------\n\n \nHi IzzyDee, \n \nCongratulations to you too! The countdown is really on, I am getting really excited! I will be happy to let you know any details and tips after our wedding. Have you been in contact with Christina for planning your wedding?  Good luck with all the planning! \n \nPetrina \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9009&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":279633,"Name":"DK11","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426507382,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9009},{"Id":72472,"Title":"liked a post you made in Riu Montego Bay! Lookin...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm in the same boat! My wedding date is May 6th! So it's coming up really quick!!! \ud83d\ude01\ud83d\ude01\ud83d\ude01The WC Nekeisha hardly answers half the questions I ask, which is frustrating but understandable since they are probably swamped! I have already booked my hair appointment as well as my bridesmaids, but I'm c...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78865-riu-montego-bay-looking-for-advice-past-bridesany-info\/?view=findpost&p=1889352\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426458321,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72424,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"IzzyDeee,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome IzzyDeee to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello IzzyDeee,<br \/><br \/>Welcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.<br \/><br \/>Here are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.<br \/><br \/>If you have not done so, you may want to:<br \/>complete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)<br \/>visit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/23\/newbies)<br \/>Start your own wedding planning blog (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blogs\/)<br \/>find the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in<br \/><br \/>Here are some links that may be helpful to you:<br \/>Destination Wedding Community & Forum (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/)<br \/>Resort Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/resorts-villas)<br \/>Wedding Vendor Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/wedding-vendors)<br \/>Destination Wedding Tips and Articles (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips)<br \/>Wedding Image Gallery (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/recent\/albums)<br \/>BDW Help Page (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=help)<br \/>BDW Forum Rules and Etiquette (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/8853\/forum-faqs-etiquette-rules)<br \/>How to Download Attachments (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/48545\/update-1-18-2010-downloading-attachments)<br \/><br \/>Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:<br \/><br \/>Moderators and Community Leaders<br \/>Tammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/206696-tammy-host\/). Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006<br \/>AlexisinJamaica (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/255437-alexisinjamaica\/) - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.<br \/><br \/>If you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:<br \/>BDW on Facebook (http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Twitter (http:\/\/twitter.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Pinterest (http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bdwforum\/)<br \/><br \/>If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business, please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com (mailto:advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20Inquiry%20for%20BDW).<br \/><br \/>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read! (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010)<br \/><br \/>Please feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.<br \/><br \/>Team BDW\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=9005#msg16516\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426448037,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9005}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"250","TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":240,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":210,"LastPage":240},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":38,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
