{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.98.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6114b5140de5f66e9668113410cfea54","RawContent":"Wow everything looks and sounds amazing! Congrats!! Excited for you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1860527,"PostDate":1405625549,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow everything looks and sounds amazing! Congrats!! Excited for you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maryluong@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.227.172.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405268690,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"maredith","Id":278988,"Name":"maredith","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.201.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"198bf51bf0808974b1996480686ad2c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow! I&#039;m soo impressed! I hope that I&#039;m as organized as you are when I get to planning my wedding!! Love your inspirations!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860542,"PostDate":1405628045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow! I'm soo impressed! I hope that I'm as organized as you are when I get to planning my wedding!! Love your inspirations!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dnyomba@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.161.66.184","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390101458,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsSam","Id":276191,"Name":"FutureMrsSam","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b65e0675b126bb2770541712cb94ca2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"candle23\"] &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;You can do it!! &amp;nbsp;Congratulations on your wedding - that&#039;s my parent&#039;s wedding anniversary :) &amp;nbsp;Great day :D&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Dido77\"] &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Thank you! &amp;nbsp;I find I need to use lists\/excel sheets to get things done ;) &amp;nbsp;We have a wedding budget sheet (which is NOTHING on the house comparison sheet we had for our new house, haha!)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"maredith\"] &amp;nbsp; Thank you - I&#039;m so excited too!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860603,"PostDate":1405672992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272291\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272291-candle23\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">candle23<\/span><\/a> \u00a0 \u00a0You can do it!! \u00a0Congratulations on your wedding - that's my parent's wedding anniversary <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0Great day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@Dido77 \u00a0 \u00a0Thank you! \u00a0I find I need to use lists\/excel sheets to get things done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> \u00a0We have a wedding budget sheet (which is NOTHING on the house comparison sheet we had for our new house, haha!)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278988\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278988-maredith\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">maredith<\/span><\/a> \u00a0 Thank you - I'm so excited too!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"285556426a87cb556e424c3cdd92b750","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Apparently my robes came yesterday! &amp;nbsp;The delivery person hid them behind our trash can (and it was rainy, so that makes me kinda mad because the box was damp!)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They are AWESOME! &amp;nbsp;Very high quality\/soft, and she did a great job! &amp;nbsp;I wish she had used a brighter blue (it&#039;s more light navy than royal, if that makes sense) and the sangria is too purple BUT I don&#039;t really care as my sister will like it anyway. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tip - do NOT pick sangria from david&#039;s bridal as a color unless you are ordering everything from DB. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s IMPOSSIBLE to match with DIY stuff -___-&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Etsy Store I ordered from - Celia was great! &amp;nbsp;She&#039;s also running a special if you order over $100, you get a free personalized waffle cosmetic bag (you pick customization &amp;amp; colors). &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m sad I missed out on that!! &amp;nbsp;But thought I&#039;d pass it on :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Shop:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/LillysShopDotCom&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/LillysShopDotCom&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76313]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Back of my robe:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76312]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Blue in package:&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76314]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Teal out of package!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76315]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I tried mine on, and it&#039;s loose\/comfy\/very much like a light spa robe. &amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t wait to give it to them!! &amp;nbsp;Plus I think they&#039;ll make great photos :)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860610,"PostDate":1405677092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Apparently my robes came yesterday! \u00a0The delivery person hid them behind our trash can (and it was rainy, so that makes me kinda mad because the box was damp!)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They are AWESOME! \u00a0Very high quality\/soft, and she did a great job! \u00a0I wish she had used a brighter blue (it's more light navy than royal, if that makes sense) and the sangria is too purple BUT I don't really care as my sister will like it anyway. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Tip - do NOT pick sangria from david's bridal as a color unless you are ordering everything from DB. \u00a0It's IMPOSSIBLE to match with DIY stuff -___-<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Etsy Store I ordered from - Celia was great! \u00a0She's also running a special if you order over $100, you get a free personalized waffle cosmetic bag (you pick customization & colors). \u00a0I'm sad I missed out on that!! \u00a0But thought I'd pass it on <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Shop:\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/LillysShopDotCom' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...illysShopDotCom<\/a><\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76313-bm-robes-3\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_551325.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Bm robes (3)'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Bm robes (3)' id='sml_image_view_76313' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Back of my robe:<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76312-bm-robes-4\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_1122730.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Bm robes (4)'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Bm robes (4)' id='sml_image_view_76312' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Blue in package:<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76314-bm-robes-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_629874.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Bm robes (2)'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Bm robes (2)' id='sml_image_view_76314' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Teal out of package!<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76315-bm-robes-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_323340.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Bm robes (1)'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Bm robes (1)' id='sml_image_view_76315' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I tried mine on, and it's loose\/comfy\/very much like a light spa robe. \u00a0I can't wait to give it to them!! \u00a0Plus I think they'll make great photos <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc76b4bc06de012786b2494d5ae5dff3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:24px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UPDATE 7.18.14&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INVITATIONS ARE FINALLY DONE!!! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;Just printing, but here&#039;s a breakdown of what I did\/costs\/etc. &amp;nbsp;I didn&#039;t use any special supplies outside of scissors (like corner rounders or anything, I just cut):&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paper:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I got this from Paperandmore.com (&lt;em&gt;Sidenote - if anyone wants to buy the A-1 RSVP envelopes from me, let me know as I&#039;m not going to use them! &amp;nbsp;$11.99 is what I paid, plus shipping&lt;\/em&gt;)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px;\"&gt;#10 Blueprint Blue Metallic Envelopes (50 Envelopes) -- (Quantity: 1)&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px;\"&gt;Aqua Lagoon Metallic Paper&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px;\"&gt;81# Text -- (Quantity: 1)&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.paperandmore.com\/catalog\/review?src=sc&amp;amp;product_sku=3555-100A-1&#039;&gt;A-1&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;(4 Bar) Crimson Red Metallic 3 5\/8 x 5 1\/8 (50 Envelopes) -- (Quantity: 1)&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px;\"&gt;Champagne Metallic Paper&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px;\"&gt;80# (100 Sheets) -- (Quantity: 1)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px;\"&gt;$71.95 (with shipping)&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The paper has a beautiful subtle shimmer and good weight. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m very pleased! &amp;nbsp;I had printed out test on regular paper, and you can really feel\/see the difference!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Templates:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I used the AyleeBits template (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.ayleebits.com\/2006\/06\/10\/diy-boarding-pass-save-the-date\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.ayleebits.com\/2006\/06\/10\/diy-boarding-pass-save-the-date\/&lt;\/a&gt;) for the actual boarding pass. &amp;nbsp;It was kind of a pain to work with, but I ended up figuring it out&amp;nbsp; :) &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I used the jacket template with airplane from another member (I&#039;m embarrassed to say I don&#039;t remember who...oops). &amp;nbsp;It was a powerpoint file, but I just saved as a PDF to print and worked out great. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve attached the one I used (MH Invitation Jacket).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For the letter included on the boarding pass jacket\/sleeve, I borrowed ideas from several people on this board, and combined&amp;nbsp; :)  I&#039;ve attached that template as well (MH Jacket Letter).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Other supplies:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;I got the Silver Rayon Craft Ribbon on Amazon for about $6 (prime shipping). &amp;nbsp;It seems to have gone up to $10.50...ouch. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;I got the Seahorse charms on ebay for $4 for 40 of them (I also got 50 starfish for $1.50 for other paper projects, so this was a little pricey...in comparison? lol)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;I got the brads on ebay for $7.22 for 34 of them - definitely not cheap, but I love the starfish! &amp;nbsp;I got 12 starfish, 12 sand dollars &amp;amp; 10 seashells (he only had 24 of the starfish\/sand dollar combo).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Cost (with postage):&lt;\/strong&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;$3.13 cents per invitation&lt;\/strong&gt;! &amp;nbsp;Not bad, since I used higher end paper (without coupons, oops) and added the embellishments! &amp;nbsp;It also includes the crimson RSVP envelopes I&#039;m not using, without those, they would have been&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;$2.77&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;each shipped. &amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;WOW.&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And now...the pictures!&amp;nbsp; :)  I just love the subtle shimmer of the paper, it&#039;s so pretty!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76368]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76375]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76374]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76373]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76372]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76371]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76370]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76369]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76367]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860754,"PostDate":1405701813,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>UPDATE 7.18.14<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>INVITATIONS ARE FINALLY DONE!!! \u00a0<\/strong>Just printing, but here's a breakdown of what I did\/costs\/etc. \u00a0I didn't use any special supplies outside of scissors (like corner rounders or anything, I just cut):<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Paper:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I got this from Paperandmore.com (<em>Sidenote - if anyone wants to buy the A-1 RSVP envelopes from me, let me know as I'm not going to use them! \u00a0$11.99 is what I paid, plus shipping<\/em>)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">#10 Blueprint Blue Metallic Envelopes (50 Envelopes) -- (Quantity: 1)<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">Aqua Lagoon Metallic Paper\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">81# Text -- (Quantity: 1)<\/span><br><a href='http:\/\/www.paperandmore.com\/catalog\/review?src=sc&product_sku=3555-100A-1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>A-1<\/a><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">\u00a0(4 Bar) Crimson Red Metallic 3 5\/8 x 5 1\/8 (50 Envelopes) -- (Quantity: 1)<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">Champagne Metallic Paper\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">80# (100 Sheets) -- (Quantity: 1)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">$71.95 (with shipping)<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The paper has a beautiful subtle shimmer and good weight. \u00a0I'm very pleased! \u00a0I had printed out test on regular paper, and you can really feel\/see the difference!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Templates:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I used the AyleeBits template (<a href='http:\/\/www.ayleebits.com\/2006\/06\/10\/diy-boarding-pass-save-the-date\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.ayleebits...-save-the-date\/<\/a>) for the actual boarding pass. \u00a0It was kind of a pain to work with, but I ended up figuring it out\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I used the jacket template with airplane from another member (I'm embarrassed to say I don't remember who...oops). \u00a0It was a powerpoint file, but I just saved as a PDF to print and worked out great. \u00a0I've attached the one I used (MH Invitation Jacket).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the letter included on the boarding pass jacket\/sleeve, I borrowed ideas from several people on this board, and combined\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0I've attached that template as well (MH Jacket Letter).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Other supplies:<\/p>\n<ul><li>I got the Silver Rayon Craft Ribbon on Amazon for about $6 (prime shipping). \u00a0It seems to have gone up to $10.50...ouch. \u00a0<\/li>\n<li>I got the Seahorse charms on ebay for $4 for 40 of them (I also got 50 starfish for $1.50 for other paper projects, so this was a little pricey...in comparison? lol)<\/li>\n<li>I got the brads on ebay for $7.22 for 34 of them - definitely not cheap, but I love the starfish! \u00a0I got 12 starfish, 12 sand dollars & 10 seashells (he only had 24 of the starfish\/sand dollar combo).<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Total Cost (with postage):<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>$3.13 cents per invitation<\/strong>! \u00a0Not bad, since I used higher end paper (without coupons, oops) and added the embellishments! \u00a0It also includes the crimson RSVP envelopes I'm not using, without those, they would have been\u00a0<strong>$2.77\u00a0<\/strong>each shipped. \u00a0<u><b>WOW.<\/b><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And now...the pictures!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0I just love the subtle shimmer of the paper, it's so pretty!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76368-invitation-envelope\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_1091806.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Invitation & Envelope'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Invitation & Envelope' id='sml_image_view_76368' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76375-front-of-sleeve\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_449438.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Front of Sleeve'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Front of Sleeve' id='sml_image_view_76375' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76374-seahorse\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_169702.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Seahorse'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Seahorse' id='sml_image_view_76374' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76373-invite-in-sleeve\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_1764166.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Invite in Sleeve'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Invite in Sleeve' id='sml_image_view_76373' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76372-front\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_999050.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Front'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Front' id='sml_image_view_76372' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76371-champagne-paper-shimmer-front\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_594302.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Champagne paper shimmer (front)'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Champagne paper shimmer (front)' id='sml_image_view_76371' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76370-champagne-paper-shimmer-back\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_713123.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Champagne paper shimmer (back)'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Champagne paper shimmer (back)' id='sml_image_view_76370' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76369-sleeve-shimmer\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_514719.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Sleeve Shimmer'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Sleeve Shimmer' id='sml_image_view_76369' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76367-envelope-shimmer\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_301001.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Envelope shimmer'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Envelope shimmer' id='sml_image_view_76367' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1698a1fd4c6abf6fccb5013b726bdf64","RawContent":"[quote name=\"marinah84\" post=\"1860754\" timestamp=\"1405716213\"]\n[size=6][b]UPDATE 7.18.14[\/b][\/size]\n\n[b]INVITATIONS ARE FINALLY DONE!!!  [\/b]Just printing, but here&#039;s a breakdown of what I did\/costs\/etc.  I didn&#039;t use any special supplies outside of scissors (like corner rounders or anything, I just cut):\n\n\n[b]Paper:[\/b]\nI got this from Paperandmore.com ([i]Sidenote - if anyone wants to buy the A-1 RSVP envelopes from me, let me know as I&#039;m not going to use them!  $11.99 is what I paid, plus shipping[\/i])\n\n[font=arial][size=3]#10 Blueprint Blue Metallic Envelopes (50 Envelopes) -- (Quantity: 1)[\/size][\/font]\n[font=arial][size=3]Aqua Lagoon Metallic Paper [\/size][\/font][font=arial][size=3]81# Text -- (Quantity: 1)[\/size][\/font]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.paperandmore.com\/catalog\/review?src=sc&amp;amp;product_sku=3555-100A-1\"]A-1[\/url][font=arial][size=3] (4 Bar) Crimson Red Metallic 3 5\/8 x 5 1\/8 (50 Envelopes) -- (Quantity: 1)[\/size][\/font]\n[font=arial][size=3]Champagne Metallic Paper [\/size][\/font][font=arial][size=3]80# (100 Sheets) -- (Quantity: 1)[\/size][\/font]\n[font=arial][size=3]$71.95 (with shipping)[\/size][\/font]\n \nThe paper has a beautiful subtle shimmer and good weight.  I&#039;m very pleased!  I had printed out test on regular paper, and you can really feel\/see the difference!\n\n[b]Templates:[\/b]\nI used the AyleeBits template ([url=\"http:\/\/www.ayleebits.com\/2006\/06\/10\/diy-boarding-pass-save-the-date\/\"]http:\/\/www.ayleebits.com\/2006\/06\/10\/diy-boarding-pass-save-the-date\/[\/url]) for the actual boarding pass.  It was kind of a pain to work with, but I ended up figuring it out  :)\n\nI used the jacket template with airplane from another member (I&#039;m embarrassed to say I don&#039;t remember who...oops).  It was a powerpoint file, but I just saved as a PDF to print and worked out great.  I&#039;ve attached the one I used (MH Invitation Jacket).\n\nFor the letter included on the boarding pass jacket\/sleeve, I borrowed ideas from several people on this board, and combined  :)  I&#039;ve attached that template as well (MH Jacket Letter).\n\n\nOther supplies:[list]\n[*]I got the Silver Rayon Craft Ribbon on Amazon for about $6 (prime shipping).  It seems to have gone up to $10.50...ouch.\n[*]I got the Seahorse charms on ebay for $4 for 40 of them (I also got 50 starfish for $1.50 for other paper projects, so this was a little pricey...in comparison? lol)\n[*]I got the brads on ebay for $7.22 for 34 of them - definitely not cheap, but I love the starfish!  I got 12 starfish, 12 sand dollars &amp;amp; 10 seashells (he only had 24 of the starfish\/sand dollar combo).\n[\/list][b]Total Cost (with postage):[\/b]  [b]$3.13 cents per invitation[\/b]!  Not bad, since I used higher end paper (without coupons, oops) and added the embellishments!  It also includes the crimson RSVP envelopes I&#039;m not using, without those, they would have been [b]$2.77 [\/b]each shipped.  [u][b]WOW.[\/b][\/u]\n\n\nAnd now...the pictures!  :)  I just love the subtle shimmer of the paper, it&#039;s so pretty!\n[\/quote]\nHi! Just wondered if you notice that your jacket letter says March 2014....","Attachments":[],"Id":1863848,"PostDate":1406891159,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>marinah84, on 18 July 2014 - 04:43 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>UPDATE 7.18.14<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>INVITATIONS ARE FINALLY DONE!!! \u00a0<\/strong>Just printing, but here's a breakdown of what I did\/costs\/etc. \u00a0I didn't use any special supplies outside of scissors (like corner rounders or anything, I just cut):<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Paper:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I got this from Paperandmore.com (<em>Sidenote - if anyone wants to buy the A-1 RSVP envelopes from me, let me know as I'm not going to use them! \u00a0$11.99 is what I paid, plus shipping<\/em>)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">#10 Blueprint Blue Metallic Envelopes (50 Envelopes) -- (Quantity: 1)<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">Aqua Lagoon Metallic Paper\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">81# Text -- (Quantity: 1)<\/span><br><a href='http:\/\/www.paperandmore.com\/catalog\/review?src=sc&product_sku=3555-100A-1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>A-1<\/a><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">\u00a0(4 Bar) Crimson Red Metallic 3 5\/8 x 5 1\/8 (50 Envelopes) -- (Quantity: 1)<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">Champagne Metallic Paper\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">80# (100 Sheets) -- (Quantity: 1)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.666666984558105px\">$71.95 (with shipping)<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The paper has a beautiful subtle shimmer and good weight. \u00a0I'm very pleased! \u00a0I had printed out test on regular paper, and you can really feel\/see the difference!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Templates:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I used the AyleeBits template (<a href='http:\/\/www.ayleebits.com\/2006\/06\/10\/diy-boarding-pass-save-the-date\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.ayleebits...-save-the-date\/<\/a>) for the actual boarding pass. \u00a0It was kind of a pain to work with, but I ended up figuring it out\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I used the jacket template with airplane from another member (I'm embarrassed to say I don't remember who...oops). \u00a0It was a powerpoint file, but I just saved as a PDF to print and worked out great. \u00a0I've attached the one I used (MH Invitation Jacket).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the letter included on the boarding pass jacket\/sleeve, I borrowed ideas from several people on this board, and combined\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0I've attached that template as well (MH Jacket Letter).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Other supplies:<\/p>\n<ul><li>I got the Silver Rayon Craft Ribbon on Amazon for about $6 (prime shipping). \u00a0It seems to have gone up to $10.50...ouch. \u00a0<\/li>\n<li>I got the Seahorse charms on ebay for $4 for 40 of them (I also got 50 starfish for $1.50 for other paper projects, so this was a little pricey...in comparison? lol)<\/li>\n<li>I got the brads on ebay for $7.22 for 34 of them - definitely not cheap, but I love the starfish! \u00a0I got 12 starfish, 12 sand dollars & 10 seashells (he only had 24 of the starfish\/sand dollar combo).<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Total Cost (with postage):<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>$3.13 cents per invitation<\/strong>! \u00a0Not bad, since I used higher end paper (without coupons, oops) and added the embellishments! \u00a0It also includes the crimson RSVP envelopes I'm not using, without those, they would have been\u00a0<strong>$2.77\u00a0<\/strong>each shipped. \u00a0<u><b>WOW.<\/b><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And now...the pictures!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0I just love the subtle shimmer of the paper, it's so pretty!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi! Just wondered if you notice that your jacket letter says March 2014....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.112.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a163d51ab11bcbdab3af95dcf6b703a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You are so on the ball!&amp;nbsp; You definitely motivate me to get moving :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Everything looks great!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1863855,"PostDate":1406891855,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You are so on the ball!\u00a0 You definitely motivate me to get moving <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Everything looks great!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395594948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a59500bddb9c2d99ce84f9c23ac45c8b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1863848\" timestamp=\"1406905559\"]\nHi! Just wondered if you notice that your jacket letter says March 2014....[\/quote]\nTHANK YOU!!  I had caught that this weekend when I gave one to my inlaws.  Luckily I had only done the test printing so far ;)  \n\nYou&#039;d think after all the proofreading about 6 people did on them that it would have been caught BEFORE that!  Good eye :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1863926,"PostDate":1406898599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 01 August 2014 - 11:05 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi! Just wondered if you notice that your jacket letter says March 2014....<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>THANK YOU!! \u00a0I had caught that this weekend when I gave one to my inlaws. \u00a0Luckily I had only done the test printing so far <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'd think after all the proofreading about 6 people did on them that it would have been caught BEFORE that! \u00a0Good eye <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa5a04a4d13d94a80daad44fb15ab1e1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Update 9.9.2014&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Invitations are FINALLY all out and I&#039;m SO HAPPY! &amp;nbsp;It took a LOT more time than I anticipated to make each one. &amp;nbsp;I also scrapped the letter - it was a pain and the glue made it look kinda like a kid made it (I tried several glues). &amp;nbsp;It looks great without it :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;A lot of flights are booked and room reservations are starting to come in! &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s exciting! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m a little stressed out by the travel agent; we have a \"deal\" that ends on Friday for room rates that is better than online but not by much. &amp;nbsp;We have to have 10 rooms booked by Friday to secure the price. &amp;nbsp;My parents found a site where the adults only section is like 20\/more per night than the standard (savings of almost $300 off the travel agent price), so several people are booking through there. &amp;nbsp;So only at 8 rooms of standard (which we have to do because of the kids, lol). &amp;nbsp;Worst case, we&#039;ll all book individually - the hotel just needs names of guests for our room nights.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:76374]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2nd Dress - Post Reception Dancing &amp;amp; TTD Session:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Finally got a dress for our TTD session! &amp;nbsp; After 2 failed overseas custom orders (babydressonline &amp;amp; ebay), I decided to look stateside. &amp;nbsp;I decided to go with a bridesmaid dress, ordered in white. &amp;nbsp;FYI - David&#039;s bridal does NOT carry their bridesmaid dresses in white, but other bridal shops do! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I saw this one on the rack, and knew it&#039;d be perfect (first one I saw!). &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s flowy and made of polyester (I think) so it won&#039;t get water logged. &amp;nbsp;I ordered it in white, and am excited to check it off my list!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:77495]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridesmaid Dresses:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;While my sister in law was trying on wedding dresses at DB, I was planning on looking at bridesmaid dresses. &amp;nbsp;All three of my maids are a little on the busty side, so I had changed my mind on strapless. &amp;nbsp;The first dress I saw I knew was it. &amp;nbsp;I had my sister in law try it on (she&#039;s one of the bridesmaids) and it&#039;s PERFECT! (it&#039;s a trend - all 3 dresses in my wedding were the first ones I saw, haha)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:77494]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridal Bouquet:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I took my flowers in to a local florist, who will have it arranged for me before December (she seemed concerned it would get dust, so I don&#039;t think she&#039;s planning on doing it for a while!). &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m pretty excited!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ties:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just got this done today. &amp;nbsp;I HIGHLY recommend (so far)&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.solidcolorneckties.com\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.solidcolorneckties.com\/&lt;\/a&gt; . &amp;nbsp; I ordered at 3:40pm CST, found out they had a free shipping option (when I put them back in my cart to take this screenshot lol) and called at 3:50pm CST. &amp;nbsp;They had already packed my items to ship, but still gave me the 3.95 shipping back! &amp;nbsp;I got SIX ties (4 bow ties and 2 neck ties) for $27.80 SHIPPED. &amp;nbsp;We&#039;ll see how they are in person, but I&#039;m impressed so far! &amp;nbsp;And they are in the &#039;burbs of Chicago, so you can go to their storefront if you&#039;re in the area! &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Groom will be the paisley white, while best man\/my father will have the raspberry bow tie, to match my maid of honor. &amp;nbsp;2nd groomsman (TBD...still..ugh...)\/ring bearer will have the royal\/sapphire blue to match my sister in law. &amp;nbsp;My brother\/father in law will have the malibu bright blue to match my 3rd maid of honor\/best friend. &amp;nbsp;I already have the bright blue bow tie for my son\/ring bearer, but I&#039;m pretty excited about these ties!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:77498]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boudoir Book Session:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Booked for October! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m so excited about this one - I have NO CLUE what to wear\/do. &amp;nbsp;I know the photographer (she&#039;s a family friend) and I want it to be sexy but not like, explicit, you know? &amp;nbsp;Any suggestions of poses\/things to wear would be appreciated! &amp;nbsp;He unfortunately isn&#039;t a sports fan (outside of triathlons) and I&#039;m not sure running shoes or a swim cap or a bike helmet are sexy ;) &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m in a work competition on activity and weight loss, and working my butt off to get in shape! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I may have more updates (it&#039;s been a while lol) but this is good for now! &amp;nbsp;I need to update my to do list!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Do (Short term list):&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Starfish Boutonnieres&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- November Project&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chapstick Labels&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;- October\/November Project&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Centerpieces&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Add bling to vases &amp;amp; pack?&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mother of the Bride\/Groom&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- I got pretty pearl bracelets and charms, and will DIY them together plus pretty presentation boxes. &amp;nbsp;The bracelets turned out stunning, so excited to see the finished product.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Do (Long Term List):&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TTD Shoes&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Going to wear the heels for the TTD session - DIY glitter. &amp;nbsp;Excited!&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OOT Bags (First Aid\/Wedding Week Survival Kits)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;- Pretty sure I have everything, it&#039;s just putting one together and seeing if I&#039;m doing anything else.&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridesmaid Bikini Bags\/Wedding Day Emergency Kits&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Similar to OOT - put together, see if I need to do anything else&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Fans&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Designed! &amp;nbsp;Will print out closer to the date (2015 project)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome Book&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Work in Progress (another not til 2015 project)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Door Knockers &amp;amp; Other Printables&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Will print 2015&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sand Ceremony Shadowbox Frame&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Mother in Law found a good frame at Hobby Lobby - just need to seal it (reviews said sometimes sand leaks, so use transparent caulk)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Custom Wire Hangers&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- FI project&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champagne Toasting Set&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Long term goal is to customize a set or buy the heart vase set listed earlier. &amp;nbsp;If it doesn&#039;t happen, I&#039;m sure I&#039;ll live&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Custom Items:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Custom Robes&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- GOT THEM!&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Custom Cake Topper&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;- Ordered!&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signs&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;(Mr\/Mrs, Ring bearer\/Flower Girl) - GOT THEM!&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TTD Dress&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Ordered!&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridal Bouquet&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- At Florist!&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update 2.0 - 9.9.14&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;I knew I forgot a few updates!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridal Hair:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;I love my hair down, due to broad shoulders, but am worried about the wind. &amp;nbsp;I plan on having my hair to the side, either in a ponytail type of hairdo or in a side bun. &amp;nbsp;We sort of played with my hair a little in my dress when my family came to visit, but I haven&#039;t fully decided. &amp;nbsp;So I put together 2 pinterest-inspired hair inspiration collages that I&#039;ll take to the hairdresser:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Side pony inspiration:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:77496]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Side bun inspiration:&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:77497]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I love how my hair looks to the side &amp;amp; long, but I also liked it to the side in a bun. &amp;nbsp;Plus the whole wind\/not having to worry about sweating out the curls, etc is appealing. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m not sure which way to go!!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sand Ceremony Frame:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I was going to have my fiancee DIY this, but my mother in law found a frame that is the right size &amp;amp; has double glass panes so I can put in a wedding picture after the trip. &amp;nbsp;Several reviews said it leaked, so seal it, and my FI is an engineer so I figure he can do that before we go with transparent\/clear caulking. &amp;nbsp;I also need him to figure out how much sand we&#039;ll need - we have some blue from a friend and were thinking of using sand from the beach at the resort. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s Cancun, so the white fine sand beaches should have decent sand...theoretically. &amp;nbsp;We might have to sieve out some coral\/etc. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:77499]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871174,"PostDate":1410283496,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Update 9.9.2014<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Invitations are FINALLY all out and I'm SO HAPPY! \u00a0It took a LOT more time than I anticipated to make each one. \u00a0I also scrapped the letter - it was a pain and the glue made it look kinda like a kid made it (I tried several glues). \u00a0It looks great without it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">A lot of flights are booked and room reservations are starting to come in! \u00a0It's exciting! \u00a0I'm a little stressed out by the travel agent; we have a \"deal\" that ends on Friday for room rates that is better than online but not by much. \u00a0We have to have 10 rooms booked by Friday to secure the price. \u00a0My parents found a site where the adults only section is like 20\/more per night than the standard (savings of almost $300 off the travel agent price), so several people are booking through there. \u00a0So only at 8 rooms of standard (which we have to do because of the kids, lol). \u00a0Worst case, we'll all book individually - the hotel just needs names of guests for our room nights.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/76374-seahorse\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_169702.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Seahorse'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Seahorse' id='sml_image_view_76374' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>2nd Dress - Post Reception Dancing & TTD Session:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Finally got a dress for our TTD session! \u00a0 After 2 failed overseas custom orders (babydressonline & ebay), I decided to look stateside. \u00a0I decided to go with a bridesmaid dress, ordered in white. \u00a0FYI - David's bridal does NOT carry their bridesmaid dresses in white, but other bridal shops do! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I saw this one on the rack, and knew it'd be perfect (first one I saw!). \u00a0It's flowy and made of polyester (I think) so it won't get water logged. \u00a0I ordered it in white, and am excited to check it off my list!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/77495-ttd-dress-brown\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_24259.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='TTD dress brown'  width='123' height='200'  alt='TTD dress brown' id='sml_image_view_77495' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridesmaid Dresses:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>While my sister in law was trying on wedding dresses at DB, I was planning on looking at bridesmaid dresses. \u00a0All three of my maids are a little on the busty side, so I had changed my mind on strapless. \u00a0The first dress I saw I knew was it. \u00a0I had my sister in law try it on (she's one of the bridesmaids) and it's PERFECT! (it's a trend - all 3 dresses in my wedding were the first ones I saw, haha)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/77494-bridesmaid-dresses\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_423217.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='bridesmaid dresses'  width='200' height='200'  alt='bridesmaid dresses' id='sml_image_view_77494' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridal Bouquet:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I took my flowers in to a local florist, who will have it arranged for me before December (she seemed concerned it would get dust, so I don't think she's planning on doing it for a while!). \u00a0I'm pretty excited!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Ties:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Just got this done today. \u00a0I HIGHLY recommend (so far)\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.solidcolorneckties.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.solidcolorneckties.com\/<\/a> . \u00a0 I ordered at 3:40pm CST, found out they had a free shipping option (when I put them back in my cart to take this screenshot lol) and called at 3:50pm CST. \u00a0They had already packed my items to ship, but still gave me the 3.95 shipping back! \u00a0I got SIX ties (4 bow ties and 2 neck ties) for $27.80 SHIPPED. \u00a0We'll see how they are in person, but I'm impressed so far! \u00a0And they are in the 'burbs of Chicago, so you can go to their storefront if you're in the area! <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Groom will be the paisley white, while best man\/my father will have the raspberry bow tie, to match my maid of honor. \u00a02nd groomsman (TBD...still..ugh...)\/ring bearer will have the royal\/sapphire blue to match my sister in law. \u00a0My brother\/father in law will have the malibu bright blue to match my 3rd maid of honor\/best friend. \u00a0I already have the bright blue bow tie for my son\/ring bearer, but I'm pretty excited about these ties!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/77498-neck-ties\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_27447.png' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='neck ties'  width='200' height='198'  alt='neck ties' id='sml_image_view_77498' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Boudoir Book Session:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Booked for October! \u00a0I'm so excited about this one - I have NO CLUE what to wear\/do. \u00a0I know the photographer (she's a family friend) and I want it to be sexy but not like, explicit, you know? \u00a0Any suggestions of poses\/things to wear would be appreciated! \u00a0He unfortunately isn't a sports fan (outside of triathlons) and I'm not sure running shoes or a swim cap or a bike helmet are sexy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> \u00a0I'm in a work competition on activity and weight loss, and working my butt off to get in shape! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I may have more updates (it's been a while lol) but this is good for now! \u00a0I need to update my to do list!<\/p>\n<br \/><p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><u><strong>To Do (Short term list):<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<ul><li><strong>Starfish Boutonnieres<\/strong>\u00a0- November Project<\/li>\n<li><strong>Chapstick Labels\u00a0<\/strong>- October\/November Project<\/li>\n<li><strong>Centerpieces<\/strong>\u00a0- Add bling to vases & pack?<\/li>\n<li><strong>Mother of the Bride\/Groom<\/strong>\u00a0- I got pretty pearl bracelets and charms, and will DIY them together plus pretty presentation boxes. \u00a0The bracelets turned out stunning, so excited to see the finished product.<\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><u><strong>To Do (Long Term List):<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<ul><li><strong>TTD Shoes<\/strong>\u00a0- Going to wear the heels for the TTD session - DIY glitter. \u00a0Excited!<\/li>\n<li><strong>OOT Bags (First Aid\/Wedding Week Survival Kits)\u00a0<\/strong>- Pretty sure I have everything, it's just putting one together and seeing if I'm doing anything else.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Bridesmaid Bikini Bags\/Wedding Day Emergency Kits<\/strong>\u00a0- Similar to OOT - put together, see if I need to do anything else<\/li>\n<li><strong>Program Fans<\/strong>\u00a0- Designed! \u00a0Will print out closer to the date (2015 project)<\/li>\n<li><strong>Welcome Book<\/strong>\u00a0- Work in Progress (another not til 2015 project)<\/li>\n<li><strong>Door Knockers & Other Printables<\/strong>\u00a0- Will print 2015<\/li>\n<li><strong>Sand Ceremony Shadowbox Frame<\/strong>\u00a0- Mother in Law found a good frame at Hobby Lobby - just need to seal it (reviews said sometimes sand leaks, so use transparent caulk)<\/li>\n<li><strong>Custom Wire Hangers<\/strong>\u00a0- FI project\u00a0<\/li>\n<li><strong>Champagne Toasting Set<\/strong>\u00a0- Long term goal is to customize a set or buy the heart vase set listed earlier. \u00a0If it doesn't happen, I'm sure I'll live\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><u><strong>Custom Items:<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<ul><li><strong>Custom Robes<\/strong>\u00a0- GOT THEM!<\/li>\n<li><strong>Custom Cake Topper\u00a0<\/strong>- Ordered!<\/li>\n<li><strong>Signs\u00a0<\/strong>(Mr\/Mrs, Ring bearer\/Flower Girl) - GOT THEM!<\/li>\n<li><strong>TTD Dress<\/strong>\u00a0- Ordered!<\/li>\n<li><strong>Bridal Bouquet<\/strong>\u00a0- At Florist!<\/li>\n<\/ul><br \/><p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Update 2.0 - 9.9.14<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">I knew I forgot a few updates!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Bridal Hair:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">I love my hair down, due to broad shoulders, but am worried about the wind. \u00a0I plan on having my hair to the side, either in a ponytail type of hairdo or in a side bun. \u00a0We sort of played with my hair a little in my dress when my family came to visit, but I haven't fully decided. \u00a0So I put together 2 pinterest-inspired hair inspiration collages that I'll take to the hairdresser:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Side pony inspiration:<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/77496-hair-inspiration-side-down\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_479867.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Hair Inspiration - Side Down'  width='200' height='125'  alt='Hair Inspiration - Side Down' id='sml_image_view_77496' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Side bun inspiration:<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/77497-hair-inspiration-side-bun\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_500784.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Hair Inspiration - Side Bun'  width='200' height='129'  alt='Hair Inspiration - Side Bun' id='sml_image_view_77497' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I love how my hair looks to the side & long, but I also liked it to the side in a bun. \u00a0Plus the whole wind\/not having to worry about sweating out the curls, etc is appealing. \u00a0I'm not sure which way to go!!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Sand Ceremony Frame:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>I was going to have my fiancee DIY this, but my mother in law found a frame that is the right size & has double glass panes so I can put in a wedding picture after the trip. \u00a0Several reviews said it leaked, so seal it, and my FI is an engineer so I figure he can do that before we go with transparent\/clear caulking. \u00a0I also need him to figure out how much sand we'll need - we have some blue from a friend and were thinking of using sand from the beach at the resort. \u00a0It's Cancun, so the white fine sand beaches should have decent sand...theoretically. \u00a0We might have to sieve out some coral\/etc. \u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/77499-sandframe\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_146694.png' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='sandframe'  width='177' height='200'  alt='sandframe' id='sml_image_view_77499' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"133e941824801dbfcf397ed20dc1a253","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mini Update 9.15.14&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Today marks 180 days\/6 months til the wedding! &amp;nbsp;Ahhhh so excited!!! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:77936]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bonus:&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I told my wedding coordinator that we have 18 people on the same flight coming in, and she arranged a private checkin for us! &amp;nbsp;That was a great bonus that we weren&#039;t expecting!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871859,"PostDate":1410786071,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Mini Update 9.15.14<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Today marks 180 days\/6 months til the wedding! \u00a0Ahhhh so excited!!! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/77936-wedding-site\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_17334.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Wedding Site'  width='200' height='113'  alt='Wedding Site' id='sml_image_view_77936' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><em>Bonus:<\/em><\/p>\n<p>I told my wedding coordinator that we have 18 people on the same flight coming in, and she arranged a private checkin for us! \u00a0That was a great bonus that we weren't expecting!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":254,"TotalPages":26,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":250},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
