{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.5.56.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b754c9d2fe8bef469361505d1f795be2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;wow, great thread!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;the starfish brooches are gorgeous!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"marinah84\"] your to do lists are gonna keep me on track! thanks for posting :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871872,"PostDate":1410791175,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>wow, great thread!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>the starfish brooches are gorgeous!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275696\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275696-marinah84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">marinah84<\/span><\/a> your to do lists are gonna keep me on track! thanks for posting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407336954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1410819821,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57d86cd93e54f9310e13b119ce3282bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Awesome!!! Love the bridesmaids dresses. We tried one like that and when I look back at the pictures I kinda wish they chose it. Love the color variety.\n\n\nI LOL. I think a bike helmet does sound sexy :P\n\nI considered one but too shy! And no lingerie. There is a thread here I can find for you were a photog answered the question for me -- how to do it when shy and how to prepare etc.\n\n\nGreat thread!!! Great TTD!! All is great lol\n\n\nMakes me realize I should get to work! 4 months!!\n\n\nOhhh and please post pics of the MOG and MOB jewelry!!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871908,"PostDate":1410818682,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Awesome!!! Love the bridesmaids dresses. We tried one like that and when I look back at the pictures I kinda wish they chose it. Love the color variety.<br><br>\nI LOL. I think a bike helmet does sound sexy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><br>\nI considered one but too shy! And no lingerie. There is a thread here I can find for you were a photog answered the question for me -- how to do it when shy and how to prepare etc.<br><br>\nGreat thread!!! Great TTD!! All is great lol<br><br>\nMakes me realize I should get to work! 4 months!!<br><br>\nOhhh and please post pics of the MOG and MOB jewelry!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85c65ab9c716fb0d157749bec87c650e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update 9.22.14&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ties:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I did get the ties last week - they turned out awesome!! &amp;nbsp;Highly recommend&amp;nbsp;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"https:\/\/www.solidcolorneckties.com\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;https:\/\/www.solidcolorneckties.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;Marked off the list!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78332]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signs:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Here are the completed signs - love them! &amp;nbsp;I am so excited for my kiddos to carry these down the aisle. &amp;nbsp;I have to figure out now if I want my flower girl daughter to have a \"basket\" (i doubt with petals since it&#039;s outside\/littering on the beach?), and if I want a \"pillow\" for my ring bearer son (that will not have rings).&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78331]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelorette Party\/Wedding Shower:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I am actually going to head up to Chicago the week of Halloween for these two things! &amp;nbsp;Ok - just kidding, work is sending me in for a week for training &amp;amp; meetings, but they are letting me come out early so I can celebrate with my friends\/family! &amp;nbsp;The theme is apparently classy halloween - which makes me a bit nervous - but should be fun! &amp;nbsp;I feel weird having a shower, since we&#039;ve lived together for 4 years and have 2 kids, but it&#039;s going to be VERY small so I am not too worried about it. &amp;nbsp;(In fact, my mother has said she&#039;s not going to come in for it, even...) &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;My son&#039;s first birthday is the end of November, so after that completes and I have 3 months to go...I&#039;m sure I&#039;ll be updating like crazy! &amp;nbsp;For now, just trying to get little things done when I have some time :)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] - yes, I&#039;d love that thread on the boudoir session! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m super nervous LOL &amp;nbsp;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872676,"PostDate":1411401644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Update 9.22.14<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Ties:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I did get the ties last week - they turned out awesome!! \u00a0Highly recommend\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.solidcolorneckties.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.solidcolorneckties.com\/<\/a>. \u00a0Marked off the list!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78332-bow-ties\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_334050.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='bow ties'  width='113' height='200'  alt='bow ties' id='sml_image_view_78332' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Signs:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>Here are the completed signs - love them! \u00a0I am so excited for my kiddos to carry these down the aisle. \u00a0I have to figure out now if I want my flower girl daughter to have a \"basket\" (i doubt with petals since it's outside\/littering on the beach?), and if I want a \"pillow\" for my ring bearer son (that will not have rings).<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78331-wedding-signs\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_990862.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='wedding signs'  width='200' height='150'  alt='wedding signs' id='sml_image_view_78331' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Bachelorette Party\/Wedding Shower:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>I am actually going to head up to Chicago the week of Halloween for these two things! \u00a0Ok - just kidding, work is sending me in for a week for training & meetings, but they are letting me come out early so I can celebrate with my friends\/family! \u00a0The theme is apparently classy halloween - which makes me a bit nervous - but should be fun! \u00a0I feel weird having a shower, since we've lived together for 4 years and have 2 kids, but it's going to be VERY small so I am not too worried about it. \u00a0(In fact, my mother has said she's not going to come in for it, even...) \u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>My son's first birthday is the end of November, so after that completes and I have 3 months to go...I'm sure I'll be updating like crazy! \u00a0For now, just trying to get little things done when I have some time <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div><br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> - yes, I'd love that thread on the boudoir session! \u00a0I'm super nervous LOL \u00a0Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffc74fb17d0c96057bbce2c9faafdcd9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76222-bridesmaid-giftsshould-i-give-more\/page-4&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76222-bridesmaid-giftsshould-i-give-more\/page-4&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Second last post.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;:)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was going to have my daughter carry a sign too then I decided I wanted her to throw petals down the isle for me. They are in our extra&#039;s price list so I assume they don&#039;t consider it littering? but good question. &amp;nbsp;I got her a metal pail that I painted white and added some bling and ribbon to. Nothing overly fancy but liked it better than the ones in Michaels that are way over priced.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I did a shell for my son who is my ring bearer. I plan to tie on the rings for safety, but I prefer the look of them sitting in the sand in the shell.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Great job!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872713,"PostDate":1411412533,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76222-bridesmaid-giftsshould-i-give-more\/page-4' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...ive-more\/page-4<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Second last post.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was going to have my daughter carry a sign too then I decided I wanted her to throw petals down the isle for me. They are in our extra's price list so I assume they don't consider it littering? but good question. \u00a0I got her a metal pail that I painted white and added some bling and ribbon to. Nothing overly fancy but liked it better than the ones in Michaels that are way over priced.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I did a shell for my son who is my ring bearer. I plan to tie on the rings for safety, but I prefer the look of them sitting in the sand in the shell.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Great job!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc31318c5d6a559a0b71c7caec4730e7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1872713\" timestamp=\"1411426933\"]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76222-bridesmaid-giftsshould-i-give-more\/page-4\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76222-bridesmaid-giftsshould-i-give-more\/page-4[\/url]\n\nSecond last post.\n\n :)\n\nI was going to have my daughter carry a sign too then I decided I wanted her to throw petals down the isle for me. They are in our extra&#039;s price list so I assume they don&#039;t consider it littering? but good question.  I got her a metal pail that I painted white and added some bling and ribbon to. Nothing overly fancy but liked it better than the ones in Michaels that are way over priced. \n\nI did a shell for my son who is my ring bearer. I plan to tie on the rings for safety, but I prefer the look of them sitting in the sand in the shell.\n\nGreat job![\/quote]\n\nMy wedding coordinator says that we can either bring our own silk petals or buy them for $15...I think I&#039;ll buy them off ebay in the 3 colors if I go that route!  So apparently not littering, which is good to know :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1873095,"PostDate":1411641966,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 22 September 2014 - 07:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76222-bridesmaid-giftsshould-i-give-more\/page-4' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...ive-more\/page-4<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Second last post.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was going to have my daughter carry a sign too then I decided I wanted her to throw petals down the isle for me. They are in our extra's price list so I assume they don't consider it littering? but good question. \u00a0I got her a metal pail that I painted white and added some bling and ribbon to. Nothing overly fancy but liked it better than the ones in Michaels that are way over priced.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I did a shell for my son who is my ring bearer. I plan to tie on the rings for safety, but I prefer the look of them sitting in the sand in the shell.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Great job!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My wedding coordinator says that we can either bring our own silk petals or buy them for $15...I think I'll buy them off ebay in the 3 colors if I go that route! \u00a0So apparently not littering, which is good to know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.28.245.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2e3f5faa1ba44e44fb6f2ee0fb3d377","RawContent":"[quote name=\"marinah84\" post=\"1873095\" timestamp=\"1411656366\"]\nMy wedding coordinator says that we can either bring our own silk petals or buy them for $15...I think I&#039;ll buy them off ebay in the 3 colors if I go that route!  So apparently not littering, which is good to know :)[\/quote]Yay! I decided to buy theirs as Michaels were just as expensive and one more thing to pack. But I shall look on eBay (never thought of that) to find a better price! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1873097,"PostDate":1411642348,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>marinah84, on 25 September 2014 - 10:46 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>My wedding coordinator says that we can either bring our own silk petals or buy them for $15...I think I'll buy them off ebay in the 3 colors if I go that route!  So apparently not littering, which is good to know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYay! I decided to buy theirs as Michaels were just as expensive and one more thing to pack. But I shall look on eBay (never thought of that) to find a better price! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"189d880be55731e1e2f4e6c50a9736d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update 9.25.14&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve updated my to do list - well lists, who am I kidding? &amp;nbsp;I also added in some more projects. &amp;nbsp;Good thing I have over 5 months to go, haha!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Projects\/Projects Added Back to the Table&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ring Box&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So this is a brand new project. &amp;nbsp;I was looking at ring bearer pillows and did not want to spend that much on a pillow my son will probably not even hold (and no rings on it!) at 15 months. &amp;nbsp;I saw some alternatives I liked, and I really just want it for the pictures.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is an idea of what I want to DIY:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78396]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I found a tutorial (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.lesoirees-blog.com\/2013\/04\/wedding-tips-monday-diy-wooden-ring-bearer-box\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.lesoirees-blog.com\/2013\/04\/wedding-tips-monday-diy-wooden-ring-bearer-box\/&lt;\/a&gt;),&amp;nbsp;and figure I&#039;ll just find an unfinished (or finished) box that I like and use that! &amp;nbsp;I didn&#039;t want to spend $40+ on a box on Etsy, and I will probably not do any personalization. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s really just to get a few pictures haha.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flower Girl Tutu&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So while sorting through my closet, I found tulle that I had bought to make my princess daughter tutus (obviously on the backburner with all the other stuff going on!), and realized I had bought tulle in my weddings colors + white accidentally. &amp;nbsp;I originally wanted to make her a tutu dress, but have a cute dress of hers that would work. &amp;nbsp;Since I already HAVE the tulle (honestly, what else am I going to do with it?!!), I plan on trying my hand at making her one like I had originally planned! &amp;nbsp;I also have a few starfish embellishments I got on ebay and didn&#039;t know what I&#039;d do with them...so this seems like a good project for it! &amp;nbsp;And if I hate it, I have the other dress as backup&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78393]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thanks for Booking Postcards&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I want to do something for those people who booked, and I love the idea of \"Thanks for booking\" postcards. &amp;nbsp;We haven&#039;t done engagement photos (and unless we do it in the snow over the holiday, probably won&#039;t), so I&#039;ll probably just use a photo of us. &amp;nbsp;I want to use this with a groupon for Vistaprint, so it&#039;s not a high priority project. &amp;nbsp;It may turn into a beach postcard in the middle of January with a countdown to beach, when it&#039;s freezing out!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flower Girl Kissing Ball&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Along with the ring bearer box, I want to do something with my daughter but don&#039;t think I want to trust an almost 4 year old with throwing petals nicely, haha. &amp;nbsp;She probably would chase them or put down 1 at a time or dump the whole thing - you never know! &amp;nbsp;I saw these pomander\/kissing balls, and I think it&#039;d be really easy to DIY. &amp;nbsp;I have ribbon and extra starfish\/seashells, I just need the twine ball. &amp;nbsp;I think it&#039;d be cute!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78397]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Since I also know certain people wanted to see my mothers gifts (cough calgarybride2015 cough), here is what I have so far. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m going to put them in a box with a cute poem, and present them the morning of the wedding. &amp;nbsp;I got the charm here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/stores.ebay.com\/vossavenuejewelryandgift\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/stores.ebay.com\/vossavenuejewelryandgift\/&lt;\/a&gt; &amp;nbsp; She was great to work with and made me a reserved listing for one for mother of the bride &amp;amp; groom, so I could combine shipping. &lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78394]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78395]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;For my father, I&#039;m going to have a canvas made of us dancing our father\/daughter dance with the lyrics to the song superimposed. &amp;nbsp;FI is on his own for his father&#039;s gift, haha.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78398]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Updated To Do Lists:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIY&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Finish starfish boutonnieres (taking to my parents house this weekend for my mom&#039;s help!)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Finish bridesmaid bouquets &amp;amp; pack in shoeboxes (basically glue down the ribbon)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Finish tossing bouquet&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Flower girl tutu&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Flower girl kissing ball&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Ring wood box&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Finish mothers gifts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Name hangers&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Toasting glasses (or just buy the heart one you really want...)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Glue orchids in centerpieces&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome Bags&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Make \"Oh Sh!t\" kit labels &amp;amp; put together&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Make sunglasses tags (\"Don&#039;t be blinded by our love\")&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Decorate the bags with logo or starfish (OR wait for sale on wedding site for custom bags...eeek!)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Put chapstick labels &amp;amp; protectors on chapsticks&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Finish Welcome Booklet (Home printer)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Misc To Do&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Finish Ceremony Program Fans (Vistaprint)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Menu Cards (Vistaprint)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Make Kid Activity Books (Home printer)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Make luggage tag placecards with names (Home printer)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Print &amp;amp; frame Instagram Hashtag photo&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Print 5x7 couples pictures for table &amp;amp; put in frames&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;iPod playlists - ceremony, dinner, reception&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Boudoir session (Oct), get photobook printed&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Etsy cake topper (she will do after finished with this wedding season)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Pick up bridal bouquet at florist&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home To Do (not \"taking with\" stuff)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wedding dress alterations (december at the latest)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Get kids passports (december at the latest)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Get notarized permission form for family to take kids back in USA (not necessary but a safety net just in case)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;GET LEGALLY MARRIED (for tax purposes lol).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I *think* that&#039;s about it...whew. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m sure I missed a few things but oh well :) &amp;nbsp;That&#039;s why I&#039;m doing this thread, to keep myself accountable and on track!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873148,"PostDate":1411661433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Update 9.25.14<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've updated my to do list - well lists, who am I kidding? \u00a0I also added in some more projects. \u00a0Good thing I have over 5 months to go, haha!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>New Projects\/Projects Added Back to the Table<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Ring Box\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>So this is a brand new project. \u00a0I was looking at ring bearer pillows and did not want to spend that much on a pillow my son will probably not even hold (and no rings on it!) at 15 months. \u00a0I saw some alternatives I liked, and I really just want it for the pictures.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is an idea of what I want to DIY:<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78396-ring-bearer-box-idea\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_33896.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='ring bearer box idea'  width='200' height='134'  alt='ring bearer box idea' id='sml_image_view_78396' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I found a tutorial (<a href='http:\/\/www.lesoirees-blog.com\/2013\/04\/wedding-tips-monday-diy-wooden-ring-bearer-box\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.lesoirees...ing-bearer-box\/<\/a>),\u00a0and figure I'll just find an unfinished (or finished) box that I like and use that! \u00a0I didn't want to spend $40+ on a box on Etsy, and I will probably not do any personalization. \u00a0It's really just to get a few pictures haha.<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Flower Girl Tutu<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>So while sorting through my closet, I found tulle that I had bought to make my princess daughter tutus (obviously on the backburner with all the other stuff going on!), and realized I had bought tulle in my weddings colors + white accidentally. \u00a0I originally wanted to make her a tutu dress, but have a cute dress of hers that would work. \u00a0Since I already HAVE the tulle (honestly, what else am I going to do with it?!!), I plan on trying my hand at making her one like I had originally planned! \u00a0I also have a few starfish embellishments I got on ebay and didn't know what I'd do with them...so this seems like a good project for it! \u00a0And if I hate it, I have the other dress as backup<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78393-tulle-for-flower-girl-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_263900.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Tulle for Flower Girl Dress'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Tulle for Flower Girl Dress' id='sml_image_view_78393' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Thanks for Booking Postcards<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I want to do something for those people who booked, and I love the idea of \"Thanks for booking\" postcards. \u00a0We haven't done engagement photos (and unless we do it in the snow over the holiday, probably won't), so I'll probably just use a photo of us. \u00a0I want to use this with a groupon for Vistaprint, so it's not a high priority project. \u00a0It may turn into a beach postcard in the middle of January with a countdown to beach, when it's freezing out!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Flower Girl Kissing Ball<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Along with the ring bearer box, I want to do something with my daughter but don't think I want to trust an almost 4 year old with throwing petals nicely, haha. \u00a0She probably would chase them or put down 1 at a time or dump the whole thing - you never know! \u00a0I saw these pomander\/kissing balls, and I think it'd be really easy to DIY. \u00a0I have ribbon and extra starfish\/seashells, I just need the twine ball. \u00a0I think it'd be cute!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78397-kissing-ball\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_18829.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='kissing ball'  width='138' height='200'  alt='kissing ball' id='sml_image_view_78397' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Since I also know certain people wanted to see my mothers gifts (cough calgarybride2015 cough), here is what I have so far. \u00a0I'm going to put them in a box with a cute poem, and present them the morning of the wedding. \u00a0I got the charm here:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/stores.ebay.com\/vossavenuejewelryandgift\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/stores.ebay.c...jewelryandgift\/<\/a> \u00a0 She was great to work with and made me a reserved listing for one for mother of the bride & groom, so I could combine shipping. <\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78394-mother-gift-bracelet\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_1216092.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='mother gift bracelet'  width='113' height='200'  alt='mother gift bracelet' id='sml_image_view_78394' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78395-mother-gift-bracelet\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_3478321.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='mother gift bracelet'  width='113' height='200'  alt='mother gift bracelet' id='sml_image_view_78395' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>For my father, I'm going to have a canvas made of us dancing our father\/daughter dance with the lyrics to the song superimposed. \u00a0FI is on his own for his father's gift, haha.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78398-00fbfd956e25bb1d562b5f41d5559de3\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_160744.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='00fbfd956e25bb1d562b5f41d5559de3'  width='160' height='200'  alt='00fbfd956e25bb1d562b5f41d5559de3' id='sml_image_view_78398' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Updated To Do Lists:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>DIY<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Finish starfish boutonnieres (taking to my parents house this weekend for my mom's help!)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Finish bridesmaid bouquets & pack in shoeboxes (basically glue down the ribbon)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Finish tossing bouquet<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Flower girl tutu<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Flower girl kissing ball<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Ring wood box<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Finish mothers gifts<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Name hangers<\/span><\/li>\n<li>Toasting glasses (or just buy the heart one you really want...)<\/li>\n<li>Glue orchids in centerpieces<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Welcome Bags<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li>Make \"Oh Sh!t\" kit labels & put together<\/li>\n<li>Make sunglasses tags (\"Don't be blinded by our love\")<\/li>\n<li>Decorate the bags with logo or starfish (OR wait for sale on wedding site for custom bags...eeek!)<\/li>\n<li>Put chapstick labels & protectors on chapsticks<\/li>\n<li>Finish Welcome Booklet (Home printer)<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Misc To Do<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li>Finish Ceremony Program Fans (Vistaprint)<\/li>\n<li>Menu Cards (Vistaprint)<\/li>\n<li>Make Kid Activity Books (Home printer)<\/li>\n<li>Make luggage tag placecards with names (Home printer)<\/li>\n<li>Print & frame Instagram Hashtag photo<\/li>\n<li>Print 5x7 couples pictures for table & put in frames<\/li>\n<li>iPod playlists - ceremony, dinner, reception<\/li>\n<li>Boudoir session (Oct), get photobook printed<\/li>\n<li>Etsy cake topper (she will do after finished with this wedding season)<\/li>\n<li>Pick up bridal bouquet at florist<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Home To Do (not \"taking with\" stuff)<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li>Wedding dress alterations (december at the latest)<\/li>\n<li>Get kids passports (december at the latest)<\/li>\n<li>Get notarized permission form for family to take kids back in USA (not necessary but a safety net just in case)<\/li>\n<li>GET LEGALLY MARRIED (for tax purposes lol).<\/li>\n<\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I *think* that's about it...whew. \u00a0I'm sure I missed a few things but oh well <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0That's why I'm doing this thread, to keep myself accountable and on track!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.28.245.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e4fdd725d7d22d578374bb07baa5399","RawContent":"Awesome job lady!\n\nLove the jewelry! Very talented. \n\n\nOMG makes me think I need to get moving on my stuff :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1873151,"PostDate":1411663066,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Awesome job lady!<br>\nLove the jewelry! Very talented. <br><br>\nOMG makes me think I need to get moving on my stuff <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.71.158.229","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8682e4af6fa6bb69ff41f0f84a02cfcb","RawContent":"Wow, you done so much already. Love your inspirations. I feel like I&#039;ve only accomplished 1\/10 that you have. I need to get moving.","Attachments":[],"Id":1873230,"PostDate":1411688161,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow, you done so much already. Love your inspirations. I feel like I've only accomplished 1\/10 that you have. I need to get moving. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409076707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9eada2304d94704544d3f29a8b3a8991","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Update 9.29.14&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;So I came home from a long weekend visiting with family, and came home with lots of the things I needed! &amp;nbsp;Oh how I miss being able to shop in brick &amp;amp; mortar stores!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flower Girl Kissing Ball&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;I found a twig twine ball that was perfect in size (6\" I believe) for $3.47 at my parent&#039;s Walmart! &amp;nbsp;(Frustrating, since I only have a walmart in this small town and they didn&#039;t carry them!). &amp;nbsp;The same ball online at Walmart.com was $4.99 and on ebay was $7! &amp;nbsp;Score! &amp;nbsp;I also got some sparkly pink ribbon that I know my daughter will love, and it&#039;s really close to my bridesmaid raspberry pink\/purple, so it works. &amp;nbsp;Trying to figure out what I want to do with the shells - pictures online used moss, but I don&#039;t want to risk them confiscating due to \"plant material\". &amp;nbsp;I could just leave the shells loose in there, but then they flip over\/don&#039;t look great, etc. &amp;nbsp;I may try to hot glue them to some material, maybe some extra tulle? &amp;nbsp;Then it&#039;s going to be tough getting it in there! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ll play with it :)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78450]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ring Bearer Box&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Hobby Lobby was having 50% off their wood boxes, and I found a beautiful box with an awesome clasp for $5! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ll have to do a bit of customization, in that I will have to cut\/stain or paint\/adhere wood dividers, but it&#039;s gorgeous! &amp;nbsp;My sister did find an unfinished wood box EXACTLY like the tutorial DIY box I posted above there, for around the same price...but I would have had to stain it (aka more work) and it was kinda cheap-y (clasp &amp;amp; hinges were not great). &amp;nbsp;For the same price, this one is beautiful and I&#039;ll probably display it with the rest of my wedding stuff :)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78451]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78452]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78453]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cake Knife\/Server&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I&#039;ve been watching a few sets on ebay - 2 styles are \"beachy\" and 1 is just acrylic. &amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t decide if I want to do the \"beach\" one (which is anywhere from like $15-30) or just get the $6 one and add some ribbon &amp;amp; a shell. &amp;nbsp;This is something I&#039;d want to re-sell, so not doing the personalized one for $20 (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.ebay.com\/itm\/271403011070?_trksid=p2055119.m1438.l2649&amp;amp;ssPageName=STRK%3AMEBIDX%3AIT&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.ebay.com\/itm\/271403011070?_trksid=p2055119.m1438.l2649&amp;amp;ssPageName=STRK%3AMEBIDX%3AIT&lt;\/a&gt;) - I&#039;m doing a lot of personalized things, and this seems just like too much, haha! &lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;What do you guys think??&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78454]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78455]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I would DIY this one:&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78456]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boudoir &amp;amp; TTD prop!&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not wearing a veil for my wedding, but I figured I needed one for the Boudoir session &amp;amp; TTD, just because! &amp;nbsp;So since Hobby Lobby had 50% off wedding items, I grabbed a long one there. &amp;nbsp;Nothing fancy, just something that will be good for those types of photos based on my online research!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78458]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I figure certain family members will post pictures regardless of what I say (especially since some will be staying on the adults only side with free wifi), so I&#039;m doing an official hashtag &amp;amp; the Wedding Party photo app. &amp;nbsp;I plan on putting this on the escort card table. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78459]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Just for fun!&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I saw this at Hobby Lobby and fell in love - it&#039;s pretty hilarious. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s not going to the wedding, just in my laundry room, but thought you all would appreciate a good laugh&amp;nbsp; :lol:&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78457]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873695,"PostDate":1411994224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Update 9.29.14<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">So I came home from a long weekend visiting with family, and came home with lots of the things I needed! \u00a0Oh how I miss being able to shop in brick & mortar stores!!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Flower Girl Kissing Ball<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">I found a twig twine ball that was perfect in size (6\" I believe) for $3.47 at my parent's Walmart! \u00a0(Frustrating, since I only have a walmart in this small town and they didn't carry them!). \u00a0The same ball online at Walmart.com was $4.99 and on ebay was $7! \u00a0Score! \u00a0I also got some sparkly pink ribbon that I know my daughter will love, and it's really close to my bridesmaid raspberry pink\/purple, so it works. \u00a0Trying to figure out what I want to do with the shells - pictures online used moss, but I don't want to risk them confiscating due to \"plant material\". \u00a0I could just leave the shells loose in there, but then they flip over\/don't look great, etc. \u00a0I may try to hot glue them to some material, maybe some extra tulle? \u00a0Then it's going to be tough getting it in there! \u00a0I'll play with it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78450-20140929-0900381\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_888957.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='20140929 090038[1]'  width='113' height='200'  alt='20140929 090038[1]' id='sml_image_view_78450' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Ring Bearer Box<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>Hobby Lobby was having 50% off their wood boxes, and I found a beautiful box with an awesome clasp for $5! \u00a0I'll have to do a bit of customization, in that I will have to cut\/stain or paint\/adhere wood dividers, but it's gorgeous! \u00a0My sister did find an unfinished wood box EXACTLY like the tutorial DIY box I posted above there, for around the same price...but I would have had to stain it (aka more work) and it was kinda cheap-y (clasp & hinges were not great). \u00a0For the same price, this one is beautiful and I'll probably display it with the rest of my wedding stuff <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78451-20140929-0901551\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_2663079.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='20140929 090155[1]'  width='200' height='113'  alt='20140929 090155[1]' id='sml_image_view_78451' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78452-20140929-0902041\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_4588262.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='20140929 090204[1]'  width='200' height='113'  alt='20140929 090204[1]' id='sml_image_view_78452' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78453-20140929-0903011\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_1382289.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='20140929 090301[1]'  width='113' height='200'  alt='20140929 090301[1]' id='sml_image_view_78453' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Cake Knife\/Server<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>I've been watching a few sets on ebay - 2 styles are \"beachy\" and 1 is just acrylic. \u00a0I can't decide if I want to do the \"beach\" one (which is anywhere from like $15-30) or just get the $6 one and add some ribbon & a shell. \u00a0This is something I'd want to re-sell, so not doing the personalized one for $20 (<a href='http:\/\/www.ebay.com\/itm\/271403011070?_trksid=p2055119.m1438.l2649&ssPageName=STRK%3AMEBIDX%3AIT' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.ebay.com\/...=STRK:MEBIDX:IT<\/a>) - I'm doing a lot of personalized things, and this seems just like too much, haha! <\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><em>What do you guys think??<\/em><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78454-beach-knife-tan-shell-set\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_882.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='beach knife Tan shell Set'  width='200' height='151'  alt='beach knife Tan shell Set' id='sml_image_view_78454' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78455-beach-knife-white-set\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_32832.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='beach knife white Set'  width='200' height='200'  alt='beach knife white Set' id='sml_image_view_78455' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I would DIY this one:<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78456-beach-knife-diy-set\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_7199.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='beach knife DIY Set'  width='200' height='200'  alt='beach knife DIY Set' id='sml_image_view_78456' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Boudoir & TTD prop!<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I'm not wearing a veil for my wedding, but I figured I needed one for the Boudoir session & TTD, just because! \u00a0So since Hobby Lobby had 50% off wedding items, I grabbed a long one there. \u00a0Nothing fancy, just something that will be good for those types of photos based on my online research!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78458-20140929-1037501\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_210583.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='20140929 103750[1]'  width='200' height='113'  alt='20140929 103750[1]' id='sml_image_view_78458' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I figure certain family members will post pictures regardless of what I say (especially since some will be staying on the adults only side with free wifi), so I'm doing an official hashtag & the Wedding Party photo app. \u00a0I plan on putting this on the escort card table. \u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78459-20140929-1122151\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_2302002.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='20140929 112215[1]'  width='200' height='113'  alt='20140929 112215[1]' id='sml_image_view_78459' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><b>Just for fun!<\/b><\/div>\n<div>I saw this at Hobby Lobby and fell in love - it's pretty hilarious. \u00a0It's not going to the wedding, just in my laundry room, but thought you all would appreciate a good laugh\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78457-20140929-1037111\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_2055657.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='20140929 103711[1]'  width='200' height='113'  alt='20140929 103711[1]' id='sml_image_view_78457' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":254,"TotalPages":26,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":250},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
