{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a8b4010726a469dbcb2d0561cd73319","RawContent":"Awesome sales!! You got lots to work on now.  I love that sign and would totally buy it if I had one here!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1873707,"PostDate":1411997731,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Awesome sales!! You got lots to work on now.  I love that sign and would totally buy it if I had one here!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.32.161.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83e2a3f8df133875f2054ad4d64bf577","RawContent":"FI says now he has permission to never do laundry again, ha!","Attachments":[],"Id":1873778,"PostDate":1412072702,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                FI says now he has permission to never do laundry again, ha!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"991e266b7f4b179036f831d20dcb8e18","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Update 10.1.14&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Today is a flower update!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flower Girl Ball&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;I finished the ball, and I like it! &amp;nbsp;I ended up leaving the shells and 2 smaller starfish loose. &amp;nbsp;I like it! &amp;nbsp;The bow was a pain, but it&#039;s pretty simple.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78468]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridal Bouquet&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The florist texted me pictures today of the cascade bouquet they put together with the flowers I ordered, and I love it! &amp;nbsp;I haven&#039;t seen it in person, but will pick it up tomorrow or tonight (2 sick kiddos means probably not tonight lol). &amp;nbsp;She&#039;s going to add the ribbon on the handle and a charm I picked out that says \"Love\". &amp;nbsp;Can&#039;t wait to see the finished product! (And then pack it away so it doesn&#039;t get dusty!)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78531]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78532]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873954,"PostDate":1412175928,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Update 10.1.14<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Today is a flower update!!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Flower Girl Ball<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">I finished the ball, and I like it! \u00a0I ended up leaving the shells and 2 smaller starfish loose. \u00a0I like it! \u00a0The bow was a pain, but it's pretty simple.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/78468-picsart-14120194736141\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_206320.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='PicsArt 1412019473614[1]'  width='200' height='150'  alt='PicsArt 1412019473614[1]' id='sml_image_view_78468' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Bridal Bouquet<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The florist texted me pictures today of the cascade bouquet they put together with the flowers I ordered, and I love it! \u00a0I haven't seen it in person, but will pick it up tomorrow or tonight (2 sick kiddos means probably not tonight lol). \u00a0She's going to add the ribbon on the handle and a charm I picked out that says \"Love\". \u00a0Can't wait to see the finished product! (And then pack it away so it doesn't get dusty!)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/78531-cascade-bouquet-trial\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_129572.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='cascade bouquet trial'  width='150' height='200'  alt='cascade bouquet trial' id='sml_image_view_78531' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/78532-cascade-bouquet-trial\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_185820.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='cascade bouquet trial'  width='150' height='200'  alt='cascade bouquet trial' id='sml_image_view_78532' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.20.175.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23929e234c82aa3af681104f6830464c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Marinah - the flowers are pretty! and I like the ball too, that turned out fantastic.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;love the laundry sign. believe it or not...my husband does his own laundry. I like it that way.....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873955,"PostDate":1412178253,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Marinah - the flowers are pretty! and I like the ball too, that turned out fantastic.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>love the laundry sign. believe it or not...my husband does his own laundry. I like it that way.....<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309643480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.31.106.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b0d4831dc8b5021e899d10278c95a49","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love the flower girl ball and your bouquet! I can&#039;t believe how much you&#039;ve done already. I&#039;m such a bum... I haven&#039;t even figured out my invitations yet.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873968,"PostDate":1412182185,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love the flower girl ball and your bouquet! I can't believe how much you've done already. I'm such a bum... I haven't even figured out my invitations yet.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409076707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce1c7953f695141150c12c8ec013b0db","RawContent":"[quote name=\"puravida2015\" post=\"1873968\" timestamp=\"1412196585\"]\nLove the flower girl ball and your bouquet! I can&#039;t believe how much you&#039;ve done already. I&#039;m such a bum... I haven&#039;t even figured out my invitations yet.[\/quote]\n\nWith 2 small kids, you have to prioritize or it never gets done!  You&#039;ve still got time for invites, especially if you have a wedding website.  I&#039;ve found invites are really just to say \"ok you really need to start looking at booking now...\", at least with my family &amp;amp; friends.  Of course, I picked the most popular spring break weekend by accident so prices are pretty high right now for that week :(  still decently priced but sheesh!","Attachments":[],"Id":1874004,"PostDate":1412210380,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>puravida2015, on 01 October 2014 - 04:49 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Love the flower girl ball and your bouquet! I can't believe how much you've done already. I'm such a bum... I haven't even figured out my invitations yet.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>With 2 small kids, you have to prioritize or it never gets done! \u00a0You've still got time for invites, especially if you have a wedding website. \u00a0I've found invites are really just to say \"ok you really need to start looking at booking now...\", at least with my family & friends. \u00a0Of course, I picked the most popular spring break weekend by accident so prices are pretty high right now for that week <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \u00a0still decently priced but sheesh! \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.239.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e07f5e18051c4f757833cd022a58efb2","RawContent":"And that&#039;s exactly what I need to say to my friends and family. LOL Well I&#039;m going to use your thread as the push to get moving on my planning. :) Thank you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1874008,"PostDate":1412213643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                And that's exactly what I need to say to my friends and family. LOL Well I'm going to use your thread as the push to get moving on my planning. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Thank you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409076707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.5.56.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"665d80ece601b9d979349bbf10b806a6","RawContent":"Love the FG  ball so cute","Attachments":[],"Id":1874118,"PostDate":1412278602,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Love the FG  ball so cute \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407336954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.32.161.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"520762b50ca91a7bcdefa6075748a592","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update 10.3.14&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Some quick updates!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cake Knife\/Server:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;I ended up purchasing the plain cake &amp;amp; knife set and will customize with charms\/shells. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve seen some cute ones with ribbons so I&#039;ll probably get \"inspired\" by some of those!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toasting Glass Set:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Bit the bullet and purchase the customized toasting glass set that basically helped me to fall in love with a beach wedding\/make up my mind I had to have one! &amp;nbsp;I purchased on eBay since it seemed it was the same sellers just with free shipping (probably to capture \"bargain\" ebayers!)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78544]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Survival Kits:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Today I had some down time, and designed the Survival Kit labels and test printed! &amp;nbsp;My printer is apparently out of colored ink (tho they look full to me...) so I had to do B&amp;amp;W. &amp;nbsp;Here are the computer images and what it looks like printed out (non-stuffed). &amp;nbsp;I designed the 2 images in Picmonkey with inspiration from @[member=\"MK0386\"] and her thread here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72688-my-diy-survival-kit-label-for-oot-bag-with-pics-and-list-of-items-with-price-breakdown\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72688-my-diy-survival-kit-label-for-oot-bag-with-pics-and-list-of-items-with-price-breakdown\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;I put the front &amp;amp; back images together on a little less than half a page in word, flipped the back image around so it&#039;d be right side up when I folded, and \"grouped\" them together so I could easily alter the size. &amp;nbsp;First try it was too big, this is pretty much perfect, aka the size I&#039;m sticking with!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Front:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78540]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Back:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78541]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Together on Word doc:&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78539]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;B&amp;amp;W test print &amp;amp; staple&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78542]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wedding Bouquet:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Picked up my bouquet - I love it! &amp;nbsp;I may try to put a few white orchids in the cascade part, as it&#039;s a LOT of blue, but the bouquet itself is gorgeous. &amp;nbsp;Perfect size for what I wanted, as well! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My dog was curious as to what I was doing, haha:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78543]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is the charm\/ribbon on the stems:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78545]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Updated To Do Lists (red are projects I am planning on tackling next):&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIY&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"&gt;October - Finish mothers gifts&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"&gt;October - Flower girl tutu&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;October - Pick up starfish boutonnieres (from my mom&#039;s house)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;October - Finish bridesmaid bouquets &amp;amp; pack in shoeboxes (basically glue down the ribbon)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;October - Finish tossing bouquet&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;November - Ring wood box&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;November - Glue orchids in centerpieces&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;November - Glitter TTD heels&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;December - Name hangers&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome Bags&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;October - Print &amp;amp; Put together \"Survival Week\" kits&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;October - Put chapstick labels &amp;amp; protectors on chapsticks&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;November - Make sunglasses tags (\"Don&#039;t be blinded by our love\")&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;January - Decorate the bags with raffia ribbon &amp;amp; tags (OR wait for sale on wedding site for custom bags...eeek!)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;February - Finish Welcome Booklet (Home printer)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Misc To Do&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ongoing - iPod playlists - ceremony, dinner, reception&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;October - Boudoir session, get photobook printed&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;December? - Etsy cake topper (she will do after finished with this wedding season)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;October - Make Kid Activity Books (Home printer)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;January - Make luggage tag placecards with names (Home printer)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;January - Print 5x7 couples pictures for table &amp;amp; put in frames&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;January - Finish &amp;amp; Print Ceremony Program Fans (Vistaprint)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;January - Thank You\/Menu Cards for plates (Vistaprint)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home To Do (not \"taking with\" stuff)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;December - Wedding dress alterations (december at the latest)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;December - Get kids passports (december at the latest)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;December - Get notarized permission form for family to take kids back in USA (not necessary but a safety net just in case)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;November\/December - GET LEGALLY MARRIED (for tax purposes lol).&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874185,"PostDate":1412366666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Update 10.3.14<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Some quick updates!<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><strong>Cake Knife\/Server:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span>I ended up purchasing the plain cake & knife set and will customize with charms\/shells. \u00a0I've seen some cute ones with ribbons so I'll probably get \"inspired\" by some of those!<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span><strong>Toasting Glass Set:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Bit the bullet and purchase the customized toasting glass set that basically helped me to fall in love with a beach wedding\/make up my mind I had to have one! \u00a0I purchased on eBay since it seemed it was the same sellers just with free shipping (probably to capture \"bargain\" ebayers!)<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/78544-toasting-glass-set\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_12890.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='toasting glass Set'  width='160' height='200'  alt='toasting glass Set' id='sml_image_view_78544' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><strong>Survival Kits:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Today I had some down time, and designed the Survival Kit labels and test printed! \u00a0My printer is apparently out of colored ink (tho they look full to me...) so I had to do B&W. \u00a0Here are the computer images and what it looks like printed out (non-stuffed). \u00a0I designed the 2 images in Picmonkey with inspiration from @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"260575\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/260575-mk0386\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MK0386<\/span><\/a> and her thread here:\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72688-my-diy-survival-kit-label-for-oot-bag-with-pics-and-list-of-items-with-price-breakdown\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...rice-breakdown\/<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\">I put the front & back images together on a little less than half a page in word, flipped the back image around so it'd be right side up when I folded, and \"grouped\" them together so I could easily alter the size. \u00a0First try it was too big, this is pretty much perfect, aka the size I'm sticking with!<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Front:<\/p>\n<div>\n<p><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/78540-survivial-kit-toppers-front\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_64947.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='survivial kit toppers front'  width='200' height='75'  alt='survivial kit toppers front' id='sml_image_view_78540' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Back:<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/78541-survival-kit-toppers-back\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_37720.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='survival kit toppers back'  width='200' height='75'  alt='survival kit toppers back' id='sml_image_view_78541' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Together on Word doc:<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/78539-survival-kit-toppers\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_304250.png' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='survival Kit toppers'  width='200' height='133'  alt='survival Kit toppers' id='sml_image_view_78539' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>B&W test print & staple<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/78542-survival-kit-toppers-bw-test-run\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_346404.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='survival kit toppers b&w test run'  width='150' height='200'  alt='survival kit toppers b&w test run' id='sml_image_view_78542' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Wedding Bouquet:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Picked up my bouquet - I love it! \u00a0I may try to put a few white orchids in the cascade part, as it's a LOT of blue, but the bouquet itself is gorgeous. \u00a0Perfect size for what I wanted, as well! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My dog was curious as to what I was doing, haha:<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/78543-bridal-bouquet\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_432662.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='bridal bouquet'  width='103' height='200'  alt='bridal bouquet' id='sml_image_view_78543' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is the charm\/ribbon on the stems:<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/78545-bouquet-ribbon-with-charm\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_1484622.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='bouquet ribbon with charm'  width='113' height='200'  alt='bouquet ribbon with charm' id='sml_image_view_78545' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Updated To Do Lists (red are projects I am planning on tackling next):<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><strong>DIY<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">October - Finish mothers gifts<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">October - Flower girl tutu<\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<li>October - Pick up starfish boutonnieres (from my mom's house)<\/li>\n<li>October - Finish bridesmaid bouquets & pack in shoeboxes (basically glue down the ribbon)<\/li>\n<li>October - Finish tossing bouquet<\/li>\n<li><span>November - Ring wood box<\/span><\/li>\n<li>November - Glue orchids in centerpieces<\/li>\n<li>November - Glitter TTD heels<\/li>\n<li>December - Name hangers<\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><strong>Welcome Bags<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">October - Print & Put together \"Survival Week\" kits<\/span><\/li>\n<li>October - Put chapstick labels & protectors on chapsticks<\/li>\n<li>November - Make sunglasses tags (\"Don't be blinded by our love\")<\/li>\n<li>January - Decorate the bags with raffia ribbon & tags (OR wait for sale on wedding site for custom bags...eeek!)<\/li>\n<li>February - Finish Welcome Booklet (Home printer)<\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><strong>Misc To Do<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li>Ongoing - iPod playlists - ceremony, dinner, reception<\/li>\n<li>October - Boudoir session, get photobook printed\u00a0<\/li>\n<li>December? - Etsy cake topper (she will do after finished with this wedding season)<\/li>\n<li>October - Make Kid Activity Books (Home printer)<\/li>\n<li>January - Make luggage tag placecards with names (Home printer)<\/li>\n<li><span>January - Print 5x7 couples pictures for table & put in frames<\/span><\/li>\n<li>January - Finish & Print Ceremony Program Fans (Vistaprint)\u00a0<\/li>\n<li>January - Thank You\/Menu Cards for plates (Vistaprint)\u00a0<\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><strong>Home To Do (not \"taking with\" stuff)<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul><li>December - Wedding dress alterations (december at the latest)<\/li>\n<li>December - Get kids passports (december at the latest)<\/li>\n<li>December - Get notarized permission form for family to take kids back in USA (not necessary but a safety net just in case)<\/li>\n<li>November\/December - GET LEGALLY MARRIED (for tax purposes lol).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1412367111,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d7853a694ede39166b4eb02e7c22356","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Everything looks great.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What font is that? I really love how it looks and may use it somewhere myself.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know exactly who the other BDW member you are speaking of, I loved her work too!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think the safety net letter is a great idea.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I traveled to the USA in August and had a &#039;non notarized&#039; letter from the kids dad and the border didn&#039;t even ask for it, but just in case I plan to have a &#039;notarized&#039; letter from him as this is a little bit bigger of a deal than a trip to Seattle! lol!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What sunglasses are you buying? &amp;nbsp;I bought my kids these pink and orange sunglasses from the dollar store this summer but they were more adult size. I joked about getting the bridal party all a pair for a fun pictures but never did. Still debating doing it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I may start my planning thread this weekend! &amp;nbsp;The kids are with their dad and my fiance is gone, so I have some time.... well probably hahah I plan to spend a lot of time in the mall! ha!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874187,"PostDate":1412367073,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Everything looks great.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What font is that? I really love how it looks and may use it somewhere myself.<\/p>\n<p>I know exactly who the other BDW member you are speaking of, I loved her work too!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think the safety net letter is a great idea.<\/p>\n<p>I traveled to the USA in August and had a 'non notarized' letter from the kids dad and the border didn't even ask for it, but just in case I plan to have a 'notarized' letter from him as this is a little bit bigger of a deal than a trip to Seattle! lol!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What sunglasses are you buying? \u00a0I bought my kids these pink and orange sunglasses from the dollar store this summer but they were more adult size. I joked about getting the bridal party all a pair for a fun pictures but never did. Still debating doing it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I may start my planning thread this weekend! \u00a0The kids are with their dad and my fiance is gone, so I have some time.... well probably hahah I plan to spend a lot of time in the mall! ha!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":254,"TotalPages":26,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":250},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
