{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.5.56.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"989c5007088bb54d575630115c28e7d8","RawContent":"@[member=\"marinah84\"] I need to steal your to do list so I have stuff done by dec!","Attachments":[],"Id":1874199,"PostDate":1412383965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275696\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275696-marinah84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">marinah84<\/span><\/a> I need to steal your to do list so I have stuff done by dec!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407336954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.119.43","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91f8cd02130f9b779e38f41ffd01a2ed","RawContent":"Good luck!  :)  yesterday the florist joked that I brought her more business because she could be putting off of my bouquet because I didn&#039;t need it for so long and she kept getting more business that took her away from doing it!  She told me to bring her any other project that I needed done in 6 months haha\n[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1874187\" timestamp=\"1412381473\"]\nEverything looks great.\n\nWhat font is that? I really love how it looks and may use it somewhere myself.\nI know exactly who the other BDW member you are speaking of, I loved her work too!\n\nI think the safety net letter is a great idea.\nI traveled to the USA in August and had a &#039;non notarized&#039; letter from the kids dad and the border didn&#039;t even ask for it, but just in case I plan to have a &#039;notarized&#039; letter from him as this is a little bit bigger of a deal than a trip to Seattle! lol!\n\nWhat sunglasses are you buying?  I bought my kids these pink and orange sunglasses from the dollar store this summer but they were more adult size. I joked about getting the bridal party all a pair for a fun pictures but never did. Still debating doing it.\n\nI may start my planning thread this weekend!  The kids are with their dad and my fiance is gone, so I have some time.... well probably hahah I plan to spend a lot of time in the mall! ha![\/quote]The font is called Rue on picmonkey.com!  I just designed the image (took a bit to figure it out,  I just kept saving different versions since you can&#039;t go back and edit it later once you close it...I think. ..).\n\nEnjoy the mall Lol!  I&#039;m going running alone after having the sick kiddos alllllll week...surprised I got Anything!  done!\nAnd Kim - totally do your thread!  :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1874230,"PostDate":1412421357,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good luck!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  yesterday the florist joked that I brought her more business because she could be putting off of my bouquet because I didn't need it for so long and she kept getting more business that took her away from doing it!  She told me to bring her any other project that I needed done in 6 months haha<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 03 October 2014 - 08:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Everything looks great.<br><br>\nWhat font is that? I really love how it looks and may use it somewhere myself.<br>\nI know exactly who the other BDW member you are speaking of, I loved her work too!<br><br>\nI think the safety net letter is a great idea.<br>\nI traveled to the USA in August and had a 'non notarized' letter from the kids dad and the border didn't even ask for it, but just in case I plan to have a 'notarized' letter from him as this is a little bit bigger of a deal than a trip to Seattle! lol!<br><br>\nWhat sunglasses are you buying?  I bought my kids these pink and orange sunglasses from the dollar store this summer but they were more adult size. I joked about getting the bridal party all a pair for a fun pictures but never did. Still debating doing it.<br><br>\nI may start my planning thread this weekend!  The kids are with their dad and my fiance is gone, so I have some time.... well probably hahah I plan to spend a lot of time in the mall! ha!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThe font is called Rue on picmonkey.com!  I just designed the image (took a bit to figure it out,  I just kept saving different versions since you can't go back and edit it later once you close it...I think. ..).<br><br>\nEnjoy the mall Lol!  I'm going running alone after having the sick kiddos alllllll week...surprised I got Anything!  done!<br \/>And Kim - totally do your thread!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b1c88d663a8ce33d640d15ae7744020","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update 10.12.14&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Got quite a bit done this weekend! &amp;nbsp;Of course not exactly what I was PLANNING on doing...but that&#039;s okay! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toasting Glasses:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Got this in the mail - looks awesome! &amp;nbsp;They didn&#039;t have an option to engrave in black :( &amp;nbsp;but overall, I like how it turned out!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;stock image:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78544]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Set in package (didn&#039;t unwrap sand\/shells):&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78678]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Engraving!:&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78677]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cocktail Hour Straws:&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nI had bought a bunch of straws for kiddo bday parties, and found that I had 3 that were close to our colors. Since I already had paper leftover from the invites, I just printed out 1 sheet with some sayings from a template (found on Pinterest &amp;amp; later I found more on here!) and cut them out. &amp;nbsp;One thing I did instead of double sided tape was use \"Permanent Glue Sticks\", which turned out awesome. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78675]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78676]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OOT Bags:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks to tygrrlily for talking me back into sense (versus spending more money on MORE bags, haha). &amp;nbsp;I got some raffia from walmart for $2 for a bag, and it was more than enough to tie 2 dozen bags. &amp;nbsp;I also put the starfish charms I had gotten off ebay (something like 50 for 1.25) on the tags. &amp;nbsp;All that is left is to either write or stamp something on the tags. &amp;nbsp;And fill them, of course. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78672]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78673]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78674]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cake Serving Set:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;So I got the set I ordered in the mail, and I&#039;m not overly happy. &amp;nbsp;First, it was NOT the same as in the picture - different handle design &amp;amp; shape that connects the blade to the handle. &amp;nbsp;The box came that way in the mail, too! &amp;nbsp;It also looks pretty cheap - the metal colored plastic is all melted. &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;I can return it - but does it really matter if I&#039;m covering it in ribbon anyway?&lt;\/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;I wasn&#039;t overly invested in this piece looking amazing, but I&#039;m a little irritated at the shape of the pieces. &amp;nbsp;Do I return &amp;amp; spend like $5-7 more to get a \"beach\" one, or just wrap this one in ribbon to cover flaws?&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Box - came like this!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78679]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Handle of one I got:&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78681]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Listing picture (see rounded joining edges\/looks like real metal &amp;amp; different design?):&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78456]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Messed up plastic&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78680]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875425,"PostDate":1413139537,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Update 10.12.14<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Got quite a bit done this weekend! \u00a0Of course not exactly what I was PLANNING on doing...but that's okay! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Toasting Glasses:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Got this in the mail - looks awesome! \u00a0They didn't have an option to engrave in black <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \u00a0but overall, I like how it turned out!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>stock image:<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78544-toasting-glass-set\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_12890.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='toasting glass Set'  width='160' height='200'  alt='toasting glass Set' id='sml_image_view_78544' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Set in package (didn't unwrap sand\/shells):<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78678-toasting-glasses\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_1475680.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='toasting glasses'  width='200' height='113'  alt='toasting glasses' id='sml_image_view_78678' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Engraving!:<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78677-toasting-glasses\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_2776046.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='toasting glasses'  width='113' height='200'  alt='toasting glasses' id='sml_image_view_78677' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Cocktail Hour Straws:<\/strong><br>\nI had bought a bunch of straws for kiddo bday parties, and found that I had 3 that were close to our colors. Since I already had paper leftover from the invites, I just printed out 1 sheet with some sayings from a template (found on Pinterest & later I found more on here!) and cut them out. \u00a0One thing I did instead of double sided tape was use \"Permanent Glue Sticks\", which turned out awesome. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78675-cocktail-hour-straws\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_2659474.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='cocktail hour straws'  width='113' height='200'  alt='cocktail hour straws' id='sml_image_view_78675' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78676-cocktail-hour-straws\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_655671.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='cocktail hour straws'  width='113' height='200'  alt='cocktail hour straws' id='sml_image_view_78676' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>OOT Bags:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Thanks to tygrrlily for talking me back into sense (versus spending more money on MORE bags, haha). \u00a0I got some raffia from walmart for $2 for a bag, and it was more than enough to tie 2 dozen bags. \u00a0I also put the starfish charms I had gotten off ebay (something like 50 for 1.25) on the tags. \u00a0All that is left is to either write or stamp something on the tags. \u00a0And fill them, of course. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78672-oot-bags\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_1793360.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='oot bags'  width='200' height='113'  alt='oot bags' id='sml_image_view_78672' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78673-oot-bags\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_947020.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='oot bags'  width='113' height='200'  alt='oot bags' id='sml_image_view_78673' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78674-oot-bags\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_595501.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='oot bags'  width='113' height='200'  alt='oot bags' id='sml_image_view_78674' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Cake Serving Set:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>So I got the set I ordered in the mail, and I'm not overly happy. \u00a0First, it was NOT the same as in the picture - different handle design & shape that connects the blade to the handle. \u00a0The box came that way in the mail, too! \u00a0It also looks pretty cheap - the metal colored plastic is all melted. \u00a0<strong>I can return it - but does it really matter if I'm covering it in ribbon anyway?<\/strong> \u00a0I wasn't overly invested in this piece looking amazing, but I'm a little irritated at the shape of the pieces. \u00a0Do I return & spend like $5-7 more to get a \"beach\" one, or just wrap this one in ribbon to cover flaws?<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Box - came like this!<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78679-cake-serving-set-how-it-came\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_2122162.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='cake serving set - how it came'  width='113' height='200'  alt='cake serving set - how it came' id='sml_image_view_78679' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Handle of one I got:<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78681-cake-knife-wrong-handle\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_2593108.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='cake knife - wrong handle'  width='113' height='200'  alt='cake knife - wrong handle' id='sml_image_view_78681' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Listing picture (see rounded joining edges\/looks like real metal & different design?):<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78456-beach-knife-diy-set\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_7199.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='beach knife DIY Set'  width='200' height='200'  alt='beach knife DIY Set' id='sml_image_view_78456' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Messed up plastic<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78680-cake-knife-return\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_541701.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='cake knife - return?'  width='200' height='113'  alt='cake knife - return?' id='sml_image_view_78680' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1413141009,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbfb61ab582c77e72fe2455a9b8eba43","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Looks great!&amp;nbsp; Love the straws - can you post a link to the templates? I might do that if I have time... it&#039;s all starting to come up very quickly tough AH :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The bags turned out great! I think the raffia definitely does add to the beachy vibe. I still need to do the tags for mine&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hmmm - if it was just the wrong style, I&#039;d prob just cover up the knife\/server, but it honestly depends on how much it bugs you.&amp;nbsp; If it does, then sure $5 won&#039;t break the bank to change it. The melted plastic is irritating though - you&#039;re paying money and they shouldn&#039;t send you something broken!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875427,"PostDate":1413140966,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Looks great!\u00a0 Love the straws - can you post a link to the templates? I might do that if I have time... it's all starting to come up very quickly tough AH <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The bags turned out great! I think the raffia definitely does add to the beachy vibe. I still need to do the tags for mine<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hmmm - if it was just the wrong style, I'd prob just cover up the knife\/server, but it honestly depends on how much it bugs you.\u00a0 If it does, then sure $5 won't break the bank to change it. The melted plastic is irritating though - you're paying money and they shouldn't send you something broken!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395594948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.32.161.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5a07b4e7550929eef3b2439f1a4d0c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"tygrrlily\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sure thing - here are a few templates! &amp;nbsp;I used the MS Word template for mine, but the PDF one you can fill in and then print also. &amp;nbsp;You cut them out (if you have a paper cutter for crafting, I&#039;d use that versus scissors, it made cutting REALLY fast) and then fold them over the straw to get the \"shape\" of what you wanted it to look like. &amp;nbsp;I then put glue on the paper (which was still semi-folded in half\/rounded where the straw goes) and then put it together on the straw. &amp;nbsp;I then cut the ends into flags, or you could also leave it straight, up to you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875472,"PostDate":1413194152,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sure thing - here are a few templates! \u00a0I used the MS Word template for mine, but the PDF one you can fill in and then print also. \u00a0You cut them out (if you have a paper cutter for crafting, I'd use that versus scissors, it made cutting REALLY fast) and then fold them over the straw to get the \"shape\" of what you wanted it to look like. \u00a0I then put glue on the paper (which was still semi-folded in half\/rounded where the straw goes) and then put it together on the straw. \u00a0I then cut the ends into flags, or you could also leave it straight, up to you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a60bde46bb189f97eeb00e4e2982ae5b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1874187\" timestamp=\"1412381473\"]\n\nWhat sunglasses are you buying?  I bought my kids these pink and orange sunglasses from the dollar store this summer but they were more adult size. I joked about getting the bridal party all a pair for a fun pictures but never did. Still debating doing it.\n[\/quote]\n\nI got them off ebay, and they are actually decent quality!  I bought them from several ebay vendors for between 1.35-1.65 each with free shipping (they were all the same, just listings only had a few).  \n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78683]\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:78684]","Attachments":[],"Id":1875492,"PostDate":1413200480,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 03 October 2014 - 08:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What sunglasses are you buying? \u00a0I bought my kids these pink and orange sunglasses from the dollar store this summer but they were more adult size. I joked about getting the bridal party all a pair for a fun pictures but never did. Still debating doing it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got them off ebay, and they are actually decent quality! \u00a0I bought them from several ebay vendors for between 1.35-1.65 each with free shipping (they were all the same, just listings only had a few). \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78683-20141013-1027261\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_3039687.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='20141013 102726[1]'  width='200' height='113'  alt='20141013 102726[1]' id='sml_image_view_78683' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/78684-20141013-1028421\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_159517.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='20141013 102842[1]'  width='113' height='200'  alt='20141013 102842[1]' id='sml_image_view_78684' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91fdf8510b4d662c7edf20c0ebf08314","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh those are great! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Your guests will love them! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think if your serving set is not what you wanted, I would return it. &amp;nbsp;At the end of the day, in the words of Shawn, what is another $5 to get what you want? &amp;nbsp;Maybe try covering it with ribbon to see if you like it, then exchange? &amp;nbsp; It&#039;s tough cause you think &#039;it&#039;s not worth the money&#039; but then you don&#039;t want to hate it every time you see it either.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;ohhh me again, if you have time can you tell me who on EBAY you got those charms off? That&#039;s a smoking deal and I could use some of those somewhere hehe. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875521,"PostDate":1413211788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh those are great! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your guests will love them! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think if your serving set is not what you wanted, I would return it. \u00a0At the end of the day, in the words of Shawn, what is another $5 to get what you want? \u00a0Maybe try covering it with ribbon to see if you like it, then exchange? \u00a0 It's tough cause you think 'it's not worth the money' but then you don't want to hate it every time you see it either.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>ohhh me again, if you have time can you tell me who on EBAY you got those charms off? That's a smoking deal and I could use some of those somewhere hehe. Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c159a6a5cff091e591da34b243d8f70b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was thinking of just doing a mock up of the ribbon &amp;amp; charms and see if I like it...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;Free Shipping 50Pcs Tibetan Silver Crafts Jewelry starfish Charms Pendants TA434&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;$1.54&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;I got it from this seller, looks like they have 25pcs right now:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.ebay.com\/itm\/Free-Shipping-25Pcs-Tibetan-Silver-Crafts-Jewelry-starfish-Charms-Pendants-TA434-\/201192432102&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.ebay.com\/itm\/Free-Shipping-25Pcs-Tibetan-Silver-Crafts-Jewelry-starfish-Charms-Pendants-TA434-\/201192432102&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I honestly saw a TON of these for sale - I just searched no lead LOL (coming from china, you never know!). &amp;nbsp;They did take a bit to get here, so I would order soon if you were going to order them. &amp;nbsp;Tons of options if you search for \"starfish charms no lead\" :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875538,"PostDate":1413216313,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was thinking of just doing a mock up of the ribbon & charms and see if I like it...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\">Free Shipping 50Pcs Tibetan Silver Crafts Jewelry starfish Charms Pendants TA434<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\">$1.54<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\">I got it from this seller, looks like they have 25pcs right now:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.ebay.com\/itm\/Free-Shipping-25Pcs-Tibetan-Silver-Crafts-Jewelry-starfish-Charms-Pendants-TA434-\/201192432102' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.ebay.com\/...4-\/201192432102<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I honestly saw a TON of these for sale - I just searched no lead LOL (coming from china, you never know!). \u00a0They did take a bit to get here, so I would order soon if you were going to order them. \u00a0Tons of options if you search for \"starfish charms no lead\" <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.201.33.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b386ea7df92415be4b89e3467849305","RawContent":"Love your thread. I am ordering those cups...I&#039;ve been looking for something like that! : )","Attachments":[],"Id":1875733,"PostDate":1413320445,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Love your thread. I am ordering those cups...I've been looking for somethi