They are great quality!  They didn't charge any extra for the text on the back,  either. <br><br>\nI have several updates!  Hopefully will have time to update by the weekend! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":254,"TotalPages":26,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":250},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
