{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f233e630f17fa92dcd57e9fed2b2c263","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That is fantastic!!!! &amp;nbsp;She did a wonderful job.... &amp;nbsp;I am so sorry to hear about your dog (hugs)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879542,"PostDate":1417602313,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That is fantastic!!!! \u00a0She did a wonderful job.... \u00a0I am so sorry to hear about your dog (hugs)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.91.171.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54a2fcd7d7089db261b18e4494789405","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Aww man... sorry about your dog. I had to do the same thing with my cat. I had her for about 22 years. Love the cake topper though.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And thanks for the tip on the men&#039;s suits. I bet you my FI is more of a procrastinator than your&#039;s is though. He hasn&#039;t even asked his guys if they&#039;ll be in the wedding!! I sort of hinted to them already so they&#039;re coming.&amp;nbsp; Now I have to tell this fool to hurry up with their&amp;nbsp;suits\/attire.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879548,"PostDate":1417605782,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Aww man... sorry about your dog. I had to do the same thing with my cat. I had her for about 22 years. Love the cake topper though.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And thanks for the tip on the men's suits. I bet you my FI is more of a procrastinator than your's is though. He hasn't even asked his guys if they'll be in the wedding!! I sort of hinted to them already so they're coming.\u00a0 Now I have to tell this fool to hurry up with their\u00a0suits\/attire.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409076707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.246.246.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3b8a91dc6895264ff59214507a4d47f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"puravida2015\" post=\"1879548\" timestamp=\"1417620182\"]\nAww man... sorry about your dog. I had to do the same thing with my cat. I had her for about 22 years. Love the cake topper though.\n\nAnd thanks for the tip on the men&#039;s suits. I bet you my FI is more of a procrastinator than your&#039;s is though. He hasn&#039;t even asked his guys if they&#039;ll be in the wedding!! I sort of hinted to them already so they&#039;re coming.  Now I have to tell this fool to hurry up with their suits\/attire.[\/quote]\nHe just figured it out less than 2 weeks ago!!  It took him 11 months to figure out his side - 30 seconds for mine ;)  (Probably because I figured it out a long time ago haha).  \n\nThese are the suits we got - they should be here mid-month, so I can report back on quality\/fit!\n\nWe went with the slim fit and the \"Bone\" color option.  Apparently the tan isn&#039;t that dark in person, but I thought the \"bone\" fit a lot closer to what we had talked about:\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/tinyurl.com\/WeddingSuitChoices\"]http:\/\/tinyurl.com\/WeddingSuitChoices[\/url]\n\nWe ended up just getting the vest &amp;amp; pants.  On sale for $80 ($39.99 each), with 30% off\/free shipping + tax, they came to $60.71 each.  Not bad!\n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79362]\n\nGot my son this suit in 24m - it doesn&#039;t match (bone vs tan), but for $15 all in, I can find another use for it if I find another suit I like better ;).  Like rehearsal dinner\/easter\/birthdays\/weddings next year, etc :)\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.jcpenney.com\/dotcom\/gift-registry\/baby\/add-our-gifts\/boy-clothing\/khaki-vest-shirt-pants-and-tie-set-boys-12m-24m\/prod.jump?ppId=pp5003830398&amp;amp;catId=WebID&amp;amp;_requestid=55783\"]http:\/\/www.jcpenney.com\/dotcom\/gift-registry\/baby\/add-our-gifts\/boy-clothing\/khaki-vest-shirt-pants-and-tie-set-boys-12m-24m\/prod.jump?ppId=pp5003830398&amp;amp;catId=WebID&amp;amp;_requestid=55783[\/url]\n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79361]","Attachments":[],"Id":1879556,"PostDate":1417611295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>puravida2015, on 03 December 2014 - 11:23 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Aww man... sorry about your dog. I had to do the same thing with my cat. I had her for about 22 years. Love the cake topper though.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And thanks for the tip on the men's suits. I bet you my FI is more of a procrastinator than your's is though. He hasn't even asked his guys if they'll be in the wedding!! I sort of hinted to them already so they're coming.\u00a0 Now I have to tell this fool to hurry up with their\u00a0suits\/attire.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>He just figured it out less than 2 weeks ago!! \u00a0It took him 11 months to figure out his side - 30 seconds for mine <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> \u00a0(Probably because I figured it out a long time ago haha). \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These are the suits we got - they should be here mid-month, so I can report back on quality\/fit!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We went with the slim fit and the \"Bone\" color option. \u00a0Apparently the tan isn't that dark in person, but I thought the \"bone\" fit a lot closer to what we had talked about:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/tinyurl.com\/WeddingSuitChoices' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/tinyurl.com\/WeddingSuitChoices<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We ended up just getting the vest & pants. \u00a0On sale for $80 ($39.99 each), with 30% off\/free shipping + tax, they came to $60.71 each. \u00a0Not bad!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79362-suit-bone\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_72782.png' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Suit Bone'  width='174' height='200'  alt='Suit Bone' id='sml_image_view_79362' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Got my son this suit in 24m - it doesn't match (bone vs tan), but for $15 all in, I can find another use for it if I find another suit I like better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>. \u00a0Like rehearsal dinner\/easter\/birthdays\/weddings next year, etc <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.jcpenney.com\/dotcom\/gift-registry\/baby\/add-our-gifts\/boy-clothing\/khaki-vest-shirt-pants-and-tie-set-boys-12m-24m\/prod.jump?ppId=pp5003830398&catId=WebID&_requestid=55783' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jcpenney....requestid=55783<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79361-kids-suit\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17712\/sml_gallery_275696_17712_88495.png' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Kids Suit'  width='200' height='194'  alt='Kids Suit' id='sml_image_view_79361' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.91.171.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d1f8dced94c292d43005e197644bfec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s a sweet deal!!!!  I can see him waiting about a month before the wedding to figure out what they&#039;re going to wear!!! Ughhhhh!!! I&#039;m going to try not to worry about it. We&#039;re so different when it comes to stuff like this.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879571,"PostDate":1417619139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That's a sweet deal!!!!\u00a0\u00a0I can see him waiting about a month before the wedding to figure out what they're going to wear!!! Ughhhhh!!! I'm going to try not to worry about it. We're so different when it comes to stuff like this.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409076707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7bfdf7fd949bd67886d8573f47e3fdfa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You will appreciate this as a mom! &amp;nbsp; My son can barely get into his wedding shorts :( &amp;nbsp;I had to order them to the states, drive and get them, and he has grown SOOOO much! &amp;nbsp;I should have known better but man! &amp;nbsp; He can do them up but complains they are snug. I found a solid black pair (everyone is wearing pin stripe) on Old Navy so I ordered them for back up. It&#039;s not the end of the world if his aren&#039;t striped as noone will probably notice but DOH!!!!! &amp;nbsp;His top fits thankfully :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880024,"PostDate":1418129551,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You will appreciate this as a mom! \u00a0 My son can barely get into his wedding shorts <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \u00a0I had to order them to the states, drive and get them, and he has grown SOOOO much! \u00a0I should have known better but man! \u00a0 He can do them up but complains they are snug. I found a solid black pair (everyone is wearing pin stripe) on Old Navy so I ordered them for back up. It's not the end of the world if his aren't striped as noone will probably notice but DOH!!!!! \u00a0His top fits thankfully <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89c3b7931643b4edf4731cc2b4f1a68d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Loving all of the updates!\n\n\nI&#039;m so sorry to hear about your dog :(.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s a lovely momento\/keepsake&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Your recovery kits look amazing.&amp;nbsp; I think I was second in line for those bags - just missed them! :p&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And I get you on the procrastination of the FI!! If I didn&#039;t drag my FI to buy the groomsmen pants months ago in the summer, it would not have happened.&amp;nbsp; He&#039;s so good w\/ work stuff but so lazy with wedding stuff - I think our wedding is going to be as much a surprise to him as it is to our guests haha&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That little baby suit is so so cute :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880062,"PostDate":1418175337,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Loving all of the updates!<br><br>\nI'm so sorry to hear about your dog <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>.\u00a0 It's a lovely momento\/keepsake<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your recovery kits look amazing.\u00a0 I think I was second in line for those bags - just missed them! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And I get you on the procrastination of the FI!! If I didn't drag my FI to buy the groomsmen pants months ago in the summer, it would not have happened.\u00a0 He's so good w\/ work stuff but so lazy with wedding stuff - I think our wedding is going to be as much a surprise to him as it is to our guests haha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That little baby suit is so so cute <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395594948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.194.224.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d0a439bf7b7e609917d55f49a0ad301","RawContent":"I cannot tell you how much I love your thread! You are so organized, and your to do lists are inspiring lol. I have so much to do! You may have swayed me on a boudoir session, although I&#039;m not sure I can work up the nerve. So sorry about your dog, that is the worst :(. \n\nLooking forward to more updates!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1881358,"PostDate":1419986303,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I cannot tell you how much I love your thread! You are so organized, and your to do lists are inspiring lol. I have so much to do! You may have swayed me on a boudoir session, although I'm not sure I can work up the nerve. So sorry about your dog, that is the worst <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>. <br>\nLooking forward to more updates!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cathyr99@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"107.201.33.67","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1412551851,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280304.jpg?_r=1412569727","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"palmtree99","Id":280304,"Name":"palmtree99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"383a7ba6d4b7ca709fadb6ff9c138e36","RawContent":"[quote name=\"palmtree99\" post=\"1881358\" timestamp=\"1420000703\"]\nI cannot tell you how much I love your thread! You are so organized, and your to do lists are inspiring lol. I have so much to do! You may have swayed me on a boudoir session, although I&#039;m not sure I can work up the nerve. So sorry about your dog, that is the worst :(.\nLooking forward to more updates!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nThank you!\n\nThe boudoir session was SOOO much fun, and I love the finished product.  It&#039;s perfect for my fiancee, as more traditional items like watches I already get him for Christmas lol.  I know he&#039;ll appreciate it, and it&#039;s not too \"risky\" so I was comfortable with shooting the pictures.  And I&#039;ve had 2 kids in the last 3.5 years, so my body isn&#039;t as great as I wish it was ;)\n\nUpdates coming soon!  I&#039;ve got a few projects done over the holidays, and today starts my finalizing details on the projects I still have pending, things like the paper items etc.  \n\nAnd losing the 10lbs I&#039;ve gained over the 4th quarter, with bachelorette party\/work\/halloween\/thanksgiving\/my 30th bday\/christmas x3...eek.  I&#039;m so glad we didn&#039;t go with a January wedding LOL. \n\n69 days to go!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1881867,"PostDate":1420471017,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>palmtree99, on 31 December 2014 - 12:38 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I cannot tell you how much I love your thread! You are so organized, and your to do lists are inspiring lol. I have so much to do! You may have swayed me on a boudoir session, although I'm not sure I can work up the nerve. So sorry about your dog, that is the worst <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>.<br>\nLooking forward to more updates!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The boudoir session was SOOO much fun, and I love the finished product. \u00a0It's perfect for my fiancee, as more traditional items like watches I already get him for Christmas lol. \u00a0I know he'll appreciate it, and it's not too \"risky\" so I was comfortable with shooting the pictures. \u00a0And I've had 2 kids in the last 3.5 years, so my body isn't as great as I wish it was <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Updates coming soon! \u00a0I've got a few projects done over the holidays, and today starts my finalizing details on the projects I still have pending, things like the paper items etc. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And losing the 10lbs I've gained over the 4th quarter, with bachelorette party\/work\/halloween\/thanksgiving\/my 30th bday\/christmas x3...eek. \u00a0I'm so glad we didn't go with a January wedding LOL.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>69 days to go!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.27.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3abdcaec6617431854ac48d26da3dc39","RawContent":"[quote name=\"marinah84\" post=\"1875425\" timestamp=\"1413153937\"]\n\n[size=5][b]Update 10.12.14[\/b][\/size]\n\n\nGot quite a bit done this weekend!  Of course not exactly what I was PLANNING on doing...but that&#039;s okay! :)\n\n\n\n\n[b]Toasting Glasses:[\/b]\nGot this in the mail - looks awesome!  They didn&#039;t have an option to engrave in black :(  but overall, I like how it turned out!\n\nstock image:\n\n\nSet in package (didn&#039;t unwrap sand\/shells):\n\n\nEngraving!:\n\n\n\n[b]Cocktail Hour Straws:[\/b]\nI had bought a bunch of straws for kiddo bday parties, and found that I had 3 that were close to our colors. Since I already had paper leftover from the invites, I just printed out 1 sheet with some sayings from a template (found on Pinterest &amp;amp; later I found more on here!) and cut them out.  One thing I did instead of double sided tape was use \"Permanent Glue Sticks\", which turned out awesome.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n[b]OOT Bags:[\/b]\nThanks to tygrrlily for talking me back into sense (versus spending more money on MORE bags, haha).  I got some raffia from walmart for $2 for a bag, and it was more than enough to tie 2 dozen bags.  I also put the starfish charms I had gotten off ebay (something like 50 for 1.25) on the tags.  All that is left is to either write or stamp something on the tags.  And fill them, of course.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n[b]Cake Serving Set:[\/b]\nSo I got the set I ordered in the mail, and I&#039;m not overly happy.  First, it was NOT the same as in the picture - different handle design &amp;amp; shape that connects the blade to the handle.  The box came that way in the mail, too!  It also looks pretty cheap - the metal colored plastic is all melted.  [b]I can return it - but does it really matter if I&#039;m covering it in ribbon anyway?[\/b]  I wasn&#039;t overly invested in this piece looking amazing, but I&#039;m a little irritated at the shape of the pieces.  Do I return &amp;amp; spend like $5-7 more to get a \"beach\" one, or just wrap this one in ribbon to cover flaws?\n\nBox - came like this!\n\n\n\nHandle of one I got:\n\n\nListing picture (see rounded joining edges\/looks like real metal &amp;amp; different design?):\n\n\n\nMessed up plastic\n\n\n[\/quote]  Great thread! Where did you purchase the toasting glasses?","Attachments":[],"Id":1881894,"PostDate":1420484737,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>marinah84, on 12 October 2014 - 06:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Update 10.12.14<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Got quite a bit done this weekend! \u00a0Of course not exactly what I was PLANNING on doing...but that's okay! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Toasting Glasses:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Got this in the mail - looks awesome! \u00a0They didn't have an option to engrave in black <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \u00a0but overall, I like how it turned out!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>stock image:<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Set in package (didn't unwrap sand\/shells):<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Engraving!:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Cocktail Hour Straws:<\/strong><br>\nI had bought a bunch of straws for kiddo bday parties, and found that I had 3 that were close to our colors. Since I already had paper leftover from the invites, I just printed out 1 sheet with some sayings from a template (found on Pinterest & later I found more on here!) and cut them out. \u00a0One thing I did instead of double sided tape was use \"Permanent Glue Sticks\", which turned out awesome. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>OOT Bags:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Thanks to tygrrlily for talking me back into sense (versus spending more money on MORE bags, haha). \u00a0I got some raffia from walmart for $2 for a bag, and it was more than enough to tie 2 dozen bags. \u00a0I also put the starfish charms I had gotten off ebay (something like 50 for 1.25) on the tags. \u00a0All that is left is to either write or stamp something on the tags. \u00a0And fill them, of course. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Cake Serving Set:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>So I got the set I ordered in the mail, and I'm not overly happy. \u00a0First, it was NOT the same as in the picture - different handle design & shape that connects the blade to the handle. \u00a0The box came that way in the mail, too! \u00a0It also looks pretty cheap - the metal colored plastic is all melted. \u00a0<strong>I can return it - but does it really matter if I'm covering it in ribbon anyway?<\/strong> \u00a0I wasn't overly invested in this piece looking amazing, but I'm a little irritated at the shape of the pieces. \u00a0Do I return & spend like $5-7 more to get a \"beach\" one, or just wrap this one in ribbon to cover flaws?<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Box - came like this!<\/div>\n<div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Handle of one I got:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Listing picture (see rounded joining edges\/looks like real metal & different design?):<\/div>\n<div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Messed up plastic<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0 Great thread! Where did you purchase the toasting glasses?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393524530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.136.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91d4c9883f6ffa2130ecf7cf27079ede","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AyeWatSoon\" post=\"1881894\" timestamp=\"1420499137\"]\nGreat thread! Where did you purchase the toasting glasses?[\/quote]\nI ended up getting them on eBay, about $50 shipped.  I watched different ones for months, and finally took the plunge after I saw one auction style to save a bit of money.  I do wish I&#039;d gone with one that ha black etching, for better visibility on the sand, but it would have been quite a bit more. I am keeping it as a keepsake, so it&#039;s not tooooo horrible a price since it&#039;s personalized!","Attachments":[],"Id":1881952,"PostDate":1420535886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AyeWatSoon, on 05 January 2015 - 07:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nGreat thread! Where did you purchase the toasting glasses?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI ended up getting them on eBay, about $50 shipped.  I watched different ones for months, and finally took the plunge after I saw one auction style to save a bit of money.  I do wish I'd gone with one that ha black etching, for better visibility on the sand, but it would have been quite a bit more. I am keeping it as a keepsake, so it's not tooooo horrible a price since it's personalized!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":254,"TotalPages":26,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":250},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
