> Time: 1428955403 / Mon, 13 Apr 2015 20:03:23 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=77321&start=110&SessionId=cf03b096063da7de1a7ba2e294274c2b
> User MissJen3 (278914)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e2c4e775b3f6b5749c98f5ca49cab60","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1886323\" timestamp=\"1423851244\"]\nI&#039;ve been having nightmares for months! Some of them are pretty scary already so I don&#039;t know what they&#039;ll look like as we get closer! Haha\n\nIf you&#039;re lazy to do the books I would do a brochure. I&#039;ve seen someone with an amazing book on one of these threads but I&#039;m too lazy for that haha. I can barely fill out a brochure! I will make sure to put a section to people can write their friends&#039; room numbers to call each other. I&#039;m sure your guests won&#039;t think it&#039;s a big deal, getting a brochure vs. a book [emoji4][emoji5]\ufe0f\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]I had a nightmare last week that I was stood up at the alter and then my father was there in a Maple Leafs Jersey and splash pants. I&#039;m not sure what part was more terrifying.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886331,"PostDate":1423839223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 13 February 2015 - 02:14 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I've been having nightmares for months! Some of them are pretty scary already so I don't know what they'll look like as we get closer! Haha<br><br>\nIf you're lazy to do the books I would do a brochure. I've seen someone with an amazing book on one of these threads but I'm too lazy for that haha. I can barely fill out a brochure! I will make sure to put a section to people can write their friends' room numbers to call each other. I'm sure your guests won't think it's a big deal, getting a brochure vs. a book [emoji4][emoji5]\ufe0f<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I had a nightmare last week that I was stood up at the alter and then my father was there in a Maple Leafs Jersey and splash pants. I'm not sure what part was more terrifying.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.183.138.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06b33cb193504b80f5499a360194d4f1","RawContent":"Ps: I feel you about the whole being muscular thing. Seriously, my body throws on muscle so quickly, you&#039;d think I&#039;m on something haha but I&#039;m sure you&#039;ll look beautiful. \n\nI can&#039;t believe it&#039;s so close!! and the countdown begins :D yay!!! \n[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1886331\" timestamp=\"1423853623\"]\nI had a nightmare last week that I was stood up at the alter and then my father was there in a Maple Leafs Jersey and splash pants. I&#039;m not sure what part was more terrifying.[\/quote]bahah, I actually LOLed to this :P.\n\nI finally had a nice one last night! My dress was totally different but pretty, it was basically two pieces, a corset and a short pencil skirt, but then it had the tulle skirt that mine has at the back. It almost looked like one of the outfits from the evil queen on once upon a time, but white and with tulle hah. It was pretty cool :P","Attachments":[],"Id":1886332,"PostDate":1423840562,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ps: I feel you about the whole being muscular thing. Seriously, my body throws on muscle so quickly, you'd think I'm on something haha but I'm sure you'll look beautiful.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I can't believe it's so close!! and the countdown begins <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> yay!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 13 February 2015 - 02:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I had a nightmare last week that I was stood up at the alter and then my father was there in a Maple Leafs Jersey and splash pants. I'm not sure what part was more terrifying.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>bahah, I actually LOLed to this <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I finally had a nice one last night! My dress was totally different but pretty, it was basically two pieces, a corset and a short pencil skirt, but then it had the tulle skirt that mine has at the back. It almost looked like one of the outfits from the evil queen on once upon a time, but white and with tulle hah. It was pretty cool <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"819c865b0b2059baf4cd781b75dbc8f9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1886332\" timestamp=\"1423854962\"]\nPs: I feel you about the whole being muscular thing. Seriously, my body throws on muscle so quickly, you&#039;d think I&#039;m on something haha but I&#039;m sure you&#039;ll look beautiful. \n\nI can&#039;t believe it&#039;s so close!! and the countdown begins :D yay!!! \n\nbahah, I actually LOLed to this :P.\n\nI finally had a nice one last night! My dress was totally different but pretty, it was basically two pieces, a corset and a short pencil skirt, but then it had the tulle skirt that mine has at the back. It almost looked like one of the outfits from the evil queen on once upon a time, but white and with tulle hah. It was pretty cool :P[\/quote]Ooo that sounds awesome! I love tulle.. seriously.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886339,"PostDate":1423840905,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 13 February 2015 - 03:16 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Ps: I feel you about the whole being muscular thing. Seriously, my body throws on muscle so quickly, you'd think I'm on something haha but I'm sure you'll look beautiful.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I can't believe it's so close!! and the countdown begins <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> yay!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<br><p>bahah, I actually LOLed to this <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I finally had a nice one last night! My dress was totally different but pretty, it was basically two pieces, a corset and a short pencil skirt, but then it had the tulle skirt that mine has at the back. It almost looked like one of the outfits from the evil queen on once upon a time, but white and with tulle hah. It was pretty cool <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Ooo that sounds awesome! I love tulle.. seriously.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"838efd581da45d7730aa60b1e0bd7971","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m guessing it&#039;s fairly normal for brides to have nightmares like these before the wedding - someone actually told me that they didn&#039;t think I should have any stress, since it was a destination wedding. &amp;nbsp;I laughed and told her \"it&#039;s still a wedding, and it involves planning\/coordination\/etc PLUS the language barrier!\". &amp;nbsp;Oi!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m lazy, but it&#039;s more that I don&#039;t want to edit my book I made (almost a year ago lol) in terms of updating info - but mostly printing so it looks good. &amp;nbsp;It was such a hassle with the coloring book, and this is like a 20 pg little book! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I kind of want to do the book just because I have spent time on it, and it has a great section for guest names\/rooms plus resort info already, and puzzles\/games! &amp;nbsp;I work on the computer, so theoretically in between meetings it shouldn&#039;t take me toooooo horribly long to fix it - I&#039;m just stubborn ha! &amp;nbsp;It&#039;ll honestly probably take me longer to remake a brochure with the info than it will to fix the margins :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] - you are TINY!!! &amp;nbsp;I wouldn&#039;t worry about your muscle mass at all (if you were, which I don&#039;t think you were, but just in case!). &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When I swam, I seriously had delts like a football player. &amp;nbsp;I didn&#039;t work out for YEARS because I wanted to lose the muscle (which I did, but also gained fat haha). &amp;nbsp;I am definitely talking to Samuel about how to de-emphasis them in my photos (I wouldn&#039;t say no to a little photoshop, bahahaha). &amp;nbsp;It is what it is - I&#039;m just happy that I have a corset for the swelling! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m kind of worried now for the wedding band, when we put them on, if my fingers will be too swollen...didn&#039;t even think about it LOL&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I did just send off my wedding band to be duplicated for the anniversary band. &amp;nbsp;That was scary, mailing it to the jeweler. &amp;nbsp;It got there ok, and they have promised to have it back before we leave for the wedding! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886341,"PostDate":1423841252,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm guessing it's fairly normal for brides to have nightmares like these before the wedding - someone actually told me that they didn't think I should have any stress, since it was a destination wedding. \u00a0I laughed and told her \"it's still a wedding, and it involves planning\/coordination\/etc PLUS the language barrier!\". \u00a0Oi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm lazy, but it's more that I don't want to edit my book I made (almost a year ago lol) in terms of updating info - but mostly printing so it looks good. \u00a0It was such a hassle with the coloring book, and this is like a 20 pg little book! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I kind of want to do the book just because I have spent time on it, and it has a great section for guest names\/rooms plus resort info already, and puzzles\/games! \u00a0I work on the computer, so theoretically in between meetings it shouldn't take me toooooo horribly long to fix it - I'm just stubborn ha! \u00a0It'll honestly probably take me longer to remake a brochure with the info than it will to fix the margins <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> - you are TINY!!! \u00a0I wouldn't worry about your muscle mass at all (if you were, which I don't think you were, but just in case!). \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When I swam, I seriously had delts like a football player. \u00a0I didn't work out for YEARS because I wanted to lose the muscle (which I did, but also gained fat haha). \u00a0I am definitely talking to Samuel about how to de-emphasis them in my photos (I wouldn't say no to a little photoshop, bahahaha). \u00a0It is what it is - I'm just happy that I have a corset for the swelling! \u00a0I'm kind of worried now for the wedding band, when we put them on, if my fingers will be too swollen...didn't even think about it LOL<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I did just send off my wedding band to be duplicated for the anniversary band. \u00a0That was scary, mailing it to the jeweler. \u00a0It got there ok, and they have promised to have it back before we leave for the wedding! \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.183.138.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97e4e521825650b4f46a59f9492e7315","RawContent":"[quote name=\"marinah84\" post=\"1886341\" timestamp=\"1423855652\"]\nI&#039;m guessing it&#039;s fairly normal for brides to have nightmares like these before the wedding - someone actually told me that they didn&#039;t think I should have any stress, since it was a destination wedding.  I laughed and told her \"it&#039;s still a wedding, and it involves planning\/coordination\/etc PLUS the language barrier!\".  Oi!\n\n\nI&#039;m lazy, but it&#039;s more that I don&#039;t want to edit my book I made (almost a year ago lol) in terms of updating info - but mostly printing so it looks good.  It was such a hassle with the coloring book, and this is like a 20 pg little book!  \n\nI kind of want to do the book just because I have spent time on it, and it has a great section for guest names\/rooms plus resort info already, and puzzles\/games!  I work on the computer, so theoretically in between meetings it shouldn&#039;t take me toooooo horribly long to fix it - I&#039;m just stubborn ha!  It&#039;ll honestly probably take me longer to remake a brochure with the info than it will to fix the margins :)\n\n@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] - you are TINY!!!  I wouldn&#039;t worry about your muscle mass at all (if you were, which I don&#039;t think you were, but just in case!).  \n\nWhen I swam, I seriously had delts like a football player.  I didn&#039;t work out for YEARS because I wanted to lose the muscle (which I did, but also gained fat haha).  I am definitely talking to Samuel about how to de-emphasis them in my photos (I wouldn&#039;t say no to a little photoshop, bahahaha).  It is what it is - I&#039;m just happy that I have a corset for the swelling!  I&#039;m kind of worried now for the wedding band, when we put them on, if my fingers will be too swollen...didn&#039;t even think about it LOL\n\nI did just send off my wedding band to be duplicated for the anniversary band.  That was scary, mailing it to the jeweler.  It got there ok, and they have promised to have it back before we leave for the wedding![\/quote]that makes sense. Sometimes I find i&#039;m procrastinating things that I actually like to do or want to do! like putting together some of the bouquets and things like that. It&#039;s weird how that happens.\n\nYou know I did think about how in the world this ring will fit on my finger hahah. When I went to NYC in July I couldn&#039;t take my e-ring off while I was there because my hands were so swollen. I&#039;m going to keep a bottle\/cup of water and lemon by my side all day, hopefully every day and maybe put my and in a bucket of ice before heading to the ceremony hahah.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886344,"PostDate":1423841724,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>marinah84, on 13 February 2015 - 03:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm guessing it's fairly normal for brides to have nightmares like these before the wedding - someone actually told me that they didn't think I should have any stress, since it was a destination wedding. \u00a0I laughed and told her \"it's still a wedding, and it involves planning\/coordination\/etc PLUS the language barrier!\". \u00a0Oi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm lazy, but it's more that I don't want to edit my book I made (almost a year ago lol) in terms of updating info - but mostly printing so it looks good. \u00a0It was such a hassle with the coloring book, and this is like a 20 pg little book! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I kind of want to do the book just because I have spent time on it, and it has a great section for guest names\/rooms plus resort info already, and puzzles\/games! \u00a0I work on the computer, so theoretically in between meetings it shouldn't take me toooooo horribly long to fix it - I'm just stubborn ha! \u00a0It'll honestly probably take me longer to remake a brochure with the info than it will to fix the margins <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> - you are TINY!!! \u00a0I wouldn't worry about your muscle mass at all (if you were, which I don't think you were, but just in case!). \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When I swam, I seriously had delts like a football player. \u00a0I didn't work out for YEARS because I wanted to lose the muscle (which I did, but also gained fat haha). \u00a0I am definitely talking to Samuel about how to de-emphasis them in my photos (I wouldn't say no to a little photoshop, bahahaha). \u00a0It is what it is - I'm just happy that I have a corset for the swelling! \u00a0I'm kind of worried now for the wedding band, when we put them on, if my fingers will be too swollen...didn't even think about it LOL<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I did just send off my wedding band to be duplicated for the anniversary band. \u00a0That was scary, mailing it to the jeweler. \u00a0It got there ok, and they have promised to have it back before we leave for the wedding! \u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>that makes sense. Sometimes I find i'm procrastinating things that I actually like to do or want to do! like putting together some of the bouquets and things like that. It's weird how that happens.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You know I did think about how in the world this ring will fit on my finger hahah. When I went to NYC in July I couldn't take my e-ring off while I was there because my hands were so swollen. I'm going to keep a bottle\/cup of water and lemon by my side all day, hopefully every day and maybe put my and in a bucket of ice before heading to the ceremony hahah.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cdcb613803ab9a08ef444c3b1f9c965","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What a great idea, I hope I can remember to do that - I&#039;m going to limit my sun exposure AND alcohol intake until the reception! &amp;nbsp;Then I don&#039;t care if I gain 10lbs the last 5 days, ha! &amp;nbsp;Getting in on Wednesday and married on Saturday makes it tougher, but I am determined!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886347,"PostDate":1423844821,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What a great idea, I hope I can remember to do that - I'm going to limit my sun exposure AND alcohol intake until the reception! \u00a0Then I don't care if I gain 10lbs the last 5 days, ha! \u00a0Getting in on Wednesday and married on Saturday makes it tougher, but I am determined!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"927da2b832619a758b1777ae3a645f61","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1886331\" timestamp=\"1423853623\"]\nI had a nightmare last week that I was stood up at the alter and then my father was there in a Maple Leafs Jersey and splash pants. I&#039;m not sure what part was more terrifying.[\/quote]Bahaha the maple leafs jersey is terrifying.  :p hubby is a die hard leafs fan and love to tease him \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\nI didn&#039;t limit anything and even with my dress stress it still did up!! Haha ok we struggled :)\n\nI was soooo thankful to sleep again once the wedding was over but truth be told I had no issues and\/or nightmares while in Mexico.  \n\nI swear people think DW are free too. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886355,"PostDate":1423860564,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 13 February 2015 - 02:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I had a nightmare last week that I was stood up at the alter and then my father was there in a Maple Leafs Jersey and splash pants. I'm not sure what part was more terrifying.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nBahaha the maple leafs jersey is terrifying.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> hubby is a die hard leafs fan and love to tease him <br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br \/>I didn't limit anything and even with my dress stress it still did up!! Haha ok we struggled <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nI was soooo thankful to sleep again once the wedding was over but truth be told I had no issues and\/or nightmares while in Mexico.  <br><br>\nI swear people think DW are free too. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74cb90ace2bfdd0b8c0e7886a332960e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"marinah84\" post=\"1886347\" timestamp=\"1423859221\"]\nWhat a great idea, I hope I can remember to do that - I&#039;m going to limit my sun exposure AND alcohol intake until the reception!  Then I don&#039;t care if I gain 10lbs the last 5 days, ha!  Getting in on Wednesday and married on Saturday makes it tougher, but I am determined![\/quote]yeah we arrive on sunday and don&#039;t get married until thursday. I&#039;m not much of a drinker because I&#039;m such a cheap drunk haha, it&#039;s the buffets that get me :P. Usually I can offset the eating by swimming all day though.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886362,"PostDate":1423882185,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>marinah84, on 13 February 2015 - 04:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>What a great idea, I hope I can remember to do that - I'm going to limit my sun exposure AND alcohol intake until the reception! \u00a0Then I don't care if I gain 10lbs the last 5 days, ha! \u00a0Getting in on Wednesday and married on Saturday makes it tougher, but I am determined!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>yeah we arrive on sunday and don't get married until thursday. I'm not much of a drinker because I'm such a cheap drunk haha, it's the buffets that get me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. Usually I can offset the eating by swimming all day though.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.113.233.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a45cf8b8a83270f9bb494b7ca43b4010","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Haha I tried to lightly watch my food\/drink intake before the wedding as well.&amp;nbsp; Prob. a good thing otherwise I&#039;d have come 10lbs more&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Same Kim.&amp;nbsp; So much anxiety before we left for Mexico but once we got there most of the nerves and stress went away :).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The good thing for us w\/ the wedding is we did a church wedding first so we kind of had a trial run before.&amp;nbsp; In the church wedding, we couldn&#039;t even get the rings on properlyso we knew for the real wedding ceremony to just put it on the other person&#039;s finger and then we helped push it up ourselves.&amp;nbsp; It looked a lot more fluid than trying to jam it on each other&#039;s fingers&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886372,"PostDate":1423913818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Haha I tried to lightly watch my food\/drink intake before the wedding as well.\u00a0 Prob. a good thing otherwise I'd have come 10lbs more<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Same Kim.\u00a0 So much anxiety before we left for Mexico but once we got there most of the nerves and stress went away <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The good thing for us w\/ the wedding is we did a church wedding first so we kind of had a trial run before.\u00a0 In the church wedding, we couldn't even get the rings on properlyso we knew for the real wedding ceremony to just put it on the other person's finger and then we helped push it up ourselves.\u00a0 It looked a lot more fluid than trying to jam it on each other's fingers<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395594948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9a89409624c63010a93d6f7bc1b43c1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tygrrlily\" post=\"1886372\" timestamp=\"1423928218\"]\nHaha I tried to lightly watch my food\/drink intake before the wedding as well.  Prob. a good thing otherwise I&#039;d have come 10lbs more\n\nSame Kim.  So much anxiety before we left for Mexico but once we got there most of the nerves and stress went away :).\n\nThe good thing for us w\/ the wedding is we did a church wedding first so we kind of had a trial run before.  In the church wedding, we couldn&#039;t even get the rings on properlyso we knew for the real wedding ceremony to just put it on the other person&#039;s finger and then we helped push it up ourselves.  It looked a lot more fluid than trying to jam it on each other&#039;s fingers[\/quote]excellent tip!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1886374,"PostDate":1423916907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tygrrlily, on 14 February 2015 - 11:36 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Haha I tried to lightly watch my food\/drink intake before the wedding as well.\u00a0 Prob. a good thing otherwise I'd have come 10lbs more<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Same Kim.\u00a0 So much anxiety before we left for Mexico but once we got there most of the nerves and stress went away <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The good thing for us w\/ the wedding is we did a church wedding first so we kind of had a trial run before.\u00a0 In the church wedding, we couldn't even get the rings on properlyso we knew for the real wedding ceremony to just put it on the other person's finger and then we helped push it up ourselves.\u00a0 It looked a lot more fluid than trying to jam it on each other's fingers<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>excellent tip!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":254,"TotalPages":26,"CurrentPage":110,"NextPage":120,"PreviousPage":100,"LastPage":250},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
