"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20844adf3fa6ca88334b65af891afcfb","RawContent":"Your hard work has totally paid off! You look fantastic in your dress \n\n\n18 days?!?! Woohoo!!! Can&#039;t wait to see pics!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887105,"PostDate":1424565949,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Your hard work has totally paid off! You look fantastic in your dress <br><br>\n18 days?!?! Woohoo!!! Can't wait to see pics!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410084185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"137.186.96.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c681dfba96ca31f72f8b2d540c1976f","RawContent":"You look great. Wow can certainly see the difference on how toned up you are. \n\n\nYour time is getting so close. I am so excited for you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1887124,"PostDate":1424611902,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You look great. Wow can certainly see the difference on how toned up you are. <br><br>\nYour time is getting so close. I am so excited for you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1421648383","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f42d3449b450ebe6ac896a8e8cbbc7e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HELP!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So my wedding coordinator let me know I can choose vanilla, chocolate (ew) or dulce de leche cake (well, she actually said \"3 milks\" and said it&#039;s \"very milky\" when I asked if that&#039;s what she meant...).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not sure if we get to taste ahead of time or not, maybe? &amp;nbsp;But anyone who has had dulce de leche cake at a wedding before - is it good? &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m a big vanilla fan, cannot stand chocolate cake (plus the dessert is brownie &amp;amp; ice cream, so that&#039;s already covered) and LOVE carmel. &amp;nbsp;So I&#039;m torn?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any thoughts? &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m hoping I can taste test, but that&#039;s on Thursday before the Saturday wedding, and not sure it&#039;ll be enough time!! &amp;nbsp;Then again, it&#039;s a small cake so I doubt they make before Friday lol.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It won&#039;t let me post a poll...hmmm I swear that was an option before...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887253,"PostDate":1424709732,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HELP!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So my wedding coordinator let me know I can choose vanilla, chocolate (ew) or dulce de leche cake (well, she actually said \"3 milks\" and said it's \"very milky\" when I asked if that's what she meant...).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm not sure if we get to taste ahead of time or not, maybe? \u00a0But anyone who has had dulce de leche cake at a wedding before - is it good? \u00a0I'm a big vanilla fan, cannot stand chocolate cake (plus the dessert is brownie & ice cream, so that's already covered) and LOVE carmel. \u00a0So I'm torn?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any thoughts? \u00a0I'm hoping I can taste test, but that's on Thursday before the Saturday wedding, and not sure it'll be enough time!! \u00a0Then again, it's a small cake so I doubt they make before Friday lol.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It won't let me post a poll...hmmm I swear that was an option before...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":254,"TotalPages":26,"CurrentPage":130,"NextPage":140,"PreviousPage":120,"LastPage":250},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
