> Time: 1428955417 / Mon, 13 Apr 2015 20:03:37 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=77321&start=140&SessionId=cf03b096063da7de1a7ba2e294274c2b
> User MissJen3 (278914)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f304132fb3e1528d10560ff93755192","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The 3 milks at our resort is delicious!!!! That&#039;s what we chose. It can be very sweet so if you have a filling option I would suggest balancing it with something not as sweet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887262,"PostDate":1424715436,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The 3 milks at our resort is delicious!!!! That's what we chose. It can be very sweet so if you have a filling option I would suggest balancing it with something not as sweet.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361723426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"385759e96eaf9062734b47a714b92a83","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think you can never go wrong with vanilla but I would clarify about the dulce de leche. 3 leches and dulce de leche are not the same. 3 leches is like a moist, sweet, tasty cake. It tastes like a vanilla cake infused with condensed milk, just delicious. Dulce de leche is also very yummy and it tastes a lot like caramel, but better in my opinion, so you&#039;ll love it! :D&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Whichever of those two it is (dulce de leche or 3 milks) i think your cake will be a hit ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887268,"PostDate":1424719980,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think you can never go wrong with vanilla but I would clarify about the dulce de leche. 3 leches and dulce de leche are not the same. 3 leches is like a moist, sweet, tasty cake. It tastes like a vanilla cake infused with condensed milk, just delicious. Dulce de leche is also very yummy and it tastes a lot like caramel, but better in my opinion, so you'll love it! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Whichever of those two it is (dulce de leche or 3 milks) i think your cake will be a hit <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c9d9daa23d5c486a30cb5495ac9db7c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrsCtoB\"] @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks! &amp;nbsp;Those are great descriptions, and sound really good. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m guessing its the 3 leches, versus dulce de leche. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m all about sweet, so it could be a good option!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:24px;\"&gt;HORRIBLE UPDATE:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:24px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;So before my workout last night, I was playing with the dog and throwing the toy. &amp;nbsp;I tripped and caught myself in a standing position, but heard a \"pop\" in my foot. &amp;nbsp;Turns out I have a fracture in my 5th metatarsal (little toe) and am in a walking shoe for probably 6 weeks. &amp;nbsp;GUESS WHAT HAPPENS IN LESS THAN 3 WEEKS?! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m so upset :( &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m trying to be optimistic as much as possible, of course. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:24px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;The good thing is the pain should subside in 7-10 days, and the shoe is removable so I theoretically shouldn&#039;t be too worried about it, for the wedding itself. &amp;nbsp;The Monday excursion may be an issue, and getting around the resort a lot. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ll have to see if they have scooters and things, just in case. &amp;nbsp;I have an appointment on Friday with the surgeon, to make sure it doesn&#039;t require surgery. &amp;nbsp;Until then, I am chugging ibuprofen\/icing it and elevating it as much as possible. &amp;nbsp;Heal, heal, heal! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887358,"PostDate":1424787164,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"266526\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/266526-mrsctob\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrsCtoB<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks! \u00a0Those are great descriptions, and sound really good. \u00a0I'm guessing its the 3 leches, versus dulce de leche. \u00a0I'm all about sweet, so it could be a good option!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"font-size:24px\">HORRIBLE UPDATE:<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:24px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">So before my workout last night, I was playing with the dog and throwing the toy. \u00a0I tripped and caught myself in a standing position, but heard a \"pop\" in my foot. \u00a0Turns out I have a fracture in my 5th metatarsal (little toe) and am in a walking shoe for probably 6 weeks. \u00a0GUESS WHAT HAPPENS IN LESS THAN 3 WEEKS?! \u00a0I'm so upset <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \u00a0I'm trying to be optimistic as much as possible, of course. \u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:24px\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">The good thing is the pain should subside in 7-10 days, and the shoe is removable so I theoretically shouldn't be too worried about it, for the wedding itself. \u00a0The Monday excursion may be an issue, and getting around the resort a lot. \u00a0I'll have to see if they have scooters and things, just in case. \u00a0I have an appointment on Friday with the surgeon, to make sure it doesn't require surgery. \u00a0Until then, I am chugging ibuprofen\/icing it and elevating it as much as possible. \u00a0Heal, heal, heal! \u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"59bd84b980a1d28f968d17f629363a33","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh no! That is the LAST thing you want to worry about right before your wedding! Crossing my fingers for you that you won&#039;t need surgery. Definitely rest it as much as you can to keep swelling down and promote healing in the meantime. I had a stress fracture in my ankle once and the swelling was really the worst.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just have people carry you around like a queen at the resort! Fanning and feeding you grapes is optional. May not be so bad ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887370,"PostDate":1424791950,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh no! That is the LAST thing you want to worry about right before your wedding! Crossing my fingers for you that you won't need surgery. Definitely rest it as much as you can to keep swelling down and promote healing in the meantime. I had a stress fracture in my ankle once and the swelling was really the worst.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just have people carry you around like a queen at the resort! Fanning and feeding you grapes is optional. May not be so bad <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a37fd9d4ad581bf743c7a2eaf441e826","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"beckys98\"] &amp;nbsp;Thank you!! I told my FI that I&#039;d need to get one of the Rascal Scooters for the resort and the ruins excursion, hahaha. &amp;nbsp;I like the carrying around better, since it comes with food! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887373,"PostDate":1424793341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Thank you!! I told my FI that I'd need to get one of the Rascal Scooters for the resort and the ruins excursion, hahaha. \u00a0I like the carrying around better, since it comes with food! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cd2867de3800efe949d0dd1d9bb9c25","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Haha! I mean, I&#039;ve always kinda wanted a Rascal so it isn&#039;t the WORST option ever :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887377,"PostDate":1424794132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Haha! I mean, I've always kinda wanted a Rascal so it isn't the WORST option ever <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef991fef636c6c3b39340ca0806a7a87","RawContent":"Oh man that truly sucks and I&#039;m so sorry. Hopefully it will be half healed by the time the wedding rolls around and the cast can come off at times, for longer periods of time.\n\nAs someone who got stuck with a non-removable cast for half a summer I feel your pain, but the good thing is that at least you can remove yours to swim and things like that :). \n[quote name=\"beckys98\" post=\"1887370\" timestamp=\"1424806350\"]\nOh no! That is the LAST thing you want to worry about right before your wedding! Crossing my fingers for you that you won&#039;t need surgery. Definitely rest it as much as you can to keep swelling down and promote healing in the meantime. I had a stress fracture in my ankle once and the swelling was really the worst.\n\nJust have people carry you around like a queen at the resort! Fanning and feeding you grapes is optional. May not be so bad ;)[\/quote]that would be the best haha.\n\nI remember when I had that cast, I went to a place that was like a huge supermarket\/home store (i lived in Argentina back then) and they gave me a scooter to get around. I felt like the queen of the store. It was so much fun haha.","Attachments":[],"Id":1887382,"PostDate":1424794911,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh man that truly sucks and I'm so sorry. Hopefully it will be half healed by the time the wedding rolls around and the cast can come off at times, for longer periods of time.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As someone who got stuck with a non-removable cast for half a summer I feel your pain, but the good thing is that at least you can remove yours to swim and things like that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beckys98, on 24 February 2015 - 03:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Oh no! That is the LAST thing you want to worry about right before your wedding! Crossing my fingers for you that you won't need surgery. Definitely rest it as much as you can to keep swelling down and promote healing in the meantime. I had a stress fracture in my ankle once and the swelling was really the worst.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just have people carry you around like a queen at the resort! Fanning and feeding you grapes is optional. May not be so bad <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>that would be the best haha.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I remember when I had that cast, I went to a place that was like a huge supermarket\/home store (i lived in Argentina back then) and they gave me a scooter to get around. I felt like the queen of the store. It was so much fun haha.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.172.122.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9701fbb51fb2310f51ea93944996d555","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh that is horrible. But I guess worse things can happen. Chin up girly and if you rest it and do as you are doing then it should heal faster. Keep us posted.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887383,"PostDate":1424795027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh that is horrible. But I guess worse things can happen. Chin up girly and if you rest it and do as you are doing then it should heal faster. Keep us posted.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1421648383","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05e992ce8a941f027c4f8e272e60b440","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh no!!! Sorry to hear that&amp;nbsp; :( &amp;nbsp;I know you must be so upset. At least now you can tell the airline that you need extra time to get to your seat and settled in! Not sure if your traveling with your dress in hand, but extra time is always a good thing. Rest up and I will be hoping you won&#039;t need surgery!! ::fingers crossed::&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887386,"PostDate":1424796107,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh no!!! Sorry to hear that\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \u00a0I know you must be so upset. At least now you can tell the airline that you need extra time to get to your seat and settled in! Not sure if your traveling with your dress in hand, but extra time is always a good thing. Rest up and I will be hoping you won't need surgery!! ::fingers crossed::<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361723426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.91.171.84","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f23dfd15f7ae9f77e40ef52b85f301b3","RawContent":"@[member=\"marinah84\"] OMG!! That&#039;s horrible!!! Take care of yourself for the next three weeks and perhaps it will be ok by then! I have my fingers cross for you that you won&#039;t need surgery! Sending all my good karma and well wishes your way! Positive thoughts! Positive thoughts!\n\n\nMy FI cracked off his front tooth over the weekend... Right to the gum... Has to get a crown and a post! It&#039;s going to take a month to fix... thank god it happened now instead of a few weeks before the wedding! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1887389,"PostDate":1424796814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275696\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275696-marinah84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">marinah84<\/span><\/a> OMG!! That's horrible!!! Take care of yourself for the next three weeks and perhaps it will be ok by then! I have my fingers cross for you that you won't need surgery! Sending all my good karma and well wishes your way! Positive thoughts! Positive thoughts!<br><br>\nMy FI cracked off his front tooth over the weekend... Right to the gum... Has to get a crown and a post! It's going to take a month to fix... thank god it happened now instead of a few weeks before the wedding! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":254,"TotalPages":26,"CurrentPage":140,"NextPage":150,"PreviousPage":130,"LastPage":250},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
