see your pictures!&amp;nbsp; Congratulations again!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890124,"PostDate":1426798893,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Can't wait to hear about everything and see your pictures!\u00a0 Congratulations again!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413941646,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"80.42.58.225","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8da5eadb8a7c362990d62385b3ea45e","RawContent":"Congratulations!!!! Just read through you thread.....Some great tips there! Can&#039;t wait to see the pic&#039;s \ud83d\udc70\n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\n\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1890328,"PostDate":1427001996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations!!!! Just read through you thread.....Some great tips there! Can't wait to see the pic's \ud83d\udc70<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.215.196.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77321,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":9,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1e3daaaa71acc7811ef661c907fbd54","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So - it was amazing and magical and wonderful! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m still processing it all, and have LOADS of pictures to go through. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ll do a full review of CPC and the vendors I used in the (near) future, after I get my pictures back from Samuel Luna (who is awesome, by the way!)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In the meantime, here are some guest pictures to tide ya&#039;ll over :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding Day:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80515]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80580]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80572]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80573]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80574]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80569]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80570]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80571]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80575]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80576]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80577]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80578]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80579]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Of course, at least one Resort Shot&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80568]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;And Samuel put this out on his facebook page last night - I LOVE it. &amp;nbsp;The underwater cenote ttd session was amazing - one of the highlights (beside the wedding itself of course!)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80581]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Here&#039;s his page:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/SamuelLunaPhotography&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/SamuelLunaPhotography&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Highly, highly recommend. &amp;nbsp;Definitely contact him if you&#039;re considering an off-resort photographer! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ll explain more in my full review :)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Will work on reviews and more picture updates (probably with the reviews) in the next few weeks. &amp;nbsp;Legal ceremony is supposed to be tomorrow!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890399,"PostDate":1427058129,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So - it was amazing and magical and wonderful! \u00a0I'm still processing it all, and have LOADS of pictures to go through. \u00a0I'll do a full review of CPC and the vendors I used in the (near) future, after I get my pictures back from Samuel Luna (who is awesome, by the way!)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In the meantime, here are some guest pictures to tide ya'll over <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Day:<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80515-img-20150320-133035\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_58333.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 133035'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 133035' id='sml_image_view_80515' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80580-img-20150320-133005\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_9254.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 133005'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 133005' id='sml_image_view_80580' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80572-img-20150320-132005\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_83895.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 132005'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 132005' id='sml_image_view_80572' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80573-img-20150320-132025\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_53525.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 132025'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 132025' id='sml_image_view_80573' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80574-img-20150320-132046\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_18955.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 132046'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 132046' id='sml_image_view_80574' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80569-img-20150320-131513\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_58329.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 131513'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 131513' id='sml_image_view_80569' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80570-img-20150320-131849\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_41193.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 131849'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 131849' id='sml_image_view_80570' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80571-img-20150320-131914\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_59737.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 131914'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 131914' id='sml_image_view_80571' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80575-img-20150320-132836\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_85228.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 132836'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 132836' id='sml_image_view_80575' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80576-img-20150320-132844\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_71543.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 132844'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 132844' id='sml_image_view_80576' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80577-img-20150320-132853\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_99513.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 132853'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 132853' id='sml_image_view_80577' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80578-img-20150320-132911\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_80276.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 132911'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 132911' id='sml_image_view_80578' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80579-img-20150320-132936\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_32849.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 132936'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 132936' id='sml_image_view_80579' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Of course, at least one Resort Shot<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80568-img-20150320-080015\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17988\/sml_gallery_275696_17988_191135.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='IMG 20150320 080015'  width='200' height='200'  alt='IMG 20150320 080015' id='sml_image_view_80568' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>And Samuel put this out on his facebook page last night - I LOVE it. \u00a0The underwater cenote ttd session was amazing - one of the highlights (beside the wedding itself of course!)<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80581-11070275-780357076544-4476314916975737198-n\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17992\/sml_gallery_275696_17992_11340.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='11070275 780357076544 4476314916975737198 N'  width='200' height='134'  alt='11070275 780357076544 4476314916975737198 N' id='sml_image_view_80581' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Here's his page:\u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/SamuelLunaPhotography' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...LunaPhotography<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Highly, highly recommend. \u00a0Definitely contact him if you're considering an off-resort photographer! \u00a0I'll explain more in my full review <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Will work on reviews and more picture updates (probably with the reviews) in the next few weeks. \u00a0Legal ceremony is supposed to be tomorrow!<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"32 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids booked!Planning Thread - lots of pictures, DIY\/templates and ongoing updates!<br><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a>","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":254,"TotalPages":26,"CurrentPage":200,"NextPage":210,"PreviousPage":190,"LastPage":250},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
